{"total_count":46,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128","id":5702228745,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABU-EbCQ","number":128,"title":"[完成面][面材鋪滿] 空間完成面→鋪面材（帶縫／交丁）→比對並反推貼板角材，可選網格對齊鋪排","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12244016589,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAAC2czdzQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-04T18:48:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T17:03:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 背景與目的\r\n\r\n使用者 2026-10-05 提出新的建模思路：**先重建設計師圖面上的完成面，再在完成面內以面材鋪滿（帶板縫、可交丁），用來比對角材位置**。就像施工人員在待加工處先擺板比對一樣。\r\n\r\n理由（使用者原意）：設計圖畫的、照圖施工的、完工後看到的，都是完成面，所以完成面是最直接的設計依據。現行流程只能「承載面 → 網格 → 角材」正推；本工單新增「完成面 → 鋪滿面材 → （可選）網格對齊面材 → 角材」的反推路徑，兩者並存。\r\n\r\n現況（main `417f4c0`）：\r\n- `公理層.md` §四〈明確不在本層〉把「施工面材實體、完成面與完成面高程」列為未來的層；D26 面材厚度只是型錄資料。\r\n- 既有 PANEL_LAYOUT（D10a）只用面材尺寸推導**縫中心線網格**，不產生一片片的板；D10b 已有交替相位差（交丁）。\r\n- 概念依據：`geometry-guide/docs/finish-surface-dependencies.md`（草稿，非規格）。\r\n\r\n## 已拍板 🔒（決策佇列 2026-10-05 PANEL-FILL）\r\n\r\n1. 新增行為：在範圍內**以面材鋪滿、完整覆蓋**，用於比對角材位置。\r\n2. 鋪滿**必須帶板縫**，模擬完工效果。\r\n3. **支援交丁等排法**，不只直排。\r\n4. 既有網格系統（含 PANEL_LAYOUT）**保留、不衝突**；不得以新行為取代或改寫其語意。\r\n5. **加入「完成面」概念**；可先重建設計圖上的完成面，再於其上擺面材。\r\n6. 擺好面材後，**允許再插入網格、讓網格對齊已擺的面材**。\r\n7. 方向性原則：由完成面反推與由網格／角材正推並存，不強制單一入口順序。\r\n\r\n細節題 Q38–Q43 使用者「每題按照建議」全部採納：\r\n\r\n| 題 | 採納內容 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Q38 完成面首版範圍 | **已修訂（2026-10-05 STRUCT-FROM-FINISH）**：首版完成面就具**空間位置（高度與方向）**，含外輪廓＋開口（燈具孔、檢修口等）。原「只做平面範圍」作廢。觸及公理 §四「完成面高程」；樑的處理見 Q47 |\r\n| Q39 板縫承接判定 | 「縫兩側的板邊**各壓到角材至少 8 mm**」才算承接（X = 8 mm，使用者 2026-10-05 拍板）。實務參考：角材置中時每側通常 12 mm 以上；12 mm 不是第二道門檻。8 mm **做成具名可調參數**，初始值 8 mm，不得寫死成常數 |\r\n| Q40 無承接時 | **只標示（紅色）、不拒絕**；這是比對工具，不是守門員 |\r\n| Q41 保存 | 只存試排設定（板規格引用、起排點、長邊方向、排法／交丁參數），開啟時重新推導，**不存逐片幾何** |\r\n| Q42 首版排法 | 直排＋交丁（固定相位，沿用 2026-10-01 已拍板「交替、不累加」語意）；人字／斜鋪等另議 |\r\n| Q43 網格對齊面材的依賴 | **引用、會重算**：網格以鋪排為來源（縫中心線即格線）；鋪排移動時網格與其上角材依既有 I8a 先預覽影響、確認才提交。不得一次性複製數值（違反 D6「禁止來歷不明的數字」） |\r\n\r\n## 未決（不得自行決定）\r\n\r\n- 承接門檻參數用既有哪種具名機制承載（D6b 具名常數或 D31 參數）：請在 PF-0 條文提案擇一並說明理由，交使用者採納。\r\n\r\n## 延伸：以完成面為參照反推結構（2026-10-05 STRUCT-FROM-FINISH 🔒）\r\n\r\n使用者原意：完成面像建模軟體中畫好的最終設計模型；設計師專注完成面，我們依賴完成面反推內部合理結構。流程：**空間完成面 → 鋪面材 → 依面材排列補上支撐結構**。\r\n\r\n已拍板：\r\n- **Q44 產生方式**：依板縫與承接規則算出**建議角材**，先預覽，使用者確認後才建立；不得自動建立（與既有「來源子規則不自動建立角材」、I8a 一致）。\r\n- **Q45 中間支撐**：首版**只推板縫下**的承接角材；板中間支撐由使用者手動補，另議。注意：首版推出的不是完整骨架，畫面與文件須明示「只含板縫承接」，不得讓人誤以為結構已完整。\r\n- **Q46 層數**：首版**只做貼板角材**（直接承接面材那一層）；主骨、吊筋、與樓板連接涉及受力路徑（§四 排除），不做。\r\n\r\n- **Q47 樑與完成面構造**：**分層自動判斷、不提供手動**。構造由下往上分層：面材層（完成面往結構側一個面材厚）、貼板角材層（再往上一個角材截面高）。每一層各自比對：該層高度範圍與樑高度範圍有交集 → 樑在該層就是邊界（同牆）；無交集 → 該層從樑下通過。理由：結構撞樑是物理衝突，可由高度直接推導；手動會允許建出重疊的非法狀態。\r\n  - 例（樑底 250、板 0.9、角材 3 cm）：完成面 260 → 兩層皆以樑為邊界，天花做到樑側；240 → 兩層皆通過；248 → 面材從樑下通過、角材在樑兩側停住。\r\n  - 角材停住沿用既有 R6「延伸到撞到邊界即止」，不另寫碰撞規則。\r\n  - 樑下板縫失去承接由 Q39／Q40 標紅；樑下板中間跨距首版不檢查（Q45 限制）。\r\n  - 既有手動「套用投影」是在完成面沒有高度時的做法；有高度的完成面改由本規則推導。既有功能本身是否保留、如何與新規則共存，請在 PF-0 說明，不得改變既有場景的行為。\r\n  - 樑露出部分的包樑面（側面、底面）是另外的完成面。\r\n\r\n推導鏈（物理依據）：完成面 →（往結構側退面材厚度）→ 板背面 → 貼板角材下緣即在板背面 → 每條板縫下需一支角材，縫兩側板邊各壓到角材 ≥ 承接門檻參數（初始 8 mm）。\r\n\r\n實作建議（非採納內容，PF-0 可提出替代）：把**板背面推導成一個承載面**，讓既有角材工具（at-line、between、R6 自動長度、網格）直接作用其上，不另建第二套結構系統；建議角材以引用板縫／對齊網格的方式定位，鋪排或完成面移動時依 I8a 預覽連帶影響。\r\n\r\n切片補充：\r\n- **PF-5 空間完成面**：完成面的高度與方向、面材厚度方向（往結構側），推導板背面；依 Q47 分層判斷樑是否為各層邊界。\r\n- **PF-6 建議角材**：由板縫推出候選貼板角材，預覽→確認→建立；確認後即為一般角材，沿用既有求值與料單。\r\n\r\n## 必須遵守\r\n\r\n- 🔴 **條文先行**：先寫 `公理層.md` 逐條差異提案（D／I／R 編號、與 §四 的修訂），交使用者採納後才實作產品碼。`公理層.md` 是 SSOT，提案階段不得直接改。\r\n- **共用同一套排板計算**：鋪排、既有 PANEL_LAYOUT、D10b 交丁必須共用一套排板／縫位計算，不得另寫第二套（呼應 `geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-20261004.md` 指出的重複規則風險）。\r\n- 試排／鋪滿是推導結果，不是施工構件；不進角材料單，不影響既有角材求值。經使用者確認建立的建議角材（PF-6）才是一般角材。\r\n- 新增可見 UI 入口須遵守 GEO-219 UI 減重紀律：BACKLOG 條目寫明「拿掉或合併了什麼」。\r\n- 範圍外（維持 §四）：施工順序、載重撓度、主骨／吊筋／與樓板連接。完成面高程已依 Q38 修訂納入；樑依 Q47 分層自動處理。\r\n\r\n## 建議切片（供排程參考，非採納內容）\r\n\r\n- **PF-0 條文提案**：完成面（含空間位置與面材厚度方向）、鋪排定義（起排點、長邊方向、板規格引用、縫寬、直排／交丁）、鋪滿推導（整片／裁切片、開口扣除）、承接判定（具名可調參數，初始值 8 mm）、網格以鋪排為來源的引用語意與 I8a 影響預覽、由板縫推出建議貼板角材（預覽→確認）、§四 修訂（完成面高程納入；樑投影依 Q47 分層自動成為邊界）。交使用者採納。\r\n- **PF-1 完成面**：建立／編輯／保存完成面（輪廓可由既有底圖描繪流程取得；空間位置見 PF-5）。\r\n- **PF-2 鋪滿與顯示**：整片／裁切片區分、窄邊條標示、片數統計；縫位與 PANEL_LAYOUT 共用計算。\r\n- **PF-3 承接比對**：縫下有無角材承接，綠／紅標示（門檻參數，初始值 8 mm）。\r\n- **PF-4 網格對齊鋪排**：網格引用鋪排，鋪排移動 → I8a 預覽 → 確認。\r\n\r\n## 驗收方向（細節於 PF-0 定案）\r\n\r\n- 同一組面材尺寸與起點，鋪排縫位與 PANEL_LAYOUT 推導的格線逐條一致（證明共用同一計算）。\r\n- 交丁：奇偶排相位依 2026-10-01 已拍板語意，不累加。\r\n- 開口內不產生板；邊緣裁切片尺寸正確。\r\n- 存檔只含試排設定；重開後推導結果與存檔前一致。\r\n- 鋪排移動時，引用它的網格與角材走 I8a 預覽；取消則世界不變。\r\n- Q47 三例（完成面 260／240／248，樑底 250、板 0.9、角材 3 cm）的各層邊界與角材停點如上表述。\r\n- 既有網格／角材／PANEL_LAYOUT 場景回歸全數不變。\r\n\r\n決策紀錄：`決策佇列.md`（2026-10-05 PANEL-FILL）。Refs `geometry-guide/docs/finish-surface-dependencies.md`。\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/128/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239","id":5848554299,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXJnbOw","number":239,"title":"證據原件發布方式:取代 base64 留言鏡像","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-14T13:19:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:19:41Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"【ChatGPT 研究】R6 完整方案：保留可取得原件、逐檔核對與受測版本身分，改用檔案發布而非大量 base64 留言\n\n**本案由使用者與 dot 決定；以下是研究建議，尚未採納或實作。** 本輪只建立本研究 issue 與 #232 進度留言，不建立 release／分支、不上传原件、不改 repo 可見性或安全設定，也不刪除既有留言。\n\n研究日期：2026-10-14。main 基準 `bfb308db2e63214f741edf3f235f71f49164c014`，開工與發布前核對一致。承接 ops/agent-board 研究看板的 R6；已讀 #189、#195、#216 討論中的 dot／ChatGPT 審查要求、#234 的本機交付界線，以及 GitHub 官方發布文件。以指定標題及 base64 標題搜尋既有 issue，未命中重複項。\n\n## 一、先說結論\n\n建議採 **A：專用證據 release 的原始壓縮包＋manifest** 為大量原件的發布方式；另用 **B 的小型文字索引**供連接器閱讀，但只存同一份 manifest 的逐 byte 鏡像與固定連結，不再另造第二份權威清单。小型純文字收據也可只用 B。\n\nPR 討論改為「一則摘要＋固定來源／原件索引＋核對結果」，保留有意義的審查回覆；不再把整包拆成上百則 base64。**C：只貼 manifest＋SHA，沒有實際可取回的原件，不足以替代現行證據。** 它只能索引已存在且可取回的 A／B 原件。\n\n看板以 #231 的390則、約17.8 MB說明問題；這是看板提供的背景數，本輪沒有重新統計，亦不據此聲稱已實測頁面慢幾秒。base64 只是編碼，不是證據要求；對 n bytes 的內容，單純編碼長度為4×ceil(n/3)，大檔約多三分之一，尚不含留言格式、JSON及分頁成本。這是編碼長度推導，不是量到的整體省時。\n\n**隱私界線：**本輪 GitHub repository metadata 回傳 `visibility=private`。本方案預設維持既有授權範圍，讓使用者、dot及獲准工人能取得原件；沒有把私有 repo 變公開的授權。若「可公開取得」被要求為任何人免登入讀取，私有 repo 內的 A／B 都不能冒稱符合，需另由使用者明示決定公開範圍。本案推薦的是「不只存在作者本機、可由獲准審查者實際取回」，不是公開私人資料。官方 asset API 也區分具 Contents:read 的存取與僅限公開資源的免驗證存取：[GitHub Release assets API](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/assets#get-a-release-asset)。\n\n## 二、從實際審查抽出的要求：不是只看一個綠勾\n\n| 讀到的來源 | 實際要求／限制 | 發布方案必須保留什麼 |\n|---|---|---|\n| #189 [dot 6103556136](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/189#issuecomment-6103556136)、[ChatGPT 6110627894，B1](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/189#issuecomment-6110627894) | 當時本機 scratchpad 路徑不是審查端可讀原件；要對應完整 head、命令、退出碼、隔離／指紋，局部測試不替代規定範圍。 | 可下載的原件、清楚的執行範圍與受測身分；不能用摘要或本機路徑替代。 |\n| #195 [dot 6110042396](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/195#issuecomment-6110042396)、[ChatGPT 6130077063，R3/R4](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/195#issuecomment-6130077063) | 作者本機 audit／突變聲明不等於獨立認證；後續已核18原件＝17 payload＋manifest，仍明列原受核是 ef71990＋dirty BACKLOG，不冒充後來乾淨 head 的產品實跑。 | hash核對之外，必須分清受測版本、實際dirty差異、證據發布版本；不追認以前缺件。 |\n| #216 [ChatGPT 6138671670，R3–R6](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/216#issuecomment-6138671670)、[dot 6139009424](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/216#issuecomment-6139009424) | 首輪與同head補跑依P-077/P-078並列；原件核bytes／SHA／CRC、binary／sidecar、step和runner身分。首紅、partial及各層非零退出不能抹掉。 | 每次attempt獨立身分和原輸出；邏輯路徑數與去重payload數分開，不把補跑拼成同輪首綠。 |\n\n以上是不同時間的案例，不把其中「七job」抽成新的通用門檻。測哪些job、哪些補跑可採，仍依各PR當時的既定裁決。\n\n也已核 [#234 reviewer 6162470634，R3](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/234#issuecomment-6162470634)：該班依看板採本機原件、不增base64；審查者明示只能核Git tree／圖及收據欄位，不能讀Windows二進位原件。本研究**不推翻該次已採用的交付安排、不回頭取消合併**；目的是讓往後遠端研究與審查少遇到無法取件的斷點。\n\n據此整理四個不同問題：\n\n1. **可取得性：**獲准的另一個人／工人真的能取回原件，不只是看見一個URL或hash。\n2. **內容完整性：**下載後與預先固定的manifest核對整包及每個檔案的bytes／SHA-256；不是只核檔名或ZIP可開。\n3. **來源身分：**受測head、實際source／dirty差異、binary／sidecar、runner、command／環境及attempt能連起來。\n4. **結果解讀：**原stdout/stderr、父程序實際OS退出、完成範圍、首紅與補跑仍依原政策解讀。\n\nhash只回答「是不是同一份內容」，不證明內容真由宣稱的測試产生。發布簽章／attestation也不替代實跑收據或測試正確性。下方是這四項要求的發布設計，不是重新發明合併裁判。\n\n## 三、三個替代方案比較\n\n| 方案 | 原件可取得 | bytes／SHA可核 | head綁定 | 成本／風險 | 建議用途 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **A. Evidence release assets：原壓縮包＋manifest** | 授權審查者可下載；必須先實測其工具的驗證／下載路徑 | 整包下載後另核內層每檔；平台digest作交叉核對，不代替本地計算 | 專用tag指向受測commit，manifest記完整SHA／tree／實際source索引／runId | 需發布工具與權限；普通release可修改，immutable需另批准；大型內容不必作為Git blob持續進repo歷史 | 大型日誌、二進位、截圖、完整證據包 |\n| **B. 專用 evidence 分支：原檔／壓縮包＋可讀manifest** | 可用Git／固定commit raw或blob路徑取回；二進位仍需相應下載工具 | 以原Git blob bytes對manifest；簽出行尾不能混成原件 | **evidenceCommit與testedHead分開記**；引用完整evidence commit，不引用浮動分支頭 | 純文字很好讀，但同repo另分支仍增加該repo歷史物件；大包反覆更新增加取件／儲存負擔 | 小型文字收據與A的精確文字鏡像；中小原件的備案 |\n| **C. 只貼 manifest＋SHA＋既有原件定位** | **有實際可取回原件才成立；只有hash或C:/D:路徑不成立** | 可以指導核對，但無原件就無法完成獨立bytes核對 | manifest可聲明版本，仍須來源原件證明 | 已有A/B儲存時成本低；自己不是儲存方案，不能用來掩蓋缺件／過期URL | 薄索引；不能獨立取代原件發布 |\n\n### A 的具體做法\n\n每個受測run用唯一證據release識別，例如 `evidence/pr-216/<head前綴>/<run-id>`；manifest仍寫完整SHA，不靠前綴猜版本。tag精確指向受測提交，不默認指目前main。明標「測試證據，非產品發布／安裝包」，不設成產品latest。一次補證另建新發布識別，連回原run，不覆盖舊資料。\n\n內容用原有壓縮包優先：`raw.zip`或`raw.tar.gz`、`manifest.json`及簡短說明。能沿用原ZIP就沿用，讓整包SHA也不變；只能重新封裝時，標明新包SHA與舊包關係，解壓後payload逐檔必須與原件相同。不要重新執行測試來「補出」替代歷史log。多attempt要各自標明，不只留下成功那一包。\n\n**普通release不是不可變證據庫。** 可選GitHub immutable releases：官方說明其發布後鎖定asset與tag，並產生release attestation。建議先draft、上傳齊全、下載核對，再publish；發布後的新證據用新release，不嘗試替換。設定只作用於往後發布，需管理者另外批准，本輪沒有啟用或核稱本repo已啟用。[Immutable releases](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/concepts/supply-chain-security/immutable-releases)、[Preventing changes](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/how-tos/secure-your-supply-chain/establish-provenance-and-integrity/prevent-release-changes)。\n\n不可變不等於永久可取：release／repo可能被刪或存取權被撤銷，仍要有保留責任與備份。發布標題／說明不能當唯一不可變manifest；權威清單放在實際asset。[Managing releases](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/releasing-projects-on-github/managing-releases-in-a-repository)。\n\n定位記release ID、asset ID、tag及名稱、整包bytes／SHA；不把下載重導後的暫時URL或帶tokenURL當永久索引，不貼任何憑證。官方API會提供asset的size／digest等欄位；二進位下載可能是直接200或302重導。取件工具要驗證實際得到的內容，不能把登入HTML／JSON metadata誤當ZIP。[Release assets API](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/assets)。\n\n採immutable時，授權審查者可另用 `gh release verify` 與 `gh release verify-asset` 檢查發布身分；這不取代manifest逐檔核對。應驗自己上傳的evidence asset，不拿GitHub按tag臨時產生的Source code.zip代替測試原件。[官方驗證說明](https://docs.github.com/en/code-security/how-tos/secure-your-supply-chain/secure-your-dependencies/verify-release-integrity)。本輪沒有執行這些命令。\n\n### B 的具體做法\n\n由未來獲准實作者使用獨立的evidence分支，追加 `runs/<run-id>/`，放原件和manifest；不合進產品main，不讓一般產品測試重新掃進大型證據包。所有交付連結都指向完整的evidence commit SHA。分支只用來維護，不能把 `.../blob/evidence/...` 的浮動位置當既有收據。[固定版本連結的官方说明](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/using-files/getting-permanent-links-to-files)。\n\n**兩種SHA不能混：**testedHead＝執行時的程式版本；evidenceCommit＝日後保存資料的位置。證據commit較新，不表示那個commit曾受測。dirty資料需保留原差異與實際檔案hash，不為遷移而改成clean。\n\n原log保留byte與行尾；未來分支用明確的raw路徑屬性，或直接從Git blob取bytes，不讓Windows自動CRLF轉換造成錯誤比對。可讀摘要另放文字檔，不能就地整理原log。來源的語義正規化雜湊與原始檔案雜湊需分欄，不混成同一SHA欄位。\n\n同repo另分支只是工作區分離，不是免儲存成本：取用該歷史的clone仍可能取得那些大型Git物件。GitHub一般Git檔案大於50 MiB有警告、大於100 MiB會被拒，故不建議把長期大型包反覆塞進此分支。[大檔限制](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/managing-large-files/about-large-files-on-github)。本方案不預設LFS；若另選LFS，審查必須下載實際LFS物件，不能只hash repository裡的pointer就說驗過原件。[Git LFS說明](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/managing-large-files/about-git-large-file-storage)。\n\n現行repo已有可借用的排列方式：[tests/evidence/request-wait-segments-20261014/README.md:3–16](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/bfb308db2e63214f741edf3f235f71f49164c014/tests/evidence/request-wait-segments-20261014/README.md#L3-L16) 把raw.tar.gz、整包SHA、逐檔manifest、分析及metadata分開，並保留失效pilot與後續修正。這證明檔案型交付已有具體範例；**本輪只讀其說明與索引，沒有重新解壓／認證該228檔，也不因此認定其全部發布流程已適用本方案。**\n\n### C 的成立與不成立範例\n\n「manifest寫 raw.zip 10 MB、SHA abc…，原件在作者D槽」：**不成立**，另一位工人無法取得檔案。「manifest有同權限可下載的固定release asset，或固定evidence commit的實際原件連結，另核bytes／SHA」：可以，但真正提供儲存的是A/B。\n\n只剩某次測試印出的綠色摘要、分段原件根本沒生成，也不能靠manifest補造。原件缺失就明列缺失；永久鏈接也不能保證服務永久在線。不得用本方案把R5尚未量到的canvas段落時間改成已量到。\n\n## 四、建議組合與最小資料契約\n\n**這是建議，由使用者與dot決定：大型原件選A，小型可讀索引採B；A的manifest為權威，B若鏡像必須逐byte相同。** 每run保留一則簡短PR入口，其他討論照常。A暫時不能被實際審查工具取件時，先以B的小包／文字原件試行，不宣稱release取件已驗。不導入新的公網服務，也不改現行私有權限。\n\n以下只是建議欄位，不是repo已採納schema，也不要求回頭重寫全部舊收據；用一個sidecar映射舊格式即可：\n\n| 欄位群 | 最小內容 |\n|---|---|\n| 識別 | schema版本、repo、PR、唯一runId／attemptId、原執行日期、發布日期、取件權限範圍 |\n| 受測來源 | 完整testedHead／tree、當時base、dirty狀態及必要diff／實際source index的可讀位置和hash |\n| 執行身分 | 原command／cwd／相關環境、runner和工具版本、實際binary／sidecar及來源閉包索引；不只写目前main |\n| 原始結果 | job與scope、完整／partial／中斷、原passed/failed/skipped、各層exit／signal及觀測者；未知仍寫unknown，不能填0 |\n| 內容清冊 | 每個邏輯path、對應payload、bytes、SHA-256、原始／衍生分類；pathCount與uniquePayloadCount分開 |\n| 包與定位 | 每個archive的bytes／SHA-256、release/asset ID或evidence commit/path、固定入口；取回來源／binary的必要索引 |\n| 歷史關聯 | 初跑／補跑／無效pilot／撤修／還原關係與既有政策連結；新資料是否只重新打包或新增分析 |\n\n不要建立hash循環：先凍結payload，產生逐檔manifest，再打包並計archive SHA；manifest自己的hash與archive hash放在外部小型publication index／PR交付紀錄。manifest不要包含「自己的hash」或「包含自己的archive hash」。下載用的asset ID也可由發布後的外部index補充，不回改已固定的內層manifest。\n\n`source index`的內容必須能取回，不能只有另一個失效hash鏈。可由固定Git commit取得的來源不必重傳一整份，但必須能核實跑來源與該commit的對應；非Git實跑檔、binary和sidecar仍需相應原件。這是可核的引用，不是刪掉證據種類。\n\n## 五、遷移步驟：先能核、再換入口，不先刪歷史\n\n**第一段，試行一包，不重跑產品。** 使用者／dot選一份已完整交付的歷史包與授權發布者，凍結原包bytes／SHA及完整path清冊；新位置上传原包與manifest。若原包由base64留言保存，僅在授權環境重建原bytes，不執行包內任何程式。\n\n**第二段，用審查者身分獨立取回。** 不是用發布者本地檔案作「下載驗證」。先核外層包bytes／SHA，再在隔離暫存目錄核全部內層path／bytes／SHA；比對原收據、來源及各attempt。壓縮包要拒絕絕對路徑、`..`越界、重複path、未允許的連結與超出設定的解壓大小，不自動執行binary。成功後才有「發布通道已驗」這個結論，不自動變成「重新跑過產品」。\n\n**第三段，新增一則遷移索引。** 記舊原件入口→新固定位置、原包與manifest hash、核對者及結果。舊失敗／補跑、原件comment ID和政策關係保持，不把先前缺件改成當時已齊。舊base64留言先不刪；是否清理需使用者／dot另外批准並考慮審查鏈。新run才逐步停用base64鏡像。\n\n**第四段，保留與失聯處理。** 指定誰負責保存和修復失效連結；替换儲存位置須重驗bytes並新增locator，不偷換內容。公開範圍／保留期限／必要备份由使用者與dot定案；沒有刪除授權就不做自動清理。敏感資料先核可見範圍；需要刪減的公開副本須另有身分與hash，不以刪減副本冒充原始紀錄。\n\n此流程不需要新增七job驗收、不修改原test、expected、golden、SSOT或🔒；只驗發布運送是否保真。\n\n## 六、可交給實作者的試行驗收清單（本輪未執行）\n\n| 反例／正例 | 應有判定 |\n|---|---|\n| 另一位授權審查者取回正確原包＋清冊 | 所有path／bytes／SHA相符；同run與原收據綁定成立，才記取件核對通過 |\n| 包少一byte、單檔改一byte、漏一檔／多未登記檔 | 明確指出整包或具名檔案不一致；不能只看解壓成功 |\n| 合法包但testedHead／attempt不屬本次交付 | 對預先指定的受測身分／原收據核對失敗；不能用檔名裡的前7碼放行 |\n| 所有檔案hash相符，但只剩成功補跑，首紅遺失 | 清冊／attempt關聯不完整，不能稱原證據整套搬移成功 |\n| 權限不足、404、回登入HTML、只拿到LFS pointer | 取件未完成；保留原因，不寫原件已核 |\n| stage上传成功但尚未完成／尚在draft、或只有metadata | 不宣稱一般審查者已能下載；由實際取件者驗範圍 |\n| 只有manifest與SHA、沒有原件定位 | 可讀索引不等原件核對，標缺件 |\n| source-head與evidence-commit不同、或舊資料dirty但如實保留 | 按原實跑身分核對，不能僅因保存commit較新就拒絕，也不能冒充新版本已測 |\n| 原exit非0但有既定partial／重跑裁決 | 保留原exit並連政策；發布驗證不自行重判產品通過 |\n| 同內容文字鏡像被編輯／換行轉換、來源指向latest或浮動分支 | hash或固定來源核對失敗，改用權威bytes與固定定位，不悄悄更新原hash |\n\n實作者收據交：發布識別、發布前後取得的實際bytes／SHA、每檔核對清單、授權審查者的取件結果、負例及還原結果、工具版本／原命令／父退出碼。與真WSL產品收據分開標「發布通道驗收」。不以新安全策略、放寬repo權限或公開所有資料來讓測試通過。\n\n## 七、成本與仍待決定的地方\n\n**可預期的改變是取件結構，不是已量到的加速倍數。** A/B把每run原件移到檔案入口，PR可只保留一則小型交付摘要，無需掃過所有base64段才能找到後面的審查。整包下載、解壓、逐檔hash的工作仍在，不能為了頁面快而取消。A增加發布／驗證工具與原件保留責任；B增加Git物件與clone成本；C在已有儲存時便宜，但不補原件。沒有估算實際帳單、延遲或節省秒數，本輪也沒有重測#231頁面。\n\n需使用者與dot決定三件事：採A為主、B為小型索引／備案的組合是否接受；是否對往後證據release啟用immutability及指定發布者／核對者；原件保留責任、期限與既有base64是否保持原狀。私有權限預設不變，任何免登入公開另批。\n\n**最大不確定性是实际授權工具是否能完整下載、解壓並核對私有release asset。** 本輪使用的GitHub `fetch` 合約只接受UTF-8內容、不能取二進位包；因此我沒有把「官方API可下載」宣稱為「本輪連接器已驗原包」。文字manifest的可讀性與二進位驗核是兩個驗收項目；試行必須用真正審查者的工具確認。repo是否已開immutable、長期保存安排及实際效能收益也尚未核定，均列後續，不妨礙本研究交付。\n\n**R6在「需求抽取＋三方案比較＋推薦組合＋遷移與驗收交接」範圍完成。** 不表示發布政策已獲批准、不表示任何證據已遷移、不表示舊PR判定改變。除本issue與#232留言，本輪沒有做repo寫入或產品／WSL測試。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/239/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214","id":5823947943,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWyJkpw","number":214,"title":"驗收耗時分析與不降斷言的加速方案","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-10-13T03:23:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:08:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"【Codex】T4 報告：native 最慢五組占 suite 時間約 63–64%；canvas 尚無 section 秒數，不能誠實排出 section Top 20。\r\n\r\n本次只分析既有證據，未修改程式、未執行 native／Chrome／WSL。認領分支 `docs/ci-time-analysis-20261013` 只作鎖，不開 PR。\r\n\r\n- 完整認領 SHA：`9ebbf81cd87c248b92bfe1a7056c1d0057412d2e`。\r\n- 分析資料及程式版本：`7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce`。以下來源連結固定於此 SHA，避免 main 移動。\r\n- 本文是歷史耗時報告，不是目前 main 的效能基準，也不是新測試收據。所有「省時」均為候選估計，實測收益目前為 0 筆。\r\n\r\n## 1. 資料口徑與分佈\r\n\r\n查閱 `tests/release-evidence/` 與 `tests/evidence/`：可直接讀取的 JSON 中，8 份 `wsl-ci-receipt/1` 全在 `20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/`，含 native 6 次、canvas 6 次。5 對 standalone result／embedded receipt 的 SHA、秒數、exit 相同，僅計一次。另有 Q38 的 WSL `run_all.log`，可供 suite 排名，但沒有整個 job wall time。雲端收據、程式來源副本、只有 WSL 字樣的 PR 文字不混入 WSL 分佈。\r\n\r\n`job.seconds` 含 job 的 build／執行／清理與失敗後 rerun；`seconds_first_run` 不含後續 rerun／清理增量。外層等安靜、暖機、clone 不在 job 秒數內。native 表格時間是 suite 子行程時間，不能與 job 時間混用。不同 SHA／測試數／工具版本，均只是描述歷史樣本，不能做同版本速度比較。\r\n\r\n### native：逐次 job 原始欄位\r\n\r\n| 歷史 SHA | 類別 | passed / failed / skipped | 首輪秒 | job 秒 | exit | 來源 |\r\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\r\n| `345fabb5d5bd37245ed2c73184cee3f6c8322aa3` | 裁判突變，排除 | 2155 / 3 / 1 | 763.2 | 778.7 | 1 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/345fabb5-teeth/receipt.json#L105) |\r\n| `5cc1ffa1ee85120eca14258b86b715151cad274f` | 一般綠燈 | 2158 / 0 / 1 | 781.5 | 781.5 | 0 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/5cc1ffa1/receipt.json#L103) |\r\n| `a7bff8f4c7a0d61a3133b6e42d0d513dfe96367e` | 一般綠燈 | 2592 / 0 / 1 | 1067.2 | 1067.3 | 0 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/a7bff8f4-pr169/receipt.json#L113) |\r\n| `72a3cbf44814d86606531e6fcbd811aeab11548f` | 失敗＋rerun | 2575 / 20 / 1 | 1070.2 | 1088.4 | 1 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/72a3cbf4-pr179/receipt.json#L105) |\r\n| `6615db613a75fbad43116d85251782b5083479df` | 一般綠燈 | 2610 / 0 / 1 | 1167.9 | 1167.9 | 0 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/receipt.json#L102) |\r\n| `798d838741d545f029f68dba69679f83d9cebc27` | 一般綠燈 | 2610 / 0 / 1 | 1173.4 | 1173.4 | 0 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/798d8387-p73-baseline/receipt.json#L102) |\r\n\r\n一般綠燈 n=4：**min 781.5、median 1117.6、mean 1047.525、max 1173.4 秒**。其中 781.5 秒是較小的 2159 項清冊；其餘三筆為 2593／2611 項，median 1167.9、mean 1136.2、範圍 1067.3–1173.4 秒。n 小且範圍不同，不報 p95 或聲稱有退化趨勢。\r\n\r\nPR179 失敗轮首輪 1070.2、job 1088.4，差 18.2 秒；裁判突變首輪 763.2、job 778.7，差 15.5 秒，皆另列。a7bff8f4 的 0.1 秒差不能當一次測試重跑。\r\n\r\n### canvas：完成、中止、診斷分開\r\n\r\n| 歷史 SHA | 類別／結果 | job 秒 | build 秒 | browser 步驟秒 | exit | 來源 |\r\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\r\n| `5bf5a6d5f647ab330a2ec783f30ac25eed96083d` | P73 加計時診斷版完整成功；2207/0，golden matched | 3302.8 | 56.2 | 3246.1 | 0 | [canvas-result.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/5bf5a6d5-p73-timing/canvas-result.json#L92) |\r\n| `6615db613a75fbad43116d85251782b5083479df` | 一般完整成功；2207/0，golden 84 段 matched | 2662.7 | 49.1 | 2613.1 | 0 | [canvas-result.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/canvas-result.json#L92) |\r\n| `c7ed80aa07010cc326a702afff81ef73db4c4ce8` | 還原舊等待反證；P73 中止 1624/1 | 1999.4 | 56.6 | 1942.2 | 1 | [canvas-result.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/c7ed80aa-p73-revert/canvas-result.json#L92) |\r\n| `798d838741d545f029f68dba69679f83d9cebc27` | 一般修前基線；P73 中止 1624/1 | 1846.4 | 50.8 | 1795.2 | 1 | [canvas-result.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/798d8387-p73-baseline/canvas-result.json#L92) |\r\n| `a7bff8f4c7a0d61a3133b6e42d0d513dfe96367e` | 一般 PR；P73 中止 1593/2 | 1628.2 | 45.2 | 1580.7 | 1 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/a7bff8f4-pr169/receipt.json#L447) |\r\n| `72a3cbf44814d86606531e6fcbd811aeab11548f` | 一般 PR；control unreachable 中止 1244/0 | 1239.3 | 56.2 | 1182.8 | 1 | [receipt.json](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/72a3cbf4-pr179/receipt.json#L602) |\r\n\r\n- 一般完整成功只有 **n=1：2662.7 秒**。診斷版另有 n=1：3302.8 秒。若只描述這兩筆完整樣本，範圍 2662.7–3302.8、mean／median 2982.75 秒；這不是一般版本的重複 benchmark。\r\n- 一般中止 n=3：1239.3、1628.2、1846.4 秒，median 1628.2 秒；還原反證 1999.4 秒另列。這些比成功樣本短，是未跑完，不能算加速。\r\n- 四份 raw canvas log 不重複；a7bff8f4、72a3cbf4 只有聚合 receipt，沒有此歸檔下的 raw canvas-job.log。\r\n- 6615 的原 CI 上限 native 900 秒／canvas 2100 秒；歷史 WSL 分別超 267.9／562.7 秒。當時 watchdog 為 ×3，不能稱原 CI 時限內通過，更不能從 WSL 秒數推出 GitHub runner 是否會過。\r\n\r\n## 2. Native suite 前 20 名（實測秒數）\r\n\r\n按兩份完整 WSL 原始 log 的中位數排序，n=2／suite，兩份均 83 suite／2611 項：\r\n\r\n- A：歷史 head `6615db613a75fbad43116d85251782b5083479df`，[native-job.log](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log)。\r\n- B：歷史 head `f0c4c71291af5cab699f54de8ac852aa35fa378e`，[Q38 run_all.log](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log)；該輪沿用已建 binary，外層 job 時間缺失。\r\n\r\n這是跨版本描述排名。A 與 B 工具環境也未完全相同，不把數字差距歸因於程式碼。下表來源 A/B 直接指向原始輸出行。\r\n\r\n| 名次 | suite | A 秒 | B 秒 | 中位數秒 | 來源 A / B |\r\n|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\r\n| 1 | `py:test_axiom_reader` | 204.5 | 202.6 | 203.55 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L127) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L114) |\r\n| 2 | `py:test_model_update` | 173.5 | 175.4 | 174.45 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L146) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L133) |\r\n| 3 | `node:tests-js` | 150.9 | 183.4 | 167.15 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L174) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L161) |\r\n| 4 | `py:test_serve` | 95.0 | 85.5 | 90.25 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L165) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L152) |\r\n| 5 | `py:test_space_modeling` | 73.3 | 77.2 | 75.25 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L168) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L155) |\r\n| 6 | `py:test_scenario_verify` | 59.0 | 58.4 | 58.70 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L161) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L148) |\r\n| 7 | `py:test_bridge_integrity` | 48.2 | 48.2 | 48.20 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L129) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L116) |\r\n| 8 | `py:test_rule_case_workbench_http` | 37.2 | 35.1 | 36.15 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L159) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L146) |\r\n| 9 | `node:polydraft` | 23.9 | 24.1 | 24.00 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L176) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L163) |\r\n| 10 | `py:test_timber_support_projection` | 22.7 | 20.8 | 21.75 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L170) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L157) |\r\n| 11 | `py:test_section_profile_native` | 15.8 | 16.7 | 16.25 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L164) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L151) |\r\n| 12 | `py:test_grid_subdivision_oracle` | 14.5 | 13.8 | 14.15 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L140) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L127) |\r\n| 13 | `py:test_subgrid_contract` | 9.2 | 12.3 | 10.75 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L169) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L156) |\r\n| 14 | `core:run_tests` | 9.3 | 9.5 | 9.40 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L119) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L106) |\r\n| 15 | `py:test_assembly_generation` | 9.3 | 9.4 | 9.35 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L123) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L110) |\r\n| 16 | `py:test_datum_contract` | 9.5 | 9.1 | 9.30 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L131) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L118) |\r\n| 17 | `py:test_reference_contract` | 10.4 | 7.9 | 9.15 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L152) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L139) |\r\n| 18 | `py:test_engineering_model_compatibility` | 8.2 | 8.6 | 8.40 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L134) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L121) |\r\n| 19 | `py:test_infinite_grid_contract` | 8.2 | 7.8 | 8.00 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L144) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L131) |\r\n| 20 | `node:canvas_direct` | 6.7 | 7.7 | 7.20 | [A](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log#L177) / [B](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log#L164) |\r\n\r\n前五組合計 A 697.2 秒／63.31%，B 724.1 秒／64.15%。`node:canvas_direct` 是 native 內的直接橋接測試，**不是**瀏覽器 canvas job。\r\n\r\nA 的 suite 表 TOTAL 為 1101.2 秒；逐行四捨五入後相加為 1101.3 秒，差 0.1 是精度差。job 1167.9 − TOTAL 1101.2 = **66.7 秒**，這含 build、preflight 與 harness 開銷，不能全部叫編譯。B 的 suite 合計為 1128.7 秒。\r\n\r\n## 3. Canvas section Top 20：目前資料不足\r\n\r\n四份 WSL raw log 的 section 標題沒有時間戳，`CDP_RESULT.sections` 值是 passed／failed 數量；成功 log 的 84 段不能轉成 84 個秒數。未以斷言數、log 行數或檔案 mtime 估造排名。\r\n\r\n- [5bf5a6d5-p73-timing：原始 CDP_RESULT](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/5bf5a6d5-p73-timing/canvas-job.log#L2375)；section 計數，不是 duration。\r\n- [6615db61：原始 CDP_RESULT](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/canvas-job.log#L2374)；section 計數，不是 duration。\r\n- [798d8387-p73-baseline：原始 CDP_RESULT](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/798d8387-p73-baseline/canvas-job.log#L1751)；section 計數，不是 duration。\r\n- [c7ed80aa-p73-revert：原始 CDP_RESULT](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/c7ed80aa-p73-revert/canvas-job.log#L1751)；section 計數，不是 duration。\r\n\r\n因此「canvas 哪個 section 最耗時」是本報告**最不確定、尚無結論**的地方。下次正式驗收需收 monotonic section 起訖、completed／fatal／timeout、build／preflight／rerun 時間，成功與中止都寫出。只新增觀測，不改任何等待、時限、斷言或 golden；本次沒有實作、也未另開 WSL 負載。\r\n\r\n## 4. 不減少斷言的加速候選\r\n\r\n以下不是已驗證修法，也不擴大本次「只出報告」範圍。節省分為有依據的毛上限與目前無法量化兩種，不把上限當預期淨收益。\r\n\r\n| 案 | 做法／保持的驗收內容 | 估計節省 | 要改的檔案 | 風險 |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| P0 計時前置 | 記錄 section、每 test、build、preflight、rerun 的 monotonic 時間，保留原來的成功／失敗計數及所有斷言 | 直接省 **0 秒**；目前缺 canvas 定位資料 | `geometry-web/cdp_test.js` 的 `recordLog` 與 success/fatal 結果；`tests/run_all.py`；`tests/_unittest_runner.py`；正式 runner 的計時輸出 | 低；同步大量日誌可能擾動時序，應緩存後輸出；不能把更詳細計時當修復 |\r\n| P1 同版建置重用 | 同 SHA／工具鏈先 build 一次；六個 browser job 各自複製到私有 namespace 並重新做來源、command、binary hash、sidecar／啟動驗證。所有六 job 與全部斷言仍跑，保持單一 WSL 槽循序 | 6615 六筆 build 為 47.8+49.8+46.1+49.1+47.9+49.4=290.1 秒；若第一筆 47.8 保留，避免後五筆的**毛上限 242.3 秒／整輪**。淨值需扣複製、驗證與 cache miss；canvas 自己上限僅 **49.1 秒**，不足以消除其超時 | `.github/workflows/integration-tests.yml` 的建置／artifact 傳遞；受版本管理的正式 runner `ci_run.py`／`ci_job.py`（需先定位權威來源，不改 `release-evidence/.../runner/` 歷史快照）；cache key／manifest 若需要再調 `tests/binaries.py` | 中；key 包含來源閉包、flags、平台、compiler 實際版本；不可共享可寫目錄或略過 #212 的內容／變動偵測。跨 runner 下載成本可能抵銷收益 |\r\n| P2 測試 server 縮短 shutdown 輪詢 | 只在測試 server 設 `serve_forever(poll_interval=0.05)`；保留每測試獨立 server、全部 HTTP 請求、timeout、取消及 cleanup 斷言 | current source 約 32 次 lifecycle，預設 0.5→0.05 的粗略算式 **32×0.45=14.4 秒／native**；規劃情境 **0–14.4 秒**，不是可保證的上下限，實際 shutdown 相位／排程可能改變，尚未量測。不能把兩 suite 的 132.2 秒全算成 shutdown | `tests/test_serve.py` 的兩個 `serve_forever`；`tests/test_rule_case_workbench_http.py` 的 test server | 低至中；輪詢增加可能改變 shutdown／取消競態，須以原斷言及反證確認，產品 server 不改 |\r\n| P3 Reader Node worker（先 profile） | 目前 `render_inline_with_reader` 每次啟 Node；可評估持久 worker、每請求新的 JS context，仍執行真實 inline、全部 rebuild／validate／負例 | **無法量化**。約 203.55 秒是整個 suite，不是 Node 啟動成本；沒有啟動次數與分項秒數，不承諾收益 | `geometry-guide/sync_axiom_reader.py` 的 Node 呼叫介面與 `tests/test_axiom_reader.py`（本次不改） | 中至高；跨請求污染、錯誤回傳與位元冪等必須維持；不得快取測試答案或減少正典完整性驗證 |\r\n| P4 Canvas 等待成本（先 profile） | 對非時間型案例逐一查固定 sleep＋全頁 settle；若明確完成條件更早成立，評估改成等待該條件。race／debounce／toast／timeout 案例保留原延遲，斷言、golden 及操作順序不變 | **無法量化**；缺每段/每次等待實際耗時。不得把靜態 sleep 字面值加總宣稱可省秒數 | `geometry-web/cdp_test.js` 的 `sleep`／`settleUI` 與量測後命中的外掛測試 | 高；過早繼續可掩蓋競態或改變測試涵義，每個案例都需修前／修後／移除修法對照 |\r\n\r\nP1 是整輪成本，P2 是 native 成本；不能把整輪的 242.3 秒扣到 native 或 canvas 一個 job。P3/P4 沒有收益證據，不與前兩者相加。就現有證據，尚無方案可保證 native <900 秒或 canvas <2100 秒。\r\n\r\n實作前的對照方式：同一完整 head／相同測試清冊、相同硬體及 stack；正式單槽循序 A/B，保留首紅與退出碼；每項原斷言、suite 清單、golden 與故障注入都照原樣核對。P1 另驗 cache miss、來源／flags／binary 篡改會拒絕；P2 保留 cleanup/cancellation 反證。不藉並行佔用既有 WSL 槽縮短表面 wall time。\r\n\r\n### 方案與口徑的程式依據\r\n\r\n- [build 重用與身分檢查](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/binaries.py#L562)\r\n- [啟動器逐支 require_fresh](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/geometry-web/start_local.py#L96)\r\n- [suite 子行程計時](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/run_all.py#L462)\r\n- [build／inspect 在 suite 前](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/run_all.py#L892)\r\n- [reader 每次 Node 呼叫](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/geometry-guide/sync_axiom_reader.py#L670)\r\n- [test_serve server](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/test_serve.py#L197)\r\n- [test_serve 另一個 server](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/test_serve.py#L922)\r\n- [workbench test server](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/test_rule_case_workbench_http.py#L40)\r\n- [Canvas sleep 之後 settle](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/geometry-web/cdp_test.js#L96)\r\n- [Canvas 全頁 settle](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/geometry-web/cdp_test.js#L358)\r\n- [歷史 runner 首輪／重跑分開計時（只讀依據）](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/runner/ci_job.py#L540)\r\n\r\n## 5. 證據、修改前後與未驗項\r\n\r\n- 修改前（基底）與修改後（認領 SHA）tree 相同；只有空認領 commit。`git diff --exit-code 7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce HEAD --` 無輸出、exit 0，工作區沒有 tracked 修改。沒有加速後實測，因此不存在可聲稱的「修後變快」。\r\n- 下方是只讀重算的原始 stdout，exit 0；歷史測試原始輸出直接連結在上表，歷史 exit code 與本次分析 exit code 分開列明。重算只讀 JSON/log，沒有 import 或啟動 repo 測試。\r\n- 未驗：當前 main 各 job；同 head 重複 benchmark；canvas section 秒數；任何候選實作的行為不變性／加速幅度；GitHub Actions。[Actions run 38340890534](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/38340890534) 仍因帳務／spending limit 未啟動（steps 空），不當測試失敗。\r\n- 歷史限制：6615 聚合 receipt 頂層工具版本、暖機、互斥只屬最後 timber 輪，不能外推到前六輪；部分呼叫端 exit／逐輪環境紀錄缺失。完整出處與缺失見下方 PROVENANCE。\r\n\r\n[歷史收據 PROVENANCE](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/7d8ec464cda7023727c368ed3bf881217a21e6ce/tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/PROVENANCE.md#L48)\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>只讀重算：原始 stdout 與 exit code</summary>\r\n\r\n命令：`python recompute.py <checkout>`，使用下方附的標準庫腳本；執行環境 Windows Python 3.14，讀本 worktree 的歷史收據。\r\n\r\n```text\r\nREAD_ONLY_ANALYSIS: no native/browser/WSL execution\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"345fabb5-teeth\",\"job\":\"native\",\"sha\":\"345fabb5d5bd37245ed2c73184cee3f6c8322aa3\",\"seconds\":778.7,\"first\":763.2,\"exit\":1,\"counts\":{\"total\":2159,\"passed\":2155,\"failed\":3,\"skipped\":1},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/345fabb5-teeth/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"5bf5a6d5-p73-timing\",\"job\":\"canvas\",\"sha\":\"5bf5a6d5f647ab330a2ec783f30ac25eed96083d\",\"seconds\":3302.8,\"first\":3302.8,\"exit\":0,\"counts\":{\"total\":2207,\"passed\":2207,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":null},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/5bf5a6d5-p73-timing/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"5cc1ffa1\",\"job\":\"native\",\"sha\":\"5cc1ffa1ee85120eca14258b86b715151cad274f\",\"seconds\":781.5,\"first\":781.5,\"exit\":0,\"counts\":{\"total\":2159,\"passed\":2158,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":1},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/5cc1ffa1/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"6615db61\",\"job\":\"native\",\"sha\":\"6615db613a75fbad43116d85251782b5083479df\",\"seconds\":1167.9,\"first\":1167.9,\"exit\":0,\"counts\":{\"total\":2611,\"passed\":2610,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":1},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"6615db61\",\"job\":\"canvas\",\"sha\":\"6615db613a75fbad43116d85251782b5083479df\",\"seconds\":2662.7,\"first\":2662.6,\"exit\":0,\"counts\":{\"total\":2207,\"passed\":2207,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":null},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"72a3cbf4-pr179\",\"job\":\"native\",\"sha\":\"72a3cbf44814d86606531e6fcbd811aeab11548f\",\"seconds\":1088.4,\"first\":1070.2,\"exit\":1,\"counts\":{\"total\":2596,\"passed\":2575,\"failed\":20,\"skipped\":1},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/72a3cbf4-pr179/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"72a3cbf4-pr179\",\"job\":\"canvas\",\"sha\":\"72a3cbf44814d86606531e6fcbd811aeab11548f\",\"seconds\":1239.3,\"first\":1239.3,\"exit\":1,\"counts\":{\"total\":1244,\"passed\":1244,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":null},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/72a3cbf4-pr179/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"798d8387-p73-baseline\",\"job\":\"native\",\"sha\":\"798d838741d545f029f68dba69679f83d9cebc27\",\"seconds\":1173.4,\"first\":1173.4,\"exit\":0,\"counts\":{\"total\":2611,\"passed\":2610,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":1},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/798d8387-p73-baseline/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"798d8387-p73-baseline\",\"job\":\"canvas\",\"sha\":\"798d838741d545f029f68dba69679f83d9cebc27\",\"seconds\":1846.4,\"first\":1846.4,\"exit\":1,\"counts\":{\"total\":1625,\"passed\":1624,\"failed\":1,\"skipped\":null},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/798d8387-p73-baseline/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"a7bff8f4-pr169\",\"job\":\"native\",\"sha\":\"a7bff8f4c7a0d61a3133b6e42d0d513dfe96367e\",\"seconds\":1067.3,\"first\":1067.2,\"exit\":0,\"counts\":{\"total\":2593,\"passed\":2592,\"failed\":0,\"skipped\":1},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/a7bff8f4-pr169/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"a7bff8f4-pr169\",\"job\":\"canvas\",\"sha\":\"a7bff8f4c7a0d61a3133b6e42d0d513dfe96367e\",\"seconds\":1628.2,\"first\":1626.1,\"exit\":1,\"counts\":{\"total\":1595,\"passed\":1593,\"failed\":2,\"skipped\":null},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/a7bff8f4-pr169/receipt.json\"}\r\nJOB {\"run\":\"c7ed80aa-p73-revert\",\"job\":\"canvas\",\"sha\":\"c7ed80aa07010cc326a702afff81ef73db4c4ce8\",\"seconds\":1999.4,\"first\":1999.3,\"exit\":1,\"counts\":{\"total\":1625,\"passed\":1624,\"failed\":1,\"skipped\":null},\"source\":\"tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/c7ed80aa-p73-revert/receipt.json\"}\r\nNATIVE_GREEN n=4 min=781.5 median=1117.6 mean=1047.525 max=1173.4\r\nRANK suite A_seconds B_seconds median_seconds A_line B_line\r\n1 py:test_axiom_reader 204.5 202.6 203.55 127 114\r\n2 py:test_model_update 173.5 175.4 174.45 146 133\r\n3 node:tests-js 150.9 183.4 167.15 174 161\r\n4 py:test_serve 95.0 85.5 90.25 165 152\r\n5 py:test_space_modeling 73.3 77.2 75.25 168 155\r\n6 py:test_scenario_verify 59.0 58.4 58.70 161 148\r\n7 py:test_bridge_integrity 48.2 48.2 48.20 129 116\r\n8 py:test_rule_case_workbench_http 37.2 35.1 36.15 159 146\r\n9 node:polydraft 23.9 24.1 24.00 176 163\r\n10 py:test_timber_support_projection 22.7 20.8 21.75 170 157\r\n11 py:test_section_profile_native 15.8 16.7 16.25 164 151\r\n12 py:test_grid_subdivision_oracle 14.5 13.8 14.15 140 127\r\n13 py:test_subgrid_contract 9.2 12.3 10.75 169 156\r\n14 core:run_tests 9.3 9.5 9.40 119 106\r\n15 py:test_assembly_generation 9.3 9.4 9.35 123 110\r\n16 py:test_datum_contract 9.5 9.1 9.30 131 118\r\n17 py:test_reference_contract 10.4 7.9 9.15 152 139\r\n18 py:test_engineering_model_compatibility 8.2 8.6 8.40 134 121\r\n19 py:test_infinite_grid_contract 8.2 7.8 8.00 144 131\r\n20 node:canvas_direct 6.7 7.7 7.20 177 164\r\nTABLE_A rows=83 rounded_row_sum=1101.3 top5=697.2 top5_share=63.3070% source=tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log\r\nTABLE_B rows=83 rounded_row_sum=1128.7 top5=724.1 top5_share=64.1535% source=tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log\r\nDUPLICATE_RESULT_FIELDS: matched; counted embedded/standalone once\r\nexit_code=0\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>可重算腳本（只讀；儲存到 repo 外）</summary>\r\n\r\n```python\r\n\"\"\"T4: read archived evidence only; never import or execute repository code.\"\"\"\r\nimport json\r\nimport re\r\nimport statistics\r\nimport sys\r\nfrom pathlib import Path\r\n\r\nroot = Path(sys.argv[1])\r\narchive = root / 'tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts'\r\njobs = []\r\nfor path in sorted(archive.glob('*/receipt.json')):\r\n    receipt = json.loads(path.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))\r\n    assert receipt['schema'] == 'wsl-ci-receipt/1'\r\n    for name in ('native', 'canvas'):\r\n        job = receipt.get('jobs', {}).get(name)\r\n        if not job:\r\n            continue\r\n        raw_path = path.with_name(name + '-result.json')\r\n        if raw_path.is_file():\r\n            raw = json.loads(raw_path.read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))\r\n            assert raw['sha'] == receipt['head_sha']\r\n            for key in ('seconds', 'seconds_first_run', 'exit_code'):\r\n                assert raw[key] == job[key], (str(path), key)\r\n        jobs.append({'run': path.parent.name, 'job': name, 'sha': receipt['head_sha'],\r\n                     'seconds': job['seconds'], 'first': job['seconds_first_run'],\r\n                     'exit': job['exit_code'], 'counts': job.get('counts'),\r\n                     'source': path.relative_to(root).as_posix()})\r\n\r\npattern = re.compile(r'^((?:c|core|mutation|py|node):\\S+)\\s+(\\d+|-)\\s+(\\d+|ok|-)\\s+(\\d+|-)\\s+(\\d+|-)\\s+(\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)\\s*(.*)$')\r\nsources = [\r\n    'tests/release-evidence/20261010-wsl-ci-closeout/receipts/6615db61/native-job.log',\r\n    'tests/release-evidence/20261010-q38-i44/run_all.log',\r\n]\r\ntables = []\r\nfor source in sources:\r\n    table = {}\r\n    for line, text in enumerate((root / source).read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig').splitlines(), 1):\r\n        match = pattern.match(text)\r\n        if match:\r\n            assert match[1] not in table\r\n            table[match[1]] = {'seconds': float(match[6]), 'line': line, 'raw': text}\r\n    assert len(table) == 83, (source, len(table))\r\n    tables.append(table)\r\nassert set(tables[0]) == set(tables[1])\r\nranking = sorted(tables[0], key=lambda name: (-statistics.median([t[name]['seconds'] for t in tables]), name))\r\ngreen = [j['seconds'] for j in jobs if j['job'] == 'native' and j['exit'] == 0 and 'teeth' not in j['run']]\r\n\r\nprint('READ_ONLY_ANALYSIS: no native/browser/WSL execution')\r\nfor job in jobs:\r\n    print('JOB ' + json.dumps(job, ensure_ascii=False, separators=(',', ':')))\r\nprint('NATIVE_GREEN n=%d min=%.1f median=%.1f mean=%.3f max=%.1f' %\r\n      (len(green), min(green), statistics.median(green), statistics.mean(green), max(green)))\r\nprint('RANK suite A_seconds B_seconds median_seconds A_line B_line')\r\nfor rank, name in enumerate(ranking[:20], 1):\r\n    a, b = [t[name] for t in tables]\r\n    print('%d %s %.1f %.1f %.2f %d %d' %\r\n          (rank, name, a['seconds'], b['seconds'], statistics.median([a['seconds'], b['seconds']]), a['line'], b['line']))\r\nfor i, table in enumerate(tables):\r\n    total = sum(row['seconds'] for row in table.values())\r\n    top5 = sum(table[name]['seconds'] for name in ranking[:5])\r\n    print('TABLE_%s rows=%d rounded_row_sum=%.1f top5=%.1f top5_share=%.4f%% source=%s' %\r\n          ('AB'[i], len(table), total, top5, top5 / total * 100, sources[i]))\r\nprint('DUPLICATE_RESULT_FIELDS: matched; counted embedded/standalone once')\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/214/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233","id":5842646688,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABXD-2oA","number":233,"title":"PF23/E1 驗收足跡在 SSOT 下無法建立成合法的 D7 場景","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-14T05:46:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T06:50:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"【ChatGPT 研究】PF23/E1 原驗收文字與 SSOT 的不一致，以及 P-103 的驗收分工\n\n研究基準：開工時 main 完整 SHA `0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026`。以下原驗收文件與 SSOT 的檔案連結全部固定於此 SHA。本次為文件與原始碼研究，沒有重跑原生程式或 R43 驗收，不宣告產品修好。\n\n關聯：[PR #184](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/184)、[PF-H PR #227](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/227)、[P-103 裁決原文](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/227#issuecomment-6152304537)。已有 [#230](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/230) 追蹤同一問題；本 issue 依使用者指定標題補充原始數字、逐角色推導與文件修正要求，不主張是另一個新缺陷，也未修改或關閉 #230。\n\n已讀 #227 的 `geometry-core/panel-fill/PFH-E1-ORACLE-CONFLICT.md`。該診斷檔位於 #227 分支，在上述基準 main 尚不存在，不能為它製造指向 main 的檔案連結；其診斷沿革以 PR #227 與 #230 為來源。\n\n## 一、E1 原始數字與出處\n\n來源是 PR #184 所收錄的 **amendment-r2.1-R43 §5**，不是 `公理層.md` 的條文。該節本來就標示「依條文推導，未實跑」。\n\n[geometry-core/panel-fill/amendment-r2.1-R43.md:57–85](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/geometry-core/panel-fill/amendment-r2.1-R43.md#L57-L85)：\n\n- 完成面 `F=[0,1000]×[0,300]`；`s=+1`、面材厚度 `t=9`、角材層厚度 `h=30`，單位 mm。面材層為 `q∈[0,9]`，角材層為 `q∈[9,39]`。\n- 面材寬 `915` 沿 u、長 `1830` 沿 v，直排，縫寬 `g=0`，起排點 `a=(−815,−100)`。\n- `c_u(k)=−815+915k+915`，F 內只有 `k=0` 的 `u=100`；相鄰 u 縫在 `−815`、`1015`。v 縫在 `−100`、`1730`，都不碰 F。\n- F 內左板片為 `u∈[0,100)`、右板片為 `u∈[100,1000]`；有效板縫為 `u=100，v∈(0,300)`。\n- 文件指定角材宿主為該試排的衍生承載面，足跡映回完成面框架為 **`[90,120]×[0,300]`**，承接門檻 `X=8`。\n- E1 障礙：`R=[105,200]×[50,100]`、`W=[−2400,9]`。障礙與面材層有正體積交集，但與角材層沒有。因此 `G_面材層=F扣R`、`G_角材層=F`。\n\n原 E1 承接計算預期：\n\n| 縫的開區間 v | 左側承接寬度 d_L | 右側承接寬度 d_R | X=8 | X=5 |\n|---|---:|---:|---|---|\n| (0,50) | 10 | 20 | 已承接 | 已承接 |\n| (50,100) | 10 | 5 | 右側承接不足 | 已承接 |\n| (100,300) | 10 | 20 | 已承接 | 已承接 |\n\n`X=5` 時仍須保留三段：實際寬度不同，不能只因都通過門檻就合併。E2 把障礙改為 `R=[125,200]×[50,100]`；E3 改為 `R=[120,200]×[50,100]`。兩者原預期都是整段 `(0,300)` 的 `(d_L,d_R)=(10,20)`，分別驗證「沒有影響承接」與「只接觸足跡外緣」。上述原數字均須保留。\n\n## 二、為什麼沒有任何 D7 角色能合法放置原足跡？\n\n這不是單純的「角材層有沒有碰到障礙」問題。`G_角材層=F` 只表示足跡沒有被該障礙切掉，不代表端面、角色及固定條件成立。\n\n原足跡是一支沿 V、寬 30 的料：兩個端面在 `v=0`、`v=300`，正好頂住 F 的外輪廓；兩個長側面在 `u=90`、`u=120`，都位於面內，不貼 `u=0` 或 `u=1000` 的外輪廓。\n\n**primary、secondary、custom：全部被 I19 的外輪廓特別限制拒絕。** I19 除了比較擋面優先級，還明定只有 boundary 的端面可以頂外輪廓；不能因外輪廓優先級為 0、小於其他角色，就認定通過。E1 的端點是外輪廓，不是孔邊或柱面，後者的例外不適用。[公理層.md:968–980](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L968-L980)。\n\n**boundary：被 D15 的角色／幾何一致性及 I20 拒絕。** 該料的長側面沒有貼任何適格外輪廓 FIXED 邊，沒有它實際覆蓋的 boundaryEdge；不能把一支面內的料改名為 boundary，就取得端面例外。I20 要求固定段覆蓋其所貼那條合格外輪廓邊的完整長度，不是要求任意一支料從一面牆跨到另一面牆。[公理層.md:277–292](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L277-L292)、[公理層.md:981–984](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L981-L984)。\n\n`custom priority N` 也不是繞過方法：D15 明定 custom 的數字只參與優先級比較，不取得 boundary 的角色權利。衍生宿主仍沿用既有 D7／I／R 規則，不能另設較寬鬆的放置器。[公理層.md:277–284](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L277-L284)、[公理層.md:1682–1700](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L1682-L1700)。\n\n所以，原文件的「足跡合法連續」至多描述其裁切幾何，不能當成「這是可經 D7 建立的合法場景」。先加端部 boundary 可以改變端面條件，但也會縮短目標料、增加承接集合，已不是原 E1 的同一組輸入。\n\n## 三、P-103 已裁定的分工，以及尚未解除的角色問題\n\n[P-103 裁決原文](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/227#issuecomment-6152304537) 明確要求：\n\n1. **原 E1 數字只作 R43 純演算法 oracle。** 在單元層直接提供足跡集合，驗證承接計算；不經 D7 建立，不宣稱場景合法，不修改原預期值。E2／E3 的原對照數字亦保留。\n2. **另做 E1-legal，驗真正衍生宿主。** 先依 R41 建立宿主，再加入兩支端部 boundary，足跡分別為 `[0,1000]×[0,27]`、`[0,1000]×[273,300]`；目標 V 向料改為 `[90,120]×[27,273]`，端面頂住 boundary 側面。承接集合必須把兩支 boundary 一起計入，重新推導預期值，不能搬用原三段結果。\n3. **同一組實際足跡輸入時，單元算法與真宿主計算須一致。** P-098 的真宿主足跡、移除接入的突變、#221 原生見證，一律使用合法場景驗證。\n4. **驗收文字交後續帳本 PR 修正。** 本 issue 只記錄差異，不修改 SSOT。\n\n**另有必須保留的未決點：P-103 指定 V 向料為 secondary，仍與 I21 衝突。** 兩支沿 u 的 boundary 依 D17 推導主支軸為 v，V 向 secondary 就平行主支軸，I21 應拒絕。[公理層.md:300–305](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L300-L305)、[公理層.md:985–988](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L985-L988)。\n\n#227／#230 已記錄一般 D7 對照：secondary 拒絕，相同幾何改 primary 通過。但一般 placement 的診斷不是真衍生宿主驗收；本研究不替裁決修改角色，也不建議改寫 I21。**P-103 的「分成算法與合法場景」可以承接，卻不能據此宣告其所列角色組合已合法。**\n\n## 四、後續驗收文件要怎麼修正？\n\n以下是驗收文件的修正要求，不是公理改寫：\n\n**A. 明確分開兩種測試。** §5 原 E1／E2／E3 標為「直接給定足跡的 R43 單元 oracle，非合法 D7 場景」；釐清「足跡合法連續」只涉及裁切結果，不能代表角色合法。保留全部原輸入、三段／一段預期與歷史診斷，不把它們改成新場景數字。\n\n**B. E1-legal 另列完整場景與來源。** 角色衝突須先獲明確釐清，再列出完成面、試排、R41 真宿主、h／B 來源、兩端支撐、目標料及合法位置引用。用原生 D7 建立並讀回真正宿主足跡，不能只給一張一般面、硬塞任意 footprint，或跳過 I19／I20／I21。\n\n**C. 真場景預期按全體角材的聯集重算。** R43 比對的是同一衍生宿主實際角材足跡的聯集，不能只挑目標料、漏掉支撐材。[公理層.md:1712–1722](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0eb447e00605f6df117711b03e6c98ccabbcd026/公理層.md#L1712-L1722)。\n\n依 P-103 指定的幾何集合可作下列**推導，尚未實跑，也不構成角色合法性證明**：\n\n| E1-legal 的開區間 v | d_L | d_R | 與原 E1 不同之處 |\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n| (0,27) | 100 | 900 | 下端 boundary 納入聯集 |\n| (27,50) | 10 | 20 | 中間目標料 |\n| (50,100) | 10 | 5 | 右板受障礙裁切 |\n| (100,273) | 10 | 20 | 中間目標料 |\n| (273,300) | 100 | 900 | 上端 boundary 納入聯集 |\n\n因此此幾何的 E1-legal 是五段；E2／E3 的中間 `(27,273)` 合併為 `(10,20)`，加兩端共三段。這不取代原算法 oracle 的三段／一段。验证方法是：角色釐清後以合法真宿主建材，讀回全體足跡，將同一集合送入獨立的 R43 單元層，比對逐段端點與兩側實值。\n\n**D. 分開記錄驗收層級。** 一般 D7 的必要條件拒絕、診斷測試的負控制、R43 純算法測試、PF-H 真接入、移除接入的產品突變，以及 #221 原生見證，分別列結果。診斷 wrapper 因「成功確認拒絕」而 exit 0，不是 E1 建立成功；單元算法綠也不代替宿主整合綠。\n\n## 五、目前狀態與最不確定處\n\n原 E1 無法作為合法 D7 場景的條文矛盾已有清楚推導，P-103 也已指定算法／真場景分工；這不需要改動 SSOT 才能回報。\n\n尚未解除的是 E1-legal 的 secondary／I21 角色衝突，以及 PF-H 真宿主接入與相關正式驗收。本次沒有重跑歷史 probe，也沒有執行上表的 R43 計算；上表是依指定幾何推導的驗證目標，不是完成收據。後续由帳本與實作 owner 依裁決分工處理，不能為了讓原驗收數字通過而放寬端面或角色規則。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/233/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204","id":5803953965,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWfFPLQ","number":204,"title":"[公理][端面] 獨立柱：I19 允許端面直接頂柱面、理由「端面不提供固定」與現場不符；主支不可斷開需另行把關","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-11T18:34:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T12:11:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 現場規則（使用者 2026-10-12）\n\n> 「因為角材的端面 頂到角材才能固定 不能直接頂到RC」\n> 「柱子理應是要有邊角材的」\n> 「主支為什麼要斷開？不能斷開阿」\n\n- 端面規則的適用對象是**靠端部固定的料**，也就是副支。\n- 沿邊料（邊界材、邊界主支、柱邊料）靠側面釘在 RC 上，它的端面在轉角頂牆不在此限（R19(d)，M:994）。\n- 主支是通長承載料，**整支連續、不可斷開**，兩端坐在牆邊的邊界材上。\n\n## 範圍\n\n只談**獨立柱**，也就是孔環。\n\n- 貼牆柱經 R7 投影後成為凹口或轉角（M:933–935），柱邊屬於外輪廓。\n- I19 外輪廓那一款已經只准 boundary 頂外輪廓。\n- PF-0 也會替這類 FIXED 外環邊產生邊材候選（S:1596）。\n\n依據：main e50e8d18（M）與已採納、未合併的 PF-0 堆疊 `axiom/stack-clarify-20261011` 7ad9cef1（S）。\n\n## 問題 1：核心允許端面直接頂獨立柱\n\n- I19（M:665–667）寫明「孔邊與柱面不在此限：……任何角色都可依上面的數值規則頂它」。柱面優先級是 0，任何角色都能直接頂。\n- PF-0 R45(3)（S:1640）：「孔環上的邊不產生邊材」。\n\n**情境**：一條副支線穿過客廳中間 400 × 400 的獨立柱，被切成兩段，兩個端面直接頂柱面。\n\n- I5、I6、R6(d)、I19、I21 都不擋。\n- PF-0 建議流程也不產生柱邊料。\n- 結果：模型顯示一套合法骨架，但現場這兩支副支沒有東西可固定。\n\n## 問題 2：理由寫錯，而且是木工物理寫在核心裡\n\n- I19（M:661）與 D15（M:238–239）都寫「端面不提供固定（固定來自側面釘牆或吊筋）」。\n- 對副支不成立：副支不掛吊筋、不釘牆，只靠端部固定在角材上。\n- 依使用者 2026-10-12 的產品方向，固定方式屬木工模板，不屬幾何公理：\n  > 「木工只是這個『幾何公理』的子集,更像是套用了木工領域部分的模板」\n\n## 問題 3：主支被柱子截斷，核心也不擋\n\n- I19 的柱面豁免同樣讓主支端面可以直接頂柱面。所以一支主支線穿過獨立柱、被切成兩段，核心判為合法。\n- 但主支不可斷開；柱子從地面到樓板，主支也不可能穿過去。\n- 正確結論是：**主支線不能碰到獨立柱（含柱邊料）**。碰到就是排板衝突，要改起鋪角、板長方向或偏移。這跟開口的處理是同一類：位置給定、不可切骨，反推起鋪原點。\n\n## 正確做法在核心裡表達得出來\n\n只要主支線不碰獨立柱，柱邊料可以這樣宣告：\n\n- 與主支軸平行的柱邊：宣告為 primary（I21 允許孔邊料宣告角色）。\n- 垂直的柱邊：宣告為 secondary。\n\n副支頂平行的柱邊料、垂直的柱邊料在轉角頂平行那支，優先級都合法（I19：2 < 3）。所以**不需要改優先級系統**。\n\n## 建議方向（待使用者拍板，未改條文）\n\n1. **核心**：I19 / D15 的「端面不提供固定」理由移出核心，或改成正確的說法。柱面豁免本身是幾何層面的允許，可保留。\n2. **木工模板**\n   - 放置當下檢查：副支端面的擋面必須是角材，不得是牆面或柱面。不等到完工才查；R19(b) 說明完工目標不是不變量。\n   - 獨立柱四周一律產生柱邊料，角色依上面那段宣告。\n   - 主支線不得碰到獨立柱或柱邊料。碰到時列為排板衝突，並列出不衝突的起鋪角與方向。\n3. **PF-0 R45(3)**\n   - 改成孔環產生柱邊料候選，或明寫交給模板處理。\n   - PF-0 是使用者授權整包採納的；改它需要使用者決定。\n\n## 狀態\n\n`公理層.md` 是 SSOT。本 issue 只回報、建議方向，未改條文。\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/204/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211","id":5821626671,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWv75Lw","number":211,"title":"[核心穩定性] 原生核心的堆疊用量超過 Linux 預設 8 MiB:subgrid 與 apply-proj 路徑在預設環境會 SIGSEGV","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-10-12T22:58:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T07:00:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 現象(dot 在 #182 的雲端對照,6133351271、6133463509)\n- 預設 8 MiB 堆疊(GCC 14.2.0、glibc 2.41、x86_64)下,有兩例在 **main 1bf66102 與 #182 head 都會 -11(SIGSEGV)**,stdout/stderr 是空的:\n  - subgrid-local.scene 的 core;\n  - StaggerModelCompatibility 第 8 個 source(加上 subgrid lattice-cell)的 model-base。後者被 modeling/base.py 轉成 UNSUPPORTED / BASE_PROTOCOL,而不是正常的領域拒絕。\n- 反組譯算出的同時存活 frame 下限:main→apply_subgrid_line 約 8,740,976 bytes;bridge 的 apply_applyproj_line→proj_rebind_aux→reference_fragment_candidate 約 8,733,048 bytes。兩者都超過 8 MiB。\n- 正式 workflow 跑 native 前先設 `ulimit -s 16384`(integration-tests.yml 第 25 行),所以 CI 等價裁判看不到這個問題。\n\n## 為什麼要處理\n- Linux 預設堆疊就是 8 MiB。開發者在一般環境直接跑,或任何沒有調高堆疊的執行環境,都會在這些路徑崩潰,而且只得到空輸出,不是可讀的錯誤。\n- 有一例會被誤報成 UNSUPPORTED。\n\n## 要做的\n1. 找出佔用大量堆疊的局部變數(看起來是 World 等大型結構放在堆疊上),改成 heap 或靜態配置,讓這些路徑在 8 MiB 內安全通過。\n2. 補回歸測試:在 `ulimit -s 8192` 下跑這兩例必須正常結束;突變(改回堆疊配置)要變紅。\n3. 修好之後評估能否移除 workflow 的 `ulimit -s 16384`,讓 CI 跟一般環境一致。\n\n另一個可靠性線索(dot 同則留言):Canvas 停在 M8 apply-proj 時,direct adapter 在 bridge 關閉後沒有 reject pending promise。這屬於 #209 的範圍,一併追。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/211/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198","id":5799628956,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABWa9QnA","number":198,"title":"core: classify_rect_outline 以四角計數判定接觸,凹口與尖脊會誤判(GEO-257 同類)","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-11T09:02:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:15:37Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"反例由原始碼推導,尚未實跑;修正須測試先行,先實跑確認。關聯:GEO-257(PR #192)\n\n## 缺陷\n\n`current_geometry.c:10459` 的 `classify_rect_outline` 以「4 個角點各有幾個在環內」代理足跡與輪廓的接觸判定，且只有 `inside<4` 時才進行裁切：\n\n- `inside==4`：跳過裁切，跨凹口的矩形會被推得為 `HOLE`，而 `out` 矩形包含環外區域。\n- `inside==0`：直接回傳 `false`，尖脊穿入矩形時會被推得為無接觸，靜默漏掉。\n\n與 GEO-257（`poly_contains_rect`，PR #192）同型：把角點計數當成包含／接觸的代理，凹口與尖脊兩個方向都可能判錯。\n\n草稿所述判定流程：\n\n1. 以 `poly_contains_point` 計算四角在內的數量（`:10471-10475`）；`inside==0` 即回傳 `false`。\n2. `inside<4` 時才用嚴格穿過矩形內部的輪廓邊裁切，並以邊中點 +1 判斷哪側是內部，收縮 `u0/u1/v0/v1`（`:10478-10513`）；裁切退化則回傳 `false`。\n3. `inside==4` 跳過裁切，直接進貼邊計數。\n4. `side_flush_outline` 計算貼邊（`:10516-10529`）：0 = `HOLE`、1 = `NOTCH`、2 鄰邊 = `CORNER`、2 對邊或 ≥3 = `SPLIT`；`out_*` 回傳裁切後的矩形。\n\n公理依據為 R7 的「足跡 × 輪廓接觸關係」：完全在內才是 hole；貼一邊是 notch；貼兩鄰邊是 corner；貫穿／貼對邊是 strip（樑條帶）／split（柱拆片）；角點相切為退化拒絕，不猜。\n\n## 影響\n\n以下為原始碼推導的影響，尚待實跑確認：\n\n- **R7 分類與 R8 快照衍生**：`apply-proj` 可能鑽錯孔或漏列障礙，`obstacles` 清單與前端 ghost 可能顯示錯誤接觸區域或缺少實際接觸的柱。\n- **R14 逐項選片**：同一函式用於對「原片 + 交易內新片」分類，可能放過跨拆分線的項目；此為待另行建立反例驗證的風險。\n- **R15 指定項不存在即整筆拒絕**：幾何上確實接觸的柱若被漏出快照障礙清單，後續指定 `apply-proj` 時可能被誤認為「不存在」，導致整筆拒絕。\n\n草稿列出的三處呼叫點：\n\n| 呼叫點（草稿行號） | 使用方式 | 相關條文 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `current_geometry.c:10586`，`world_face_obstacles` | 分類平面面上的柱足跡，產生快照障礙清單，供 `obstacles <bid>` 與 ghost 使用 | R7、R8 |\n| `current_geometry.c:11241`，`proj_apply_one` 的 STRIP 分支 | 對 `cut-strip` 樑條帶矩形再分類，進入鑽孔或拆片路徑 | R7、R12 |\n| `current_geometry.c:11512`，`apply-proj` 交易主體 | 對原片與新片逐一分類，尋找唯一接觸片 | R14、R15 |\n\n## 反例\n\n### 反例 A：四角全在內、矩形卻跨凹口 → 誤判 HOLE\n\n**精確輸入**\n\n- 輪廓（與 GEO-257 相同）：`[0,0],[100,0],[100,100],[60,100],[60,40],[40,40],[40,100],[0,100]`。\n- 幾何形狀：100×100 方形，頂緣 `u∈(40,60)` 開槽凹到 `v=40`，槽區在外。\n- 矩形：`[30,70]×[50,80]`，即 `u0=30,u1=70,v0=50,v1=80`。\n\n**依原始碼推得的現行結果（尚未實跑）**\n\n1. 四角 `(30,50)(70,50)(70,80)(30,80)` 都在主體內。\n2. 因此 `inside==4`，跳過裁切。\n3. 矩形四側都不與輪廓邊共線，因此 `flush=0`。\n4. 推得 **`OBSTACLE_HOLE,out=[30,70]×[50,80]`**。\n\n**幾何交集與錯誤所在**\n\n矩形與輪廓的交集是 **`[30,40]×[50,80]` 與 `[60,70]×[50,80]` 兩個不相連區域**。中間帶 `[40,60]×[50,80]` 的兩側 `u=40`、`u=60` 是輪廓邊界，兩側之間的 `(40,60)×[50,80]` 在環外。因此依 R7，原矩形不是「完全在內」；回傳整個 `out=[30,70]×[50,80]` 會把環外區域當成接觸面積。\n\n若套用流程把整個矩形當孔，孔的部分邊界與內部會跨到外環之外；是否進入鑽孔、何處拒絕或能否提交，須以 `apply-proj` 實跑及重驗結果確認。`obstacles`／ghost 的分類與接觸矩形亦須核對。\n\n### 反例 B：四角全在外、尖脊穿入矩形 → 漏判無接觸\n\n**精確輸入**\n\n- 輪廓：`[0,0],[100,0],[100,50],[60,50],[60,90],[40,90],[40,50],[0,50]`。\n- 幾何形狀：底座 100×50，`u∈(40,60)` 有尖脊升到 `v=90`。\n- 矩形：`[20,80]×[70,80]`，即 `u0=20,u1=80,v0=70,v1=80`；橫帶穿過尖脊上半段。\n\n**依原始碼推得的現行結果（尚未實跑）**\n\n1. 四角 `(20,70)(80,70)(80,80)(20,80)` 都在輪廓外。\n2. 因此 `inside==0`。\n3. 推得直接 **回傳 `false`（無接觸）**。\n\n**幾何交集與錯誤所在**\n\n矩形與尖脊的交集是 **`[40,60]×[70,80]`**，有正面積接觸，不能判為無接觸，應進入障礙清單（條帶貫穿段）。\n\n若柱足跡被靜默丟出快照清單，後續 `apply-proj <bid> c<N>` 會依 R15 對不存在的指定項整筆拒絕，ghost 亦看不到它。此下游結果尚待實跑；最終分類與套用結果仍須依公理及其他合法性條件驗證，不能僅由「有接觸」宣稱整筆套用必定成功。\n\n## 狀態\n\n**待修／待實跑確認。上述程式輸出與下游影響均為原始碼推論，尚無本工單的執行證據。**\n\n修正須測試先行：先使用上述精確輸入實跑確認並建立會失敗的回歸測試，再修正實作，記錄修正前後的結果。\n\n沿用草稿的確認方法：\n\n1. 用反例 A 的輪廓建立 `boundary`，以 `placement` 放置平面，再放置足跡為 `[30,70]×[50,80]` 的 `column`。\n2. 執行 `obstacles <bid>`，核對分類是否為 hole、回傳矩形是否包含凹口的環外區；再執行 `apply-proj <bid> c<N>`，記錄實際套用／拒絕與後續重驗結果。\n3. 用反例 B 的輪廓與 `[20,80]×[70,80]` 柱足跡同法確認，核對障礙清單、分類、接觸矩形及 `apply-proj` 的拒絕原因。\n4. 在 `run_tests.py` 加入能釘住上述差異的 reject／expect：A 不應把跨凹口的整個矩形當作完全在內的 hole；B 不應漏判正面積接觸。可套用性須連同相關公理驗證。\n\n依草稿記錄，GEO-257 的 `poly_contains_rect` 修正位於 PR #192，本項 `classify_rect_outline` 未含於其內。\n\n## 來源\n\n- 使用者提供的 `CLASSIFY-RECT-OUTLINE-TICKET.md`，其中「工單草稿」與反例 A、B 的原始碼推導。\n- GEO-257 稽核延伸；草稿記錄另一 agent 回報 `current_geometry.c:10459` 有同型問題。\n- 關聯：[GEO-257／PR #192](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/192)。\n- 草稿基準為 `origin/main`，未提供固定 commit SHA；上述程式行號沿用草稿，接手實跑時須記錄實際 SHA 並重新核對行號。`current_geometry.c` 為 CRLF。\n- 規格依據：[公理層.md](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/main/%E5%85%AC%E7%90%86%E5%B1%A4.md) 的 R7、R8、R12、R14、R15。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/198/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166","id":5756284923,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABVxnv-w","number":166,"title":"[跨模型審查] 三方判斷都可能偏：只累積可對帳主張，不採信共識","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-08T05:11:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T11:52:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"依 owner 要求寫入，供之後讀專案的模型一併看到。這不是驗收結論，不關 #123，不批准合併，也不代替 `公理層.md`。\n\n來源：2026-10-08 另一家模型對 #162 / #165 / #152 的交叉核對。當時讀到的 head：\n\n- #162 `bc1f6fea2f1d10b29d1e6db1917b2781377d8864`（對過 `tests/integration/save_roundtrip_acceptance.cjs`、`tests/integration/model_library_history_browser.py` 原文，沒有重跑瀏覽器）\n- #165 `45ccd3be721fe32fac468ab7cba6d88657c810b3`，其正文仍把 #162 釘在舊 head `c0e58e2f78b4412a2ff4ef48700cd41ab3cc79ea`\n- #152 本體沒改產品；瀏覽器紀錄仍分環境，不能混成幾何驗收\n\nhead 再往前，本 issue 的具體例子作廢，規則不作廢。\n\n## 規則\n\n三方模型都可能偏。投票、平均或「最完整的那家」不能當通過。三方文字一致也不算通過。\n\n每條審查只能落在三類之一：\n\n1. 位元事實：head、檔案、hash、exit、assertion 原文。不採信模型轉述，只採信可重算的收據。\n2. oracle 有沒有蓋住該失敗：必須有故意弄壞的負控制。沒有紅燈，綠燈無意義。\n3. 該不該合併、算不算產品 bug：模型只能列差異，不能關單。「獨立審查未發現實質問題」不是關門條件。\n\n維持分歧帳，不維持共識帳。\n\n- 先釘一個 head。過期 head 的意見整段作廢，不能與新 head 混用。\n- 每家只交主張，格式固定：主張、反證會是什麼、證據路徑與 hash、沒查什麼。沒有反證條件的句子不採納。\n- 三方都指出、且負控制能打紅的，當缺口，不當結論。只有一家指出的，先做負控制，不表決。三方都沒寫的，預設沒人看過。\n- 綠燈必須綁 harness hash。oracle 一改，舊的 35/35、33/33 作廢，只重跑那一支，不重跑整庫來冒充。\n- 模型不合併、不改狀態標籤、不把「未驗」寫成「通過」或「失敗」。做完、驗收通過、已整合繼續拆開（見 #152）。\n- owner 只看短表：head、主張、反證、收據 hash、狀態（缺口／未驗／未決）。衝突時以能重算出不同結果的那份為準；都只能口頭推理時標未決。\n\n## 當時對得上原文的例子（綁 `bc1f6fe`，之後要重查）\n\n這些是驗收漏網，不是已重現的產品 bug。\n\n- `save_roundtrip_acceptance.cjs` 的取消／寫入失敗用 `semantic(snap())`，丟掉 `undo`、`redo`、`dirty`。同檔壞檔匯入用完整 `snap()`。`saved`、`downloaded` 根本不在 `snap()` 裡。\n- 該 stub 只記 showSaveFilePicker 有被呼叫，沒有在呼叫當下記 `navigator.userActivation.isActive`。這不等於 OS picker 已驗。\n- `model_library_history_browser.py` 的 `durable()` 只留 world／models／context／undo 長度／redo 長度／project。`state()` 已取 `operation`，比較時丟掉。等長換 history entry 會過。後補的 historyOwner 若只釘當前 frame／頂端，仍不是深比對。\n- 保存腳本錯誤訊息寫 non-default port，實際只要求 port 非空；8765 不會被擋。模型庫那支有 `port not in (None, 8765)`。\n- PR161 十項中途保護、舊 155 項的 `browser_ui.py`／oracle 前序，不能用新的 35／33 冒充。\n- #165 兩次 390px 都在 P70「配置卡片可拖動且不改錨定幾何」停住（cx/cy 前後同為 500/328），沒進 P88。規則線是未驗；P70 本身是該候選上的失敗，不是「沒走到」。不要綁成同一項。\n- 遠端 CI 7 jobs 在 step 啟動前失敗、annotation 為帳務／支出上限，是環境受阻，不是產品紅燈，也不是遠端通過。\n\n## 讀到這則時不要做的事\n\n- 不要因本 issue 關掉 #162、#123 或任何產品工單。\n- 不要把本 issue 當成已套用的 harness 補丁。補丁若尚未進分支，舊綠燈仍綁舊 harness。\n- 不要為了「對齊三方」而改寫舊收據的 head 或狀態。\n\n## 2026-10-08 補充（同一家，仍未重跑）\n\n這段是規則的使用限度，不是新驗收。\n\n- 同一檔已有較強斷言、鄰近路徑卻不用，優先於想像中的漏網。取消路徑用 `semantic()`、壞檔匯入用完整 `snap()`，就是這種。\n- PR 留言裡的 diff 不是分支狀態。#162 留言裡那份 harness 補丁（當時寫的 patch SHA-256 `81d45af293480df737653750892ecd0c2034bc5d81c46343e30c9b748104b0b2`）未進 `bc1f6fe`。讀到留言不要當成已套用。\n- 作者回報的 35/35、33/33，在當天限定靜態審查裡只核了 census，沒有獨立執行，也沒拿到該輪原始證據包。不得把這個數字升格成獨立驗證。\n- 環境分歧併列，不取較好看的那份。#152 的 sandbox AF_UNIX blocked 與本機 Windows 19/20 同時保留；兩份都不是該 head 的 browser pass。\n- 不要為了補證據而重跑已綠的整套，也不要為了帳務阻塞去重跑同一個已知失敗的 CI run。記 run id 與 annotation 即可。\n- 本 issue 沒有掛進 `AGENTS.md`。只讀 `AGENTS.md` 或 `公理層.md` 的模型不會自動看到。這不是要求馬上改 `AGENTS.md`。\n- 引用本 issue 例子時保留限度：沒有重跑瀏覽器，沒有重算證據 tar，沒有把 `77c3847..c0e58e2f` 的 `app.js` 97 行差縮到某一行。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/166/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142","id":5716879983,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABVMCqbw","number":142,"title":"[功能驗收][E2E] 全面功能審查與使用者完整操作旅程，缺陷修復後獨立複驗","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-05T18:11:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T18:11:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 目的與授權\n使用者於 2026-10-05 明確要求新增獨立工作佇列：全面功能性審查，以及使用者端到端流程是否能成功。此單與開發並行，不能以模組測試數量、CI 綠燈或文件已合併代替產品驗收。\n\n## 執行原則\n- 先核對最新 main、活躍 PR、執行者與檔案 ownership；固定每輪完整 SHA/runtime。main 與候選分支證據分開，不將舊版失敗直接列為新版現況。\n- 從正式 UI、全新專案與乾淨瀏覽器開始；API/native dump 可作核對 oracle，不可代替使用者操作來宣稱流程通過。\n- 複用已核對版本、步驟和原始證據的既有驗收；其餘補實測，避免每位 agent 重跑全部套件。\n- 平行拆分流程、幾何/保存資料核對與獨立複查；共享產品檔仍交既有唯一 owner 修復，不競寫。#54 不接管，僅記錄正式入口觀察並回交原 owner。\n\n## 功能與旅程矩陣\n每列記錄正式入口、使用者目的、前置條件、步驟、獨立預期、SHA/runtime、實際結果、截圖/下載檔/日誌、缺陷與複驗鏈結。\n- [ ] 空白建立、範例及 PDF/圖片匯入、校準、描邊、建立面與空間；核對凹形/孔洞等既有支援幾何，畫面與原生頂點/尺寸一致\n- [ ] 參數建立、套用及修改，影響預覽、確認/取消、來源追溯與模型更新；含正式網格可用入口與限制\n- [ ] 網格來源→配置→承載面→子網格→選格/選線/引用；跨面共享來源與編輯後結果\n- [ ] 組構規則→材料/角材來源→綁定→既有有限生成→模型/料單；不得將未授權未實作範圍當作已提供功能\n- [ ] 多房間、共享來源與獨立房間顯示狀態，跨工作區切換；銜接既有 T4 缺陷，不重複修復\n- [ ] 圖面證據、A/B 方案及規則試驗台：main 現有能力和 PR 候選分列，接線後再驗正式流程\n- [ ] 每條可保存旅程：真下載完整 .gcanvas→關閉→新空白專案重開→繼續編輯→復原/重做；核對幾何、來源、引用、草稿、附件與顯示狀態\n- [ ] 正常流程通過後，補取消、返回、連點、中途關閉、失敗重試、舊結果晚到、保存失敗保留原資料\n- [ ] 桌面與窄版的入口可見、可點、焦點/鍵盤、文字與幾何可讀；實體 iOS/Android、IME、OS picker/下載、跨瀏覽器另列未驗，不以 390px 模擬冒充\n\n## 缺陷處理與交付\n1. 首輪先驗高頻正常流程與資料保存，P0/P1 或主流程中斷立即回報 exact SHA、最短重現、預期/實際與 owner。\n2. 每個缺陷須區分：已重現、疑點、未驗、環境受阻、已修待複驗、同版複驗通過。禁止遇第一個阻塞就把其他獨立旅程全部停下。\n3. 修復由對應 owner 進行；獨立驗收者使用修復後同 SHA 重跑原始失敗旅程及相關回歸。不要為過關降低斷言、放寬 freshness、跳過正常步驟。\n4. 可公開的合成場景、檢查腳本、驗收矩陣與結果主動提交到独立分支並開 draft PR，核對遠端 head；私人設計稿/PDF/使用者資料不得順帶公開。完成回報附 PR、完整 SHA、實跑命令與 exit code、明列未驗/阻塞。\n5. 此單是功能驗收總佇列，與 #118 架構/測試效益、#123 視覺整合互相連結，但不以其中任何一項替代其他。#24/#62 等專項人工驗收保留。\n\n## 完成條件\n所有盤點到的已提供功能均有旅程覆蓋狀態；關鍵正常流程與保存重開在指定整合版本通過；已發現缺陷已修並獨立複驗，或明确保留未完成子項。阻塞、尚未實作及待實體驗收不算通過；不能因報告 PR 合併就自動關閉本單。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/142/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123","id":5700306484,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABU8PGNA","number":123,"title":"[UI整合] 依10/04全面審查統一六工作區介面與操作流程","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-04T14:45:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T14:45:12Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 來源與授權\n使用者2026-10-04提供《UI設計全面審查.zip》並要求加入工作佇列。核心文件UI-REVIEW-SPEC-2026-10-04.md、UI-UX再審查報告、面內v3與空間建模v2修正稿。報告列43項（P1 12/P2 25/P3 6），這是附件作者的審查分級，需對目前程式/真實操作逐項複核，不宣稱43項均已實證。示意圖為1382×804原始碼重建，非真瀏覽器驗收；900/390px、觸控、預覽後與已建立空間仍待實測。\n\n## 排程與唯一責任\n獨立於#116 B游標/右鍵選單；#116已由使用者交給本地Codex，本項不取代它。先盤點/對照/整理tokens，再分段實作；共享app.js/app.css/index/project UI修改須協調#116和#77/PR114唯一writer。3D space-workspace與#119材料牆完整性修正協調，不能重排時覆蓋新功能。先完成正在進行的正常流程修復/整合，不另做平行底層系統。\n\n## 階段\n- [ ] S0 逐項將43項對照最新main，標實證/已解/待核；記錄原規格與修正稿衝突，盤點DOM/command/transaction依賴\n- [ ] S1 共用tokens與標頭：accent/文字/框線/柱樑/網格顏色；按鈕/輸入/分段/圖示/kbd/縮放列；SVG使用computed styles。桌面56px單列WorkspaceHeader，左返回/麵包屑/狀態，中工具，右undo/redo/保存狀態/檔案；既有projectBar整合而非再加一列，<=560px才雙列\n- [ ] S2 網格流程：對齊頂點圖移到右欄step2、主要操作靠右、捨棄置左並工作區內確認、預覽後保存提示、共用九點選擇與術語、隔離刪除操作\n- [ ] S3 面內：左欄純圖層；底圖入口納入圖層；料單移構件→角材；參考線/角材/網格子分段一次一表單；去重工具但保留R及現有操作契約；框選提示僅相關狀態顯示\n- [ ] S4 空間/三視圖：柱樑放置與尺寸移平面工具列；尺寸/格線/座標/吸附呈現；常駐空槽入口；三視圖右欄240px和空狀態；工作面選擇按工具顯示、工具術語/整列點擊統一。新增吸附若超出現有幾何契約需另提案，不假借UI改公理\n- [ ] S5 3D建模：共用標頭；歡迎區單主要範例；右欄1來源/2幾何/3預覽與建立；無來源隱藏視角/顯示/指標，預覽後顯示；短高度斷點900px；保留#119完整性診斷\n- [ ] S6 DOM-CONTRACT文件、響應式、真正常流程/中斷流程、保存重開/undo/redo及設計對照截圖，分段PR獨審合併\n\n## 不變量與驗收\n既有DOM ID保留；新增faceComponentSwitch/data-component-tab/workspace-header/spacePlanReadout/igVertexInline補契約。C核心、公理和交易語義不變；既有快捷鍵、返回來源、狀態、保存、undo/redo可用。不能只改CSS使截圖相似。\n四處主要按鈕computed background一致（主畫布/面內/網格/3D）；desktop header56px、faceEditorViewport至少viewport-88px；1382×804 welcome與視角不重疊。900/390px和觸控也驗；真預览/建立/已保存狀態、重複点击、取消、返回與焦點切換覆蓋。\n\n## 規格歧義待在S0落實\n保留ID與移除workSurf/重複按鈕衝突：優先移位/相容掛點，先查consumer，勿盲刪。座標左下vs右下、按鈕32/36/44vs稿中40、輸入32vs36、指標預覽後vs建立後，以核心摘要為暫定依據並在設計對照記錄，不能把每個mockup inline style都當一致要求。若影響功能/公理需回報決策。\n\n## 輸入可得性\n原附件保留在使用者提供的Library項目，實作者必須取得該ZIP並看實際設計圖；這份issue是可攜工作規格，不等於完整視覺素材。不能因文字已足夠排程就宣称已取得或還原設計。此輪未執行附件程式，尚未開始產品實作。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/123/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118","id":5699008256,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABU6_3AA","number":118,"title":"[工程品質] 盤點結構風險、測試有效性與等待成本，分段改善","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-04T11:53:14Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T11:53:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 使用者要求（2026-10-04）\n新增檢查、分析與必要結構優化，減少正常流程都無法使用、修改一處波及多處、持續疊補丁的問題。不能只增加測試數或等待時間；需要事前工程取捨與實際產品可用證據。\n\n## 優先序\n1. #117：正常 PDF→描面→放置→建模→對照→保存重開，修正循環 expected/過度宣稱的斷言。先短流程確認可用，再跑必要回歸。\n2. 實際結構盤點：座標/來源/身分/候選與正式狀態/保存歷史/能力判定/啟動平台交界，找重複權威、可變資料跨await、散落busy判斷與故障恢復責任。\n3. 測試效益與時間：記錄各suite wall time、覆蓋需求、oracle來源、是否真入口、重疊。保留有價值分層檢查；先修弱斷言或合理合併冗餘，再考慮分層/並行。禁止為縮短時間刪必要負例或放寬golden。\n4. 以一個有證據的高風險共因做小範圍整理：列推薦/拒絕方案、相容性與下一相近需求會修改哪幾個責任。不要憑檔案大或if多就全面重寫，也不要預先抽萬能框架。\n\n## 交付\n- 每個finding須有exact commit/位置、可觀測影響/反例、確定性、推薦修改與估計波及面。\n- 明確區分錯誤測試、覆蓋錯層、缺整體流程、平台未驗，不能把它們都稱為測試無用。\n- 執行順序先影響基本可用性的修復，再有界結構改進；各段獨立PR/測試/審查，可用階段及時合併。\n- 架構調整需維持既有合法行為與保存相容；新公理、破壞性資料格式、部署/權限/費用另批。\n\n## 競寫約束\n#77/PR114 shared writer正在改app/ReferenceWorkspace/history。外部Codex正修改使用者本地Windows/WSL建模與方向問題，工作區尚未提交。不得接管或覆寫兩者；先做只讀證據與獨立可執行驗證準備，實作時確認唯一owner。私有圖紙不公開。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/118/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116","id":5698487111,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABU6gDRw","number":116,"title":"[互動設計][B] 依設計稿整合游標 v2 與情境右鍵選單","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-04T10:40:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T10:40:08Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 使用者已選定的方向\n2026-10-04 使用者提供「游標系統右鍵表單設計.zip」，比較 A/B 後明確要求：採 B 的改動，盡可能接近設計稿。此為既有應用整合，不是另做展示頁。不得自行混入另一套風格或把原型示意當成已交付產品。\n\n## 視覺及互動基準\n設計包內主要檔：游標與右鍵選單 規格板.dc.html、面內工作區 右鍵原型.dc.html、cursor-v2.js、menu-v2.js、menu-svg.js、support.js。B/1b 以常用動作2–4塊、搜尋、精簡清單及側接參數表單呈現；依邊緣翻轉表單位置。比對 screenshots/01-spec2.png、04-proto-edge.png 等實際圖片。先取得原始附件並看像素，不能僅憑本正文重畫。\n\n游標顯示選取/拖曳/推拉/建立/平移，附意圖色、修飾鍵及量測；狀態變更展開1.2秒後縮小，無法放置/等待原因持續顯示。吸附標記與推斷線對準真實落點；右鍵位置保留錨點並供在此建立使用。數值與幾何來自既有命令/候選，不另造模型。\n\n## 工程排程與邊界\n- 現有 #77 工作不被中断，先完成設計量測與現有命令對照。shared app/ReferenceWorkspace 單一寫入者協調接線，不多分支競寫。\n- 先面內工作區形成完整可驗收操作切片；其餘規格涉及物件畫布/空間平面圖/三視圖需逐一對照，保留後續清單，不假稱四處均完成。\n- 共用現有命令、enable/disable、預覽、確認、取消、undo/history及保存。B 是表現與操作入口，不創建第二套 command/geometry authority。\n- 原型中放角材/貼上/重複等部分仍示意；觸控長按/偏移準星/雙指及直接輸入數字須核對真事件實作。未實作須明列，不把空按鈕當功能。\n- 優先忠實原稿布局、字體、尺寸、顏色、圖示、間距、hover/focus/disabled與表單方向。小螢幕適配不可影響桌面對稿；幾何功能或公理變更另審，不因設計稿自動放寬。\n\n## 驗收\n1. 同viewport與相同選取/右鍵/參數狀態的原稿vs真應用截圖對照，列出差異並修正主要偏差。\n2. 真實幾何執行，包含凹口參數預覽→取消不改→確認→undo/redo；disabled理由、鍵盤/Esc/焦點/菜單邊緣不超框、上下文改變後舊菜單不能寫入。\n3. 底層命令拒絕與UI可用性一致，不讓未知動作落到預設有效命令。\n4. 與正在整合的保存/多房間/模型更新互不回歸；測試隨PR登錄或標清必要外部gate。\n5. 精確head必要測試、独立source及visual review後分階段PR合併。保持實體iOS/IME/系統選檔未驗邊界。\n\n原始ZIP已在使用者附件中，含28檔/931799bytes。已完成只讀檢視，未執行附件程式；實作者須經原生Library材料取得流程引用原檔，不公開發布私人附件或猜測外部下載地址。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/116/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45","id":5681713218,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUqgQQg","number":45,"title":"[功能提案][F2] 情境式組合入口：顯示可用操作、缺少輸入，銜接 #25 有限構件生成","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:34:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T08:58:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- portable-grid-complete-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 已合併的有限 #45 切片與精確剩餘\n\nRoot 已審查並合併 [PR104](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/104) 保存骨架與 [PR111](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/111) 正式UI：111 reviewed head `f573dbc19e9d78a11b29f2c5092956ec035a512c` → main `f1b9f9df905b5e7d3f60077d6d2c005c01154a36`，合併 tree `4c9ecd90f99333ffebb5fd56eb691e8bc325c8ae` 精確匹配預估三方合併。PR106證據連結與PR110情境模块／registry／expected完整保留，未以舊tree覆蓋main。\n\n本次已完成批准範圍：每專案最多一份未完成或錯誤 raw grid draft，沿既有建立入口先來源再邊界；原始字串、未選／inactive值、typed refs及原來的input pins可隨真正v10 ZIP保存重開，不自動提交、不被被動重開補成當前參數引用。未知axis enum、缺pin、錯pin、同ID參數刪除重建均保留可存raw並拒preview/confirm；只有明確重新選取才採當前pin。正常真原生preview保持detached，cancel保持原raw／World，confirm提交並清對應raw為同一個undo，undo/redo還原整份raw與World。載入／pack延遲期間保存、離開及編輯守門保留。\n\n111同exact head實跑：strict65 suites **1948pass/0fail/1具名WindowsGDI**；無filter完整CDP **1970/0/0skip、82 golden、completed=true、exit0**；新raw-provenance browser **113/0**、既有manual browser **91/0**、formal stale **19/0**，均真native／ZIP、desktop及390px、零unexpected exceptions、exit0。不是僅綠CI。完整CDP log SHA `a0b23e9ccbdf1e27e9c76a128b5a885d92ad2d63be2d9d91480b75908e0b3ecb`。\n\n合併後新main獨立服務18988，runtime version `92a158e92102c533a05e5ebdefbafb6de02747640e470da484734a26661ab368`、fresh=true、root為clean frozen main；重新執行真正ZIP/file-menu/create-entry/raw編輯/保存、所有enum/pin反例、明選重新pin、真原生preview/cancel/confirm、oneundo/redo **113/0/0exceptions、completed=true、exit0**。postmerge log SHA `e1cc6a8b6cafba8c6b9924962cf1347b497875165f5434fb1b07703f0b2545f7`，result SHA `29f9813527cdaf6f264425a747082c8c0789673dc368370b228c57df3da77c1c`，證據 `/tmp/geometry-tests/geometry45-portable-20261004/111-main-f1b9f9d-*`。\n\n**本issue及總#43保持open。** 尚未交付：超出此单draft契約的多份draft／互相引用／複雜多選或角色映射、F2b擴大生成與新拓樸；#58新來源子規則亦須其獨立契約、公理、原生reader及驗收，不由本slice放寬。已有PR53有限D34/I42/R35不代表任意生成完成。A24實體手機IME、OSchooser及下載仍未驗；Chromium檔案自動化不冒稱實機。#44正式修改模型由draft [PR113](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/113)另追蹤，#77房間保存由正式owner/native候選fingerprint整合另追蹤。無部署、付費、安全修改或私人圖紙上傳。\n\n下方較早「PR100草案／未提交grid附件未交付」等狀態保留為歷史，以此節為最新精確狀態。\n<!-- portable-grid-complete-20261004:end -->\n\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 八項採納／單writer進度\n\n已採納：每專案一份未完成／錯誤 raw grid draft，可隨專案原樣保存重開、不自動提交；先來源→邊界入口。此整合owner獨占project-store/capability/schema/ContextHistory/app與grid工作區接線，第一切片是single grid-draft附件的真ZIP/history/context骨架；沿既有createBinding→picker，減少重複入口。多份draft/互相引用／更複雜多選／F2b擴大生成不隨之批准。\n\n[接口／owner／分波隊列](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d/geometry-guide/IMPLEMENTATION-QUEUE-20261004.md)， [draft PR100](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/100)，exact head `0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d`／base main1075058。共有 versioned `manifest.featureAttachments` envelope、有限kind/schema/validator、context token讀寫adapter；模型沿既有record。第一版候選新format統一為未占用/10（實作前再查main）；未知schema/kind/能力明確拒，不假輸出舊版。這是整合草案，無產品完成聲明。\n\n用戶八項批准與排程授權為本輪新依據；較早proposal「未採納」只表示當時狀態，其額外細節不整包採納。#85 PR98已合併，#24 PR97待root審查；A24實機仍未驗，不阻獨立cloud項。Refs不用Closes；root逐stage決定merge，無部署／付費／私人圖紙上傳。\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:end -->\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP45-A先單選System→既有boundary picker；A2 exact pair presentation另選。既有入口/typed守門可接續，未提交grid草稿保存等Q31。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n\n## 2026-10-03 17:56 UTC 最新main與實際後驗\n\nPR70已由root合併，reviewed `adf5ed4a150f09e8b1e104e16cf5265cb0247d52` → main `d5ea5311c69657376dbfb567f28fe8f5551daebe`；tree d67e80eb完全相同。Root獨立quality actual own-compile full1530/0/1GDI、無filter1855/0/79golden，之後才合併。Worker同main postmerge P8316／料單37／來源29／native18／Node63均0fail/exit0；HTTP292public/205vendor前後bytes/headers與runtime6bd936b25127/fresh/root核對成功，自有服務已停止。沒有hostedCI rerun、部署或用戶本機操作。\n\nPR71 exactdad3e91e3e44c16baf13c24a12d28ddaf457a6e1仍draft，單檔測試器Promise保留修復；原space183/timber79/helper9/獨立10/真GC通過，main70＋71本地整合183＋16＋79也通過，現在由另一agent獨立檢驗最新基底，交root決定merge。PDF校準→房間偵測由另一hotfixthread01a102d4負責，避免競寫。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard/OSchooser/下載與Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗；完整#47雙向定位、實物去重、assembly-owned／faces+timbers保存模型、F1b durableidentity與F4b加工裁切餘料仍open。#45擴大入口／F2b與#57–62新增來源子規則仍須相應契約／公理採納；不因issue正文放寬。PR52已合併1805bb5，PR53有限D34/I42/R35已合併68c4ac13。較早狀態如下為歷史。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 16:56 UTC 已完成的雲端切片與精確剩餘\n\n目前main `8993b03b91d27030d210d6478e08764af51385d7`；PR69 reviewed175b308d已合併、同tree且postmain入口16／binding16／料單37／HTTP291+205全驗。PR52早已合併1805bb5；PR53有限D34/I42/R35生成早已合併68c4ac13，不能仍記作未合併／未實作。\n\n已交root審查的两個draft、未合併／未部署：\n\n- [PR70](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/70) exact `adf5ed4a150f09e8b1e104e16cf5265cb0247d52`／base899：單一保存模型明選角材原生快照與核對CSV，一對一既有入口。完整47suites1530pass/0fail/1具名GDI；**無filterChromium1855/0/0skip/completedtrue/79golden**；prod+ASan各121/121、獨立APPROVE。真space183／timber79／binding16／來源29與HTTP292public/205vendor、前後fresh/runtime全驗，最終桌面與390px截圖已看。歷史27/33不被live29/35或missing偷換，模型/context/close/late失效零Blob、連點一次。實際producer目前拒絕assembly-owned savedmodel及faces+timbers，不製造正例。\n- [PR71](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/71) exact `dad3e91e3e44c16baf13c24a12d28ddaf457a6e1`／base899：單檔空間testharness復用既有Promise保留工具，避免ChromeGC中途停止；空間183/0、timber79/0、helper9／獨立10、真GC及不重試mutation／cleanup證據通過、APPROVE。與PR70隔離。\n\n兩PR的Actions run37137739059／37138428595七jobs都未執行、steps/logs null，不稱greenCI或產品assertionfail；既有免費quota耗盡記錄，沒有rerun unchanged／付費／改policy。自有測試服務已依root/PID停止，不碰用戶服務。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard／OS chooser／下載及Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗；整張#47的完整雙向定位、跨表示實物去重、F1b durableidentity、F4b加工裁切餘料、#45其餘grid-source＋boundary／附件／F2b仍open。#57–62的新來源子規則須先採納#58具體差異，現D19/I25/R23單父格及末節全格批次未定案限制保持，不因issue正文放寬。#54他人PR63/64交付保留，不競寫。這些缺口與已完成雲端切片分開。\n\n以下是較早需求／歷史，最新節為目前事實。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 16:21 UTC 最新已合併 main 與雲端後驗\n\nPR69 已由持有原始 exact 批准的 root 合併：reviewed `175b308d2a2523aa1da81d679d536c7bc5de7905` → main `8993b03b91d27030d210d6478e08764af51385d7`；tree438e1cc35072069f3699b35274d25acef8def153完全相同。合併前完整47suites1499pass/0fail/1具名GDI skip、無filterChromium1839/0/completedtrue/78golden及獨立review通過。合併後同main真P82入口16/0、既有binding16/0、P80/P81料單37/0、HTTP291public/205vendor逐bytes與headers相符；前後runtime68d9a81b76b4b0f571565ffad2c76da5bde83073fe293b8a43154669af7e6a1c/root/fresh正確，自有測試服務已停止。沒有部署或擴大公理。\n\nPR52早已合併1805bb5，PR53有限生成器早已合併68c4ac13；本輪不是只修CI，後續資料正確性與已批准切片已有55/56/63/65/66/67/68/69交付（以各PR精確正文為準）。#25有限D34/I42/R35不代表任意生成語義完成。A24實體手機keyboard/OS chooser/download與Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗，保留open。Actionsincludedquota耗盡時七jobs未執行，不能稱greenCI；沒有付費或改billing/policy。\n\n下一實作 #47 的單一保存模型原生快照料單 draft [PR70](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/70) 已整合main899；完整非瀏覽器1530pass/0fail/1GDI，當前native production及ASan121/121。正在完成真下載/模型失效/390px及無filter full，尚未宣稱最終全部驗收或合併。\n\n較早狀態／原始需求如下，僅最新節為現況。\n\n---\n\n#45已完成規則單選→固定來源材料配置的既有契約切片；grid-source＋boundary、未提交grid附件、F2b擴大拓樸及實機仍是缺口，本issue不關閉。\n\n## 2026-10-03 15:16 UTC cloud 最新精確狀態（較早紀錄保留作歷史）\n\nmain 仍為 `f52ed1d5cab2486ee8e3ea620dfeeb123ca76c81`；PR68 已合併且 postmerge 新 World／binding／HTTP 核對通過。PR69 ready exact `175b308d2a2523aa1da81d679d536c7bc5de7905`，47 suites1499pass/0fail/1具名GDI skip、完整無filter Chromium1839/0/0skip/completedtrue/78golden、真binding16/0、space183/0、材質來源79/0、HTTP291public/205vendor；獨立review APPROVE與native35/35＋ASan35/35。這是 published-rule→材料配置的 bounded F2a existing-contract入口，不代表#45全部完成。兩次同exact guarded merge 均被 automatic approval review 拒絕：轉交root批准與逐字user授權仍被視為assistant-transmitted evidence，原委派限制worker不自行merge；已停止重試，請root主執行者合併此head。沒有換工具／直接push繞過，尚未合併或部署。\n\n#45其他grid-source＋boundary、未提交grid附件返回契約與F2b擴大拓樸仍未交付，Q19完整建立/編輯入口維持。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard/OS chooser/download與Windowsmanual/GDI未驗。Actions included quota耗盡，七jobs未執行不能稱greenCI；未付費/改policy。可繼續的單一snapshot導出與需先定案的跨表示實物計量鍵、F1b durable identity/rebuild、F4b鋸縫/末刀/保存、#58新語義分開，#46/#48/#49/#54 broader缺口保持open。Issue原正文只是需求背景，不放寬公理。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 14:20 UTC cloud 最新執行狀態（以下較早紀錄保留作歷史）\n\nPR68 已獲 parent 獨立審查 APPROVE，reviewed `8dc8159ff9f5cee48954db00e6148ca157e14c4d`，已合併為 main `f52ed1d5cab2486ee8e3ea620dfeeb123ca76c81`；merge tree `e4527e8febc0ccf928ea2171ecc03814d192a7f9` 與 reviewed head 完全相同。postmerge 新 World P80/P81 37/0、真 binding UI 16/0、HTTP 289 public/205 vendor exact bytes+headers/runtime fresh，全部 exit 0；自有服務已停止。\n\n正在隔離分支 `feat/context-binding-entry-20261003` 實作 F2a 第一個既有契約切片：選取 published rule → 同一個檢查器入口「建立材料配置」→ 既有 binding 表單／原生 preview/confirm。小型 typed operation registry 只需 authoring 能力，保留合法未完成配置，不推斷方向或生成幾何；以原生卡片顯示時的 id/version/fingerprint 鎖定來源，native capabilities/來源重新核對及 context/selection/owner/serial 守門全部完成前不修改舊 owner/草稿/preview。GEO219 一對一替換舊 generic inspector open；卡片雙擊／既有完整編輯入口仍可用，Q19建立入口不動。\n\n目前 42 workspace＋12 registry Node 案例=54/54；原生 card fingerprint 補丁 production 35/35、ASan/UBSan 35/35，三個新案例在 immutable main baseline 皆 assertion red。完整 suite／真 CDP 正在落地驗證，**尚未宣稱這個切片完成、尚未新增／合併此功能 PR**。grid-source＋boundary、grid 草稿附件返回契約及 F2b 擴大生成不在本切片。A24實機仍未驗。沒有新公理/schema/部署。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 cloud 先交付既有流程資料正確性修復，F2a/F2b 狀態分開\n\n[PR68](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/68) draft exact `8dc8159ff9f5cee48954db00e6148ca157e14c4d`，base main `2af20c11203f43fb2ce51b8562958623c6942587`；未合併。原生同ID／版本規則刪除重建後，binding value/fingerprint可不變但rule fingerprint變，舊UI仍可建立／編輯。修固定顯示中的來源、preview late guard、published-edit及第一次拒絕後的repeat-stale，只有明確重開／換版mapping採新來源；保留合法不完整binding、update intent、typed refs、真正gcanvas重開與metadata-only history。\n\n完整46套件1478/0/1具名GDI；無filterChromium1823/0/0skip/completedtrue/77golden相符；真配置UI16/0（桌面／390px）、space183/0、材質來源79/0；獨立61/61 +額外37/37，immutable舊版本同案例assert-red，無剩餘P0/P1/P2。289public/205vendor bytes+headers/runtimefresh核對，自有測試服務已停止。遠端CI37125463877七jobs未執行、quota耗盡，不能稱greenCI。\n\n這是既有流程守門修復，**尚未交付新的F2a情境入口／操作registry**；沒有新公理/schema/native語义。#25有限生成已隨PR53合併68c4ac1，但不等於F2b擴大拓樸。下一可分切片：既有published rule→既有材料配置context入口，需同時移除重複入口並沿用原生ID/preview/confirm；grid-source＋boundary與未提交grid草稿附件的保存/返回契約另列具體定案，不由issue文字新增授權。A24實機仍未驗，保持open。\n\n以下原始需求完整保留。\n\n---\n\n路線總工單：#43；來源／影響共用方向：#44；既有生成主工單：#25。建單基準 `4e90a1c89256a96ed28a7a1096c9ca627912fc91`。本單是功能提案，不是生成契約已核准，也不是另一張生成器總工單。\n\n## 情境與原因\n\n使用者的念頭是「這份規則，搭配這種角材，在這個範圍使用」，不是「先去找某個管理器」。選取不同物件後，介面應告訴他目前可以如何組合，以及缺了什麼。\n\n例如規則＋角材來源可以建立材料配置；網格來源＋邊界可以建立網格配置。但材料已選齊，不等於有定位、範圍、支撐或生成能力。把這些差別放在操作當下，能減少填完整張表才發現無法生成的挫折。\n\n## F2a：先接既有合法操作\n\n最小 UI 流程：選取一個或幾個物件 → 按需顯示「可組合」操作 → 明確對應角色／來源 → 進入既有表單 → 預覽與確認 → 返回原選取位置。\n\n- 起始只適配已有操作：由發布規則建立材料配置、由網格來源與邊界建立配置。材料來源不一定是獨立畫布卡，也可由既有選擇器選取。\n- 相容操作以型別與執行器能力判斷，不從名稱含「主支」「材料」等字串猜。\n- 多個角色的材料分別明選；可以帶入可撤回候選，但不能以點選順序、卡片左右、同名或 A/B 顯示順序自動決定幾何朝向。\n- 缺件與能力分開顯示：未選材料、未選接觸面／截面方向、尚無定位範圍、執行器不支援生成、定義有錯，是不同狀態。\n- 缺少下游能力仍可使用現行 authoring/binding；不把合法未完成配置禁掉，也不顯示「天花板已生成」。\n- 沿用現有建立選單、檢查器、WorkspaceShell 及共用保存／離開守門；不新增一排常駐工具或第二個組構編輯器。\n\n## 實作脈絡\n\n1. 建立小型**操作登錄表／適配層**，描述輸入型別、所需能力、可帶入的明確引用、缺件與開啟哪個既有工作區。它是操作入口，不是新的萬能 Composition 真相層。\n2. 候選表單保存原始 typed references，不把來源選擇展平成數字。跨工作區返回後保留草稿，仍需重新取得有效預覽。\n3. ID 與草稿保留採核心的合法配號／交易策略；#24 的 MAX/reservation 防撞是相關寫入操作的前置，不可在前端遞增猜新號。\n4. 每次讀取／開啟／提交綁到 context、revision 與編輯序號；能力變更或舊回覆到達時不可把別的物件／專案接進來。\n5. 入口只呼叫既有受驗證操作；不在 UI 另寫求值、創建假模型或繞過確認。\n\n## F2b：沿 #25 接入有限生成，不重複開發\n\n這部分保留前次建議的工程方向，由 #25 的具體契約和審核負責。F2a 完成不能代表它完成。\n\n首個案例為**兩支主支與一支副支**，但環境必須包含主支自身需要的合法邊界／端面支撐，不能只驗副支頂住主支。\n\n輸入至少有：固定規則版本與指紋、Binding/尺寸來源、指定承載面與邊界、各 member 的 guide 或真實 signed grid index／明選成員對應、有限成員集合、接觸面／截面方向、可唯一解析的兩端支撐。\n\n輸出是可重建的 AssemblyInstance 定義及逐件衍生幾何，保留 rule/member、材料、定位、接合與完成尺寸。實例／分段身分基於穩定配置鍵，不按陣列順序；分裂／合併後身分如何延續必須先定義。\n\n流程：解析來源 → 解析有限配置 → 推導端面與跨距 → 核心驗證 → 逐件差異預覽 → 確認同一候選 → 原子提交與保存。\n\n初版只能接受與現行 D15/D17/I19/R6 相容的映射。要驗證使用者的局部 joint 真正符合生成結果，而不是只貼上規則名稱後照舊全域 priority 生成。相反組法、混向主支、任意巢狀、全屋無限展開均不因本提案獲准。能力名稱、保存 schema、API／錯誤與必要公理差異以 #25 定案為準，不預先搶編號。\n\n## 建議程式接點\n\n- `app.js`、建立選單／檢查器：選取上下文与操作登錄表。\n- `assembly-workspace.js`、既有網格工作區與材料來源選擇器：帶入候選、補輸入、返回位置。\n- 既有工程／組構 bridge、`ReferenceWorkspace`：真交易、草稿與保存。\n- #25 交付真生成能力後，適配其正式端點與逐件預覽；不再造平行求值器。\n\n## F2a 待執行驗收\n\n- [ ] 規則／材料與網格／邊界兩條入口使用真核心完成現有合法配置，來源未展平。\n- [ ] 同名物件、選取順序改變、拖卡片或視圖旋轉，不暗改角色對應或截面朝向。\n- [ ] 未填、錯誤、缺能力有不同提示；完整 Binding 仍不宣稱已生成幾何。\n- [ ] 取消、返回、換工作區、保存重開與復原重做符合共用流程；無多餘隱式物件。\n- [ ] MAX／已用／草稿保留 ID 不碰撞，受影響來源刪除有明確拒絕或重新選擇。\n- [ ] 真桌面／390px 可達，無重複常駐操作；跨專案或過期能力回覆不串用。\n\n## F2b 驗收交給 #25 追蹤\n\n改主支位置後副支跨距重算；改截面後接觸重新驗證；主支自身支撐合法；固定版本不暗升；切長度方向不隱式換貼板面；取消／失敗／過期／重試不造成部分更新或重複構件；重開保留来源。同外形不同分件必須可區別。\n\n交付應明寫只完成 F2a，或列出 #25 哪個受限能力已實作並有測試；不能將本單關閉連帶視為 #25 完成。\n\n## 來源與開工邊界\n\n參照 `geometry-core/ASSEMBLY-RULES-CONTRACT.md`（含 Deferred generator handoff）、`geometry-web/docs/ASSEMBLY-RULES-USE.md`、`geometry-web/docs/ENGINEERING-SPEC-USE.md`、#24／#25。未選定的新功能不因建單自動啟動；後續實作按 #43 的保全、契約、真 UI／保存／測試與 PR 交付準則。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/45/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44","id":5681706187,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUqf0yw","number":44,"title":"[功能提案][F1] 來源／影響檢查器與模型更新狀態：先唯讀追溯，再受控重建","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:33:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T05:29:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- f1b-foundation-merged-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 F1b foundation 已合併；UI／HTTP 接線待共用 owner，issue 保持 open\n\n[PR99](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/99) 已由 root 獨立複審並合併，approved head `4fea486dc638846c5d702e7047e728c3d34003e2`，merge `170f8f5`。在後續 PR102 合併後的 main `d1a161f6b1ed50d100d316a0b90be9d7d34451f6` 做 postmerge 核對：7 個 producer／controller／UI 模組與測試 Git blobs 均與 approved PR99 完全相同，producer/native/modeling 的 39 個 tracked dependency blobs 亦相同。\n\n已合併的有限切片提供：明選現行 ordinary single-plan 來源、隔離 native 候選、完整新舊差異、確認後以既有同步 host callback 更新同 model 完整 record、一筆 undo。來源身分明確為 unknown，必須明選，無 sameID／同名推接；固定材料／規則版本不暗升。候選 receipt 暫態，不新增保存 schema 或 persistent identity ledger；不擴入 owned／多載體能力。\n\nPostmerge 實證：producer **22 pass / 0 fail / 0 skip**，controller **39 pass / 0 fail / 0 skip**，均 exit 0，涵蓋取消、stale、record 被替換、unknown source、固定版本、完整 record／save／undo 等拒絕或提交契約。bridge、model-base binaries 均與當前 native source SHA 相符；actual-source snapshot `fresh=true`，version `2034b13bbda4db1502b828391eea907694b90fba350f236d8108f8045b9cfcfd`。本輪未啟動 UI／HTTP 服務，自有舊服務已清理。\n\n**主線目前尚未載入更新 UI 模組、未接 HTTP route／既有 edit entry，因此不是完整產品入口交付，#44 保持 open。** 共用接線由 thread `01a100b5-800b-75f2-9a02-71ee53e550ba` 單一 writer 接手；F1b 模組 owner 本輪未改 shared schema／project-store／ContextHistory／app wiring。owner-only patch 在 main `d1a161f6` 的 `git apply --check` 通過，未套用。\n\n交接：[接口與 owner 契約](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/d1a161f6b1ed50d100d316a0b90be9d7d34451f6/geometry-web/docs/MODEL-UPDATE-INTEGRATION.md)、[接線 patch](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/d1a161f6b1ed50d100d316a0b90be9d7d34451f6/geometry-web/docs/MODEL-UPDATE-INTEGRATION.patch)、[既有完整驗證與限制](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/d1a161f6b1ed50d100d316a0b90be9d7d34451f6/geometry-web/docs/MODEL-UPDATE-VALIDATION.md)。接線後應用 `GEOMETRY_MODEL_UPDATE_ENTRY=owner` 從實際既有 edit action 驗證入口、HTTP/native freshness 與完整保存／一步復原；既有隔離環境驗證不能代替主線入口驗收。實體手機驗收另行保留。\n\n以下歷史進度保留；較早「F1b 未實作／pending producer」不代表本次 foundation 合併後狀態，未列的新公理／durable identity 需求沒有因此採納。\n<!-- f1b-foundation-merged-20261004:end -->\n\n<!-- model-update-interface-20261004:start -->\n### 共用owner對 PR99接口核對（2026-10-04）\n\n已讀 [PR99 exact e88f0143 接口](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/e88f0143a263a3c9ceda2be2816fc8e06ec30266/geometry-web/docs/MODEL-UPDATE-INTEGRATION.md)，與PR100共用草案一致，目前不需改保存欄位。`old_record_sha256`對應草案`previousSignature`，依同域canonical完整record計算；候選receipt暫態、不入featureAttachments，record沿既有strict schema。共用owner提供actual context/frame/projectRevision/undo-redo guards、同步`updateSpaceModel` callback與readSource的revision bracket；#44原owner維持producer/module/tests，不競寫shared。pendingproducer/UI仍待原owner必要驗证，此核對不是產品完成聲明。\n<!-- model-update-interface-20261004:end -->\n\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 八項採納／單writer進度\n\n已採納：明選現行來源→看新舊差異→確認更新同一普通單一平面模型，一步復原完整舊record；未知身分重新指定，固定材料／規則版本不暗升。F1b owner thread `01a104fc-5524-76ea-93f1-9e6e632f709a` 先交純候選模組 `{modelId,previousSignature,record,diff,sourcePins}`，沿既有 strict model schema；此整合owner接 context/history/store/app。durable ledger與owned/faces+timbers非本輪範圍。\n\n[接口／owner／分波隊列](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d/geometry-guide/IMPLEMENTATION-QUEUE-20261004.md)， [draft PR100](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/100)，exact head `0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d`／base main1075058。共有 versioned `manifest.featureAttachments` envelope、有限kind/schema/validator、context token讀寫adapter；模型沿既有record。第一版候選新format統一為未占用/10（實作前再查main）；未知schema/kind/能力明確拒，不假輸出舊版。這是整合草案，無產品完成聲明。\n\n用戶八項批准與排程授權為本輪新依據；較早proposal「未採納」只表示當時狀態，其額外細節不整包採納。#85 PR98已合併，#24 PR97待root審查；A24實機仍未驗，不阻獨立cloud項。Refs不用Closes；root逐stage決定merge，無部署／付費／私人圖紙上傳。\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:end -->\n\n## 2026-10-03 18:08 UTC main70後驗與F1a實際範圍\n\n最新main `d5ea5311c69657376dbfb567f28fe8f5551daebe` 已含原F1a來源檢視、native保存模型支承快照與PR70普通單一保存模型料單。Worker在此main真服務實跑来源檢視29/0（1280／390px）、P8316/0、P80+8137/0、native18/0及Node63/0，全exit0；HTTP292public/205vendor與fresh/root/version前後閉包一致，自有服務停止。完整1530native/1855CDP/79golden是root合併前在exactadf5上獨立重編實跑，tree與main全等；兩類證據明確分開。\n\nF1b仍待durableidentity、來源閉包、明選更新欄位及交易契約。相同內容不能證明物件延續，保存模型列不錯接liveID，不自動重建或升版本。Assembly-owned／faces+timbers保存model producer仍拒能力；A24實體手機及Windowsmanual仍未驗。PR71單檔測試器修復在最新main＋exactpatch已由另一agent獨立space183/timber79/真GC通過，仍draft由root決定merge。較早F1a交付證據／完整原需求如下。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 cloud 已交付 F1a 有限切片；F1b 仍未實作\n\n[PR67](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/67) 最終 reviewed head `e3d3ffc8ffde45e35d273924dcfd41c0bb47e7f5` 已依 parent 明確ordered65→66→67授權合併 main `2af20c11203f43fb2ce51b8562958623c6942587`，tree全等。正式既有檢查器／模型庫唯讀來源、影響、快照內容與#47原生支承適配；實際World快照原子讀，不借liveWorld，缺資料／身分延續／容量如實未知，不自動重建。\n\n同head完整46套件1462/0/1具名WindowsGDI skip；無filter Chromium1823/0/0skip/completedtrue/77golden相符；來源真UI29/0、space183/0、材質來源79/0；獨立production81/81及ASan/UBSan81/81、Node17/17、真savedWorld/preview-token/capacity/1MiB oracle。B0/B1 member/fixedrule桌面與390px唯讀截圖實際核對。postmerge新World P80/P81 37/0/exit0、288public/205vendor bytes/versionheaders全等且runtimefresh；own services均停止，未部署。遠端CI37125185145七jobs未執行、不是green（included minutes耗盡）。\n\n保持open：F1b受控重建未實作；durable incarnation／物件延續未知；material/method/spec/datum/old-rule部分來源缺可靠定位入口。I9候選、RC membership、confirmed-support不被冒充遞迴求值來源。A24實體手機／OS、Windowsmanual仍未驗；此次slice不將總提案全勾完成。原始需求完整保留如下。\n\n---\n\n路線總工單：#43。建單基準 `4e90a1c89256a96ed28a7a1096c9ca627912fc91`。本單是助手建議的外部化，供選定與實作規劃；不是新增功能已完成或已全面核准。既有授權維持，新行為與資料契約按 AGENTS 定案，不需聊天附件。\n\n## 使用情境與建議原因\n\n使用者選一支副支，不應只看到「長度多少」，還應能回答：兩端止於誰的哪個面、截面引用哪個參數／材料、位置來自哪条線、與哪份規則或配置有關。反過來選一個參數，能看哪些網格、角材或配置引用它，以及哪裡仍是建立當時的模型快照。\n\n既有參數使用關係、工程來源／有效值與預覽不是沒有功能；新增價值是把它們整合成跨物件的共用追溯入口。保存來源却只展示結果數字，會讓使用者不知道該改參數、定位、配置還是組法。\n\n## F1a：第一版唯讀切片\n\n最小流程：選物件 → 既有檢查器「來源／影響」 → 展開一段引用路徑 → 點回來源或使用處 → 查看相關模型與來源的一致性。\n\n- 顯示直接來源、間接依賴與目前可確認的接觸／支撐關係；「修改可能涉及」與「已經試算確認會改」分開，不能把所有下游都說成尺寸必變。\n- 有名稱就顯示名稱，仍可查 kind/id/version/field/member/joint；同名物件不合併。\n- 預設只展開目前選取物件附近的關係，不把無限畫布永久鋪滿連線；鍵盤與手機清單能完成相同定位。\n- 診斷定位到相關構件、來源欄位或接合；不能只有 I40 等代碼，也不靠自然語言錯誤訊息反解析關係。\n- 缺少資料如實標示，不能由相鄰位置猜成已保存的接合關係。尚未生成的 AssemblyBinding 不顯示虛構的施工構件。\n\n## 資料與核心實作脈絡\n\n1. 從現有 World、ParameterRef、固定材料／規則版本、GridBinding、AssemblyBinding 和模型來源定義建立**可重建的讀取索引**。不另存一份可独立修改的關係真相。\n2. 節點至少區分專案／候選上下文、物件類型、id，固定版本或欄位另帶 version/fieldId；沿用各類型的零號合法性。刪除重建或跨上下文的同數字 ID 不得冒充原物件，無法證明延續就標未知。與 #24 的配號生命週期收尾協調。\n3. 邊分尺寸依賴、定位依賴、規則版本、成員對應、幾何接觸／支撐。幾何鄰接環不當作求值依賴循環。\n4. 擴充原生型別讀取與必要 preview 資料，前端只做適配與呈現；大量關係有明確容量／分頁及不完整提示。\n5. 快取綁到上下文及有效來源 revision/fingerprint，舊回覆不得覆蓋新專案。只读不得消耗原生預覽 token、修改定義／dirty／history。\n\n## 模型更新狀態\n\n現有已保存空間模型採建立當時的輸入；修改原面不自動更新模型。第一版先顯示：\n\n- 與可追溯來源一致。\n- 相關來源已變更，需核對。\n- 來源缺失或無法可靠追溯。\n- 執行能力不足／尚未檢查。\n\n比對模型的實際依賴、生成請求與相關內容，不用「整個場景 hash 變了」把所有模型一律判過期。顯示名稱／卡片位置改變、來源身分或版本變更、幾何值變更要分開；資料不足不能給綠燈。舊檔沒有可靠來源連結時不依名稱猜回。\n\n## F1b：保留後續受控重建，不併入唯讀完成宣稱\n\n待明確更新契約後新增「依現行來源重建」：明選對象及更新欄位 → 候選求值 → 逐項差異 → 確認後更新同一模型並支援復原。明選保留舊快照時不自動刷新；固定材料／規則版不暗升級。來源刪除、身分歧義、失敗、過期或遺失回覆均不可半套更新。舊模型是否已有足夠來源供重建，須逐類確認。\n\n## 建議落點與相依\n\n- `current_geometry.c`、`geometry-core/`：型別關係及可重建索引。\n- `geometry-web/web_bridge.c`、既有 engineering／assembly read/preview：查詢與診斷資料。\n- `app.js`、既有參數／組構／空間檢查器：共用導航、來源摘要與模型狀態。\n- 若需新增模型來源中繼資料，與 `project-store.js`、`reference-workspace.js` 一起定 schema／舊檔未知狀態；不要擅自修改舊格式。\n- F1a 不以 #25 完成為前置；F1b 與方案比較 F3 共用差異表達，但不必做完全部 F3 才能定案。\n\n## 待執行驗收\n\n- [ ] 直接值改為同值 ParameterRef，或改為同截面不同材料版本，關係與来源差異都能辨識。\n- [ ] 改名／重排不改引用，拖卡片不讓幾何模型誤報過期；相關參數變更才標出真正涉及的模型。\n- [ ] 不相關定義修改不把所有模型誤判過期；缺來源／舊檔不可追溯時顯示未知。\n- [ ] 同名、不同類別同數字 ID、不同版本及合法零號不混淆；刪除重建後不錯連。\n- [ ] 點診斷定位到正確欄位／構件／接合，唯讀檢視前後 World、dirty、history 與既有預覽不變。\n- [ ] 來源連續變更或切專案時，遲到回覆及快取不串用；容量限制顯示明確。\n- [ ] 正式桌面／390px 操作與真資料回歸；相應保存中繼資料若有新增，必須實際保存重開。實體手機另記，不冒稱實測。\n\nF1a 可獨立交付；F1b 尚未實作時保留明確後續狀態，不能只完成唯讀就聲稱自動連動已完成。後續交付附 commit/PR、命令、exit code、同版證據及未驗項，遵循 #43 的共同邊界。\n\n## 依據\n\n基準樹：https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/tree/4e90a1c89256a96ed28a7a1096c9ca627912fc91\n\n參照 `geometry-core/PARAMETERS-CONTRACT.md`、`geometry-core/ASSEMBLY-RULES-CONTRACT.md`、`geometry-web/docs/ENGINEERING-SPEC-USE.md`、`geometry-web/docs/SPACE-MODELING.md`。本單不把文件描述當成這次已重新執行測試的結果。\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP44-A缺少typed locator清單；既有live placement定位缺陷另#80優先。F1b明選普通plan重建等Q32，不含已取消#47。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/44/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77","id":5693226814,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABU1e_Pg","number":77,"title":"[多房間][MR] 同一 PDF 共享來源基準，連續建立獨立房間邊界與保存","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-10-03T20:23:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T05:25:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 八項採納／單writer進度\n\n已採納：同PDF共享唯一比例尺／對位，各房名稱/Boundary獨立，新增不覆蓋明選才edit，改basis舊房只待複核而不變形、新房用新basis；解除列表不刪geometry、不建3D父子。owner thread `01a104fc-a75a-728a-8d74-2e323f84d08c` 先交純SourceRooms bundle/validator/asset refs/typed native refs；整合owner將metadata與既有native confirm同history步接保存。自動辨識仍接#54/#87，勿競寫求解同檔。\n\n[接口／owner／分波隊列](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d/geometry-guide/IMPLEMENTATION-QUEUE-20261004.md)， [draft PR100](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/100)，exact head `0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d`／base main1075058。共有 versioned `manifest.featureAttachments` envelope、有限kind/schema/validator、context token讀寫adapter；模型沿既有record。第一版候選新format統一為未占用/10（實作前再查main）；未知schema/kind/能力明確拒，不假輸出舊版。這是整合草案，無產品完成聲明。\n\n用戶八項批准與排程授權為本輪新依據；較早proposal「未採納」只表示當時狀態，其額外細節不整包採納。#85 PR98已合併，#24 PR97待root審查；A24實機仍未驗，不阻獨立cloud項。Refs不用Closes；root逐stage決定merge，無部署／付費／私人圖紙上傳。\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:end -->\n\n使用者2026-10-03 20:19明確要求加入工作排程：同一PDF底圖描完一個房間後，接著描其他房間，每個成为獨立子物件／空間邊界面。本次授權為規格／依賴／工單與文件準備，不代表共享校準或新父子契約已採納，產品碼未开工。\n\n## 實際現況（main9ebf52a）\n- 同sourceId／PDF原bytes可共用並以hash去重，但每次newPage仍calibration:null，x/y/scale重新建立；沒有共享校準／對位。\n- D3 Boundary是單外環＋孔的純2D，沒有parent欄位；D4 PlacementSurface引用boundary_id並擁有自己的worldframe。\n- D5 Space是六方向boundaryIDs成員組，不是同PDF多房間樹；D22 CompositeSpace也不是sourcepage collection。不得改稱目前Space已有樓層/房間父子。\n- #54已处理单房间候选/核对，PR74是人工描线snap；本需求是連續多房間與共享來源關係，沒有重複其求解或吸附。\n\n## 最小可行模型（Q37 proposal，未採納）\n建議以專案附件SourcePlane/RoomCollection作「來源平面圖」工作區：一份sourceHash/page/original-coordinate基準＋校準/對位定義；多個RoomRecord只保存roomId/名稱/typed boundary reference（可選placement reference），不存第二份polygon、worldframe或volume。每房間真geometry仍只有原生D3/D4定義，集合父子只表示來源/工作區歸屬，不改D5/I1等幾何語義。\n\n選項A（建議）：共用来源校準/對位，不自動移動已确认房間；變更基準使既有房間需複核，新描房間用新基準。B：一次複製校準至各ReferencePage，日後獨立，较小但不是真共享。C：native幾何父子/自動transform繼承，需新公理與生命週期/依賴契約，不列最小ready。\n\n## 最小切片／依賴\n- MR-A：固定SourcePlane/RoomRecord資料、native引用／身份生命週期、校準版本／對位與更新策略、正式附件能力及完整保存契約；Q37待使用者採納。\n- MR-B：底圖校準一次→描房A預覽確認→返回同sourceworkspace→明選「新增房間」→描房B預覽确认；新增而非替換，只有明選編輯既有房間才走原外環replace。\n- MR-C：列表/命名/明選編輯/刪除與來源總覽→保存ZIP→新上下文重開，原PDFbytes、共同基準及每間native輪廓/typedrefs一致。\n落點：既有reference-workspace/reference-ui、project-store/ContextHistory、既有boundary/outline nativepreview與配置；不新做另一PDFapp，不新增第二geometrytruth。產品接線只一owner，保留已交付PDFsnap，禁止競寫。\n\n## 待驗收（本次未跑）\n- 同一自製雙房PDF，A完成後B连续新增，A所有geometry/source/history不被替換；native配號避免碰撞（surface合體需newid.surfaces，不JSmax+1）。\n- A/B穩定roomId、獨立boundaryID/名稱/編輯；一個房間孔不是另一room；boundary與placement各typednamespace/零號守門正確。\n- 一次校準後兩房间同基準；shared基準變更只提示需複核或按已採納策略处理，不暗改已确认geometry；source換頁/同名異hash不偷沿旧核对。\n- cancel/invalid/latepage/切案/移除source/同ID重建/unknowncap或badclosure保持原project；確認一筆native＋metadatahistory，undo/redo與busypaint一致。\n- 真save/reopen保留source、共享定義/版本、每roomrefs和完整raw幾何；.scene不假称攜source附件。\n- 桌面/390px可连续描两间且总览关系；真iOS键盘/OSchooser/download另人工，不以390px替代。\n\n## 工作包與交付\n接续[工作包分支](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/tree/docs/continuation-work-packages-followup-20261003)文件PR，新增MR工作包及Q37決策選項，BACKLOG/決策佇列同步。新格式/能力不预占编号。Refs #54；使用Refs不用Closes，既有snap/undoRedo不回復。規格ready，產品需Q37採納；無服務/產品修改、未宣稱手機或幾何測試通過。\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP77/Q37：SourcePlane/RoomCollection project附件只保存共享來源基準与typednativeRef，nativeBoundary為唯一geometry，不改Space父子。自動順序#54A→#87B→此單C；人工連續描A/B可獨立規格。Q37新共享附件待採納，產品未改。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/77/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49","id":5681740598,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUqh7Ng","number":49,"title":"[功能提案][F6] 規則試驗台與案例庫：正反例、隔離驗證、結果過期與可重用範例","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:37:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T04:20:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 八項採納／單writer進度\n\n已採納：六有限正反例、每run隔離、結果可留且來源／規則／原生執行檔／runtime與驗證程式的相關版本指紋變更stale；crash/timeout/缺能力非pass，無任意scripts。owner thread `01a104ff-3a10-74c4-b1c8-8217c6fd308d` 交有限definitions/receipts、freshness pins、validator和獨立tests；不碰live World/token/feedback或#85/shared保存。整合owner按`rule-cases`附件接線，候選各schema/capability獨立。\n\n[接口／owner／分波隊列](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d/geometry-guide/IMPLEMENTATION-QUEUE-20261004.md)， [draft PR100](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/100)，exact head `0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d`／base main1075058。共有 versioned `manifest.featureAttachments` envelope、有限kind/schema/validator、context token讀寫adapter；模型沿既有record。第一版候選新format統一為未占用/10（實作前再查main）；未知schema/kind/能力明確拒，不假輸出舊版。這是整合草案，無產品完成聲明。\n\n用戶八項批准與排程授權為本輪新依據；較早proposal「未採納」只表示當時狀態，其額外細節不整包採納。#85 PR98已合併，#24 PR97待root審查；A24實機仍未驗，不阻獨立cloud項。Refs不用Closes；root逐stage決定merge，無部署／付費／私人圖紙上傳。\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:end -->\n\n路線總工單：#43；來源與診斷導航：#44；隔離候選可與 #46 協調；施工幾何案例沿 #25 能力追加。基準 `4e90a1c89256a96ed28a7a1096c9ca627912fc91`。本單是功能提案，不是已完成的驗收平台，也不是授權使用者案例覆寫公理。\n\n## 情境與建議原因\n\n使用者建立組構規則後，希望直接看懂：哪些情境應該成立、哪些必須拒絕、修改後是否破壞原本做法。沒有聊天上下文的 agent，也需要可重現的案例而不只是一個規則名稱。\n\n例如「只交換第一處接合，第二處保持不變」可以成為明確案例。修改規則或程式後，結果能重新驗證；不能一直沿用早已過期的綠燈。\n\n## 第一版：authoring 案例，不先造生成器\n\n在現有組構工作區按需開「案例」區：從草稿／發布版本或正式範例建立案例 → 選正例／反例與明確預期 → 在隔離環境執行 → 對照實際資料與診斷 → 保存案例 → 修改來源後顯示待重驗。\n\n適合第一版的案例：\n\n- 同角色有不同 member，接合引用不能混淆。\n- 只改一個局部接合，其他 joint 定義不變。\n- 合法未選齊材料可保存；失效或錯型來源必須拒絕。\n- 同一已發布 ruleId/version 不可换內容；新版本仍合法。\n- 改名、排序、示意旋轉不改固定身分與端面語意。\n\n這些要用既有真 C 驗證路徑，不能只是 JSON 結構看起來合理或 SVG 有畫出來。\n\n## 案例與結果模型\n\n案例定義建議保存：穩定 caseId、名稱、固定規則版本或草稿指紋、具型別輸入與所需來源閉包、預期接受／拒絕及理由、可核對的關係斷言、所需執行能力。\n\n- 斷言採有限且有 schema 的判斷，如「指定 member 引用相同」「另一 joint 未變」「特定診斷與來源路徑存在」。不執行任意上傳 JavaScript／Python／shell，也不把自然語言作為不受限制的程式。\n- 「作者預期」與「核心實際結果」分欄。負例必須因指定原因拒絕，不能任何語法錯誤都算成功。\n- 沒有結果、缺能力、環境阻擋、失敗、成功、過期分開。樣本通過不等於規則對所有輸入都正確，也不等於施工／受力合格。\n- 結果記案例輸入 hash、規則／材料來源指紋、核心／驗證器版本与實際執行條件。任一關鍵來源改變後標過期，不能把舊 pass 冒充新結果。\n\n## 隔離與實作脈絡\n\n1. 案例使用與正式 app 相同的原生驗證實作，但在獨立 World／process／服務上下文內載入輸入；不要為此繞過正式引用與版本檢查。\n2. 執行不得 reset 使用者服務、提交正式候選、消耗目前 preview token 或覆寫真實 feedback。結果回覆須綁 caseId、generation、project context。\n3. 所有資料與執行都有大小、深度、案例數、時間和並行上限；取消及資源回收明確。超限不是幾何不合法，也不是驗收成功。\n4. 前端 `assembly-workspace.js` 的案例區顯示最小差異與定位；與 #44 共用 typed diagnostics，不另維護文字解析器。\n5. 案例定義與結果分開保存於完整專案附件，和 `project-store.js`／`reference-workspace.js` 定 schema、能力及恢復流程。只存結果圖不夠；重開應能重建輸入。沒有可靠 binary 識別時標版本未知，不宣稱結果仍有效。\n6. 可重用既有測試 fixtures、`tests/build_assembly_example.py` 產生的正式資料，並讓 CI 使用相同斷言契約；不要把應用內案例自動提交到 repo 的測試檔。\n7. 使用者收藏規則與材料組合，重用的是現有固定來源；不隱含開放規則巢狀、跨案共用庫或公共分享。跨案匯入需另外定義閉包／配號後才做。\n\n## 後續幾何案例：等待 #25 相應能力\n\n再增加有限配置、明確兩端支撐、精確完成料長及來源變更的案例。無生成能力時顯示未執行，不能由示意圖代替原生幾何。\n\n使用者的期望若與現行公理衝突，保存案例與矛盾说明交決策流程；不為讓案例變綠而暗改 D15/D17/I19/R6。故障注入使用隔離測試 build，不在正式使用者服務啟用。\n\n## 待執行驗收\n\n- [ ] 正例由真核心接受，反例因精確理由與相關來源被拒；設定錯誤不能假通過。\n- [ ] 一個 joint 改動後，另一個 joint 的不變斷言可實際驗證；同角色不同 member 不錯配。\n- [ ] 規則、案例輸入、材料／參數、核心版本或斷言契約改變後，舊結果顯示過期。\n- [ ] 缺能力、沒有執行、timeout、崩潰、環境阻擋各自明示，不算 pass。\n- [ ] 執行前後正式 World／history／dirty／未確認 token 及原始 feedback 不變；切專案後晚到結果不串用。\n- [ ] 真正保存重開保留案例來源及預期，可在新隔離環境重現；未知 schema／缺閉包／超限不丟原資料。\n- [ ] 針對核心或關係斷言的可控故障注入使對應案例變紅，還原後重跑正常版本；不能把編譯失敗當作成功抓到缺陷。\n- [ ] 桌面／390px 可建立、查看与執行案例；畫面能分辨作者預期、實際結果與人工狀態，不以靜態報告代替功能。\n\n第一版可獨立於 #25 交付；不要要求先完成整個方案系統，僅共用所需的候選隔離協定。既有 #24 的漏驗項仍由原單追蹤，不能因本單提供案例 UI 就宣称補測完成。\n\n後續實作提供非機密可重現案例、branch/PR、命令／exit code 与同版證據；遵循 #43 的保存、公理及不自動部署／外傳邊界。\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP49-A先member/joint/wrong-type3非機密case，B补Q35共6。joint只改draft/新publishedversion；Q35案例typed斷言/結果身份/保存待採納。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/49/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24","id":5649471704,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABULwY2A","number":24,"title":"[組構規則][AR-05] 完成整合、24 項驗收、完整回歸與可重現 PR 交付","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-30T16:10:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T04:06:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- assembly-acceptance-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 #24 有限收尾／新main整合\n\n[Draft PR97](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/97) 最終head `377440fb0a319463aa1f0f6838b6bd5298c9cd3d`，已整合#85 main `1075058be37d37b98a2a910f4f67b87583be85b3`；未自行merge。\n[逐條 A01–A24索引](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/377440fb0a319463aa1f0f6838b6bd5298c9cd3d/geometry-web/docs/ASSEMBLY-ACCEPTANCE-EVIDENCE-20261004.md)。A04/A18/A23已有真UI/native/ZIP覆盖，不重列舊gap；A11固定不同材料/版本/path與不暗升、A12四種只缺face/orientation的合法incomplete配置已補fresh native全state/dump。root要求的exact binding IDs{1,2,3}已加，防空loop。\n\n**同377head實跑full56suites：1678pass/0fail/1具名Windows GDI skip、exit0，frozen匹配，5binary fresh。** 新scene139/integrity88與#85mutation gate保留並實跑；mutationcheck48/0stale/0invalid，crashedM20保留其分類。初次stack8MiB的ac92 full fail保留，採既定16MiB重跑後zero fail。相對新main只3授權files，產品/SSOT及#85全部基準blob不變；相對原20de053測試增量僅1assert。沒有新fullbrowser冒稱。\n\nA10只有現schema拒絕、沒有巢狀求值器；**A24實體iOS/Android keyboard/OSchooser/下載仍未驗，#19/#24保持open**。#25有限D34/I42/R35早已PR53/55合併，不代表任意拓撲。八項本輪採納/各owner/shared接口另由[PR100](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/100)精確回填；#45繼續，不因人工項停止其他cloud工作。歷史段落保留其當時head與狀態。\n<!-- assembly-acceptance-20261004:end -->\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP24既有A01–23與A24handoff索引核對；#25有限三構件已由PR53/55合併，不再描述為尚未實作。A24實體iOS/OS驗收仍未驗，desktop390px與CI不代替。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n\n## 2026-10-03 17:56 UTC 最新main與實際後驗\n\nPR70已由root合併，reviewed `adf5ed4a150f09e8b1e104e16cf5265cb0247d52` → main `d5ea5311c69657376dbfb567f28fe8f5551daebe`；tree d67e80eb完全相同。Root獨立quality actual own-compile full1530/0/1GDI、無filter1855/0/79golden，之後才合併。Worker同main postmerge P8316／料單37／來源29／native18／Node63均0fail/exit0；HTTP292public/205vendor前後bytes/headers與runtime6bd936b25127/fresh/root核對成功，自有服務已停止。沒有hostedCI rerun、部署或用戶本機操作。\n\nPR71 exactdad3e91e3e44c16baf13c24a12d28ddaf457a6e1仍draft，單檔測試器Promise保留修復；原space183/timber79/helper9/獨立10/真GC通過，main70＋71本地整合183＋16＋79也通過，現在由另一agent獨立檢驗最新基底，交root決定merge。PDF校準→房間偵測由另一hotfixthread01a102d4負責，避免競寫。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard/OSchooser/下載與Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗；完整#47雙向定位、實物去重、assembly-owned／faces+timbers保存模型、F1b durableidentity與F4b加工裁切餘料仍open。#45擴大入口／F2b與#57–62新增來源子規則仍須相應契約／公理採納；不因issue正文放寬。PR52已合併1805bb5，PR53有限D34/I42/R35已合併68c4ac13。較早狀態如下為歷史。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 16:56 UTC 已完成的雲端切片與精確剩餘\n\n目前main `8993b03b91d27030d210d6478e08764af51385d7`；PR69 reviewed175b308d已合併、同tree且postmain入口16／binding16／料單37／HTTP291+205全驗。PR52早已合併1805bb5；PR53有限D34/I42/R35生成早已合併68c4ac13，不能仍記作未合併／未實作。\n\n已交root審查的两個draft、未合併／未部署：\n\n- [PR70](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/70) exact `adf5ed4a150f09e8b1e104e16cf5265cb0247d52`／base899：單一保存模型明選角材原生快照與核對CSV，一對一既有入口。完整47suites1530pass/0fail/1具名GDI；**無filterChromium1855/0/0skip/completedtrue/79golden**；prod+ASan各121/121、獨立APPROVE。真space183／timber79／binding16／來源29與HTTP292public/205vendor、前後fresh/runtime全驗，最終桌面與390px截圖已看。歷史27/33不被live29/35或missing偷換，模型/context/close/late失效零Blob、連點一次。實際producer目前拒絕assembly-owned savedmodel及faces+timbers，不製造正例。\n- [PR71](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/71) exact `dad3e91e3e44c16baf13c24a12d28ddaf457a6e1`／base899：單檔空間testharness復用既有Promise保留工具，避免ChromeGC中途停止；空間183/0、timber79/0、helper9／獨立10、真GC及不重試mutation／cleanup證據通過、APPROVE。與PR70隔離。\n\n兩PR的Actions run37137739059／37138428595七jobs都未執行、steps/logs null，不稱greenCI或產品assertionfail；既有免費quota耗盡記錄，沒有rerun unchanged／付費／改policy。自有測試服務已依root/PID停止，不碰用戶服務。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard／OS chooser／下載及Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗；整張#47的完整雙向定位、跨表示實物去重、F1b durableidentity、F4b加工裁切餘料、#45其餘grid-source＋boundary／附件／F2b仍open。#57–62的新來源子規則須先採納#58具體差異，現D19/I25/R23單父格及末節全格批次未定案限制保持，不因issue正文放寬。#54他人PR63/64交付保留，不競寫。這些缺口與已完成雲端切片分開。\n\n以下是較早需求／歷史，最新節為目前事實。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 16:21 UTC 最新已合併 main 與雲端後驗\n\nPR69 已由持有原始 exact 批准的 root 合併：reviewed `175b308d2a2523aa1da81d679d536c7bc5de7905` → main `8993b03b91d27030d210d6478e08764af51385d7`；tree438e1cc35072069f3699b35274d25acef8def153完全相同。合併前完整47suites1499pass/0fail/1具名GDI skip、無filterChromium1839/0/completedtrue/78golden及獨立review通過。合併後同main真P82入口16/0、既有binding16/0、P80/P81料單37/0、HTTP291public/205vendor逐bytes與headers相符；前後runtime68d9a81b76b4b0f571565ffad2c76da5bde83073fe293b8a43154669af7e6a1c/root/fresh正確，自有測試服務已停止。沒有部署或擴大公理。\n\nPR52早已合併1805bb5，PR53有限生成器早已合併68c4ac13；本輪不是只修CI，後續資料正確性與已批准切片已有55/56/63/65/66/67/68/69交付（以各PR精確正文為準）。#25有限D34/I42/R35不代表任意生成語義完成。A24實體手機keyboard/OS chooser/download與Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗，保留open。Actionsincludedquota耗盡時七jobs未執行，不能稱greenCI；沒有付費或改billing/policy。\n\n下一實作 #47 的單一保存模型原生快照料單 draft [PR70](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/70) 已整合main899；完整非瀏覽器1530pass/0fail/1GDI，當前native production及ASan121/121。正在完成真下載/模型失效/390px及無filter full，尚未宣稱最終全部驗收或合併。\n\n較早狀態／原始需求如下，僅最新節為現況。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 14:28 UTC 最新 main 與既有配置修復\n\nPR68 經 parent exact-head 獨立審查 APPROVE 後已合併；reviewed `8dc8159ff9f5cee48954db00e6148ca157e14c4d` → main `f52ed1d5cab2486ee8e3ea620dfeeb123ca76c81`，tree `e4527e8febc0ccf928ea2171ecc03814d192a7f9` 全等。完整46套件1478/0/1具名GDI、無filterChromium1823/0/0skip/completedtrue/77golden、真配置UI16/0、space183/0與材質來源79/0已驗；postmerge 新World37/0、真binding16/0、HTTP289/205 bytes+headers/runtimefresh全部exit0，自有服務已停止。\n\n目前 #45 F2a 首個 existing-contract 情境入口正在隔離分支實作，尚未當成功能完成／合併。PR52已合併1805bb5、PR53有限D34/I42/R35生成已合併68c4ac1；不是任意拓樸。A24實體手機／OS鍵盤、選檔與下載仍未驗，總工單保持open，與cloud可繼續項分開。Actions quota jobs未執行不能宣稱greenCI。下列較早main／draft紀錄作歷史保留。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 13:36 UTC cloud 整合完成／最新 main\n\n唯一 repo ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom。PR65→66→67 已依後續明確授權順序合併；目前 main `2af20c11203f43fb2ce51b8562958623c6942587`。PR67 reviewed head `e3d3ffc8ffde45e35d273924dcfd41c0bb47e7f5` 與合併 tree `a71f6354c789e43429b5ab48e6b8206ea4ed1a17` 全等：同版完整46套件1462/0/1具名 WindowsGDI skip、完整無filter Chromium1823/0/0skip/completedtrue/77段golden相符；獨立production81/81 + ASan/UBSan81/81、正式來源操作29/0、space183/0、材質來源79/0。新main另以fresh World實測P80/P81 37/0/exit0及288公開路由／205vendor bytes+headers全等；所有自有測試服務已核對停止，未部署。\n\n[PR68](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/68) exact `8dc8159ff9f5cee48954db00e6148ca157e14c4d` 是基於新main的draft，尚未合併：修既有配置create/published-edit/late/repeat對同ID版本但來源內容已更換的守門。完整1478/0/1具名GDI、無filterChromium1823/0/77golden相符、真配置UI16/0、space183/0、材質來源79/0，獨立61/61與額外37/37、歷史對照assert-red。不是新F2a入口／registry完成，未新增公理／schema。\n\nPR52已合併1805bb5；PR55修正已先整入PR53、PR53有限D34/I42/R35已合併68c4ac1，不能再把它記成未實作或draft待合併，也不等於任意拓樸生成。A24實體手機鍵盤／OS選檔下載與Windows現場仍未驗，保留open。最新67/68遠端CI七jobs均未執行（steps/logs null，included minutes2000/2000耗盡），不是綠CI或產品測試失敗。\n\n以下保留歷史與原始需求；當時狀態不覆蓋本文最新事實。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 cloud 最新精確事實（保留歷史與未驗項）\n\nPR52 已合併 `1805bb585a74f4a5759367aab7ef8de016d96d4d`；PR55 修正先整入 PR53，PR53 的有限 D34/I42/R35 生成已合併 `68c4ac13ec963dae4c9776fb67dac7eff003be06`。不是任意拓樸生成。\n\nPR56 reviewed head `c1bc56675a329d81210265ade69e148cf8825ea3` 已合併 main `693a1c875584a8556b491d3534525a4624ca53c6`；reviewed/merge tree 全等。實測同 head 完整非瀏覽器1393 pass/0 fail/1具名 Windows GDI skip；完整無filter Chromium1809/0/0skip/completed:true、76段 golden matched，raw1僅P38預期注入、未預期0；獨立 space183/0、材質／來源79/0，獨立審查無剩餘P0/P1/P2。postmerge新World P80 23/0/exit0且runtime fresh/root/version核對通過；其他owner已合併PR63/#54與PR64均保留。\n\nA24 **實體手機鍵盤、OS選檔／下载及Windows現場驗收仍未驗**，不能用Linux／390px／綠CI冒稱完成。GitHub Actions included minutes2000/2000已耗盡；run37118444759七jobs未執行（steps/logs null），不是七產品測試失敗或綠CI，未重跑相同CI、付費或改billing／policy。\n\n本工單保持open，保留未完成的A24與原要求；不把有限生成／原生料單 slice 當所有跨場景功能完成。\n\n\n以下原正文保留原始需求與當時紀錄；其中過去「未實作／待核准／draft未合併」不代表目前狀態，最新精確事實以本文頂端為準。\n\n---\n父工單：#19。前置：#20、#21、#22、#23。\n\n本單由整合／驗收 agent 負責，但不能只審文件：發現缺口要在授權範圍內修正並重跑；只有所有相關工作接到同一個正式 app，才可交付第一階段。\n\n## 完整使用流程\n\n在正式畫布使用真 bridge：空白專案 → 空白組構規則 → 角色／member／joint → 局部交换連續方 → 保存未發布草稿 → 真正保存並重開 → 發布版本 → 主副支材料綁定 → 保留不完整綁定 → 保存重開 → 建立第二版本並明選升級／取消 → 復原重做。\n\n不能只用工程 API 建好資料後截圖，宣稱使用者可以完成以上 UI 流程。測試初始化可用 API，但新功能的關鍵操作必須有真實 UI 驗證。\n\n## 原提案 24 項驗收矩陣\n\n全部初始為未執行。每列最終記錄：test file／test name、命令、結果、SHA、artifact、例外或人工狀態。斷言數不當作端到端流程數。\n\n| ID | 情境 | 必須觀察到的結果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| A01 | 無房間／材料／網格時建立 | 能建立並保存合法草稿，不暗建面／角材 |\n| A02 | 空白規則新增角色及接合 | 自訂可用，不只選固定範本 |\n| A03 | 交換局部連續方 | 核心定義與示意都變，非只換名字 |\n| A04 | 同角色在不同接合採不同配置 | 局部關係獨立保存，不受全域 priority 覆蓋 |\n| A05 | 選端面與側面 | 保存型別／固定身份；視圖或游標位置不代替定義 |\n| A06 | 同處矛盾接合 | 指出兩個衝突條件，不採最後輸入者勝出 |\n| A07 | 角色改名／重排 | 原 slot/member/joint 引用不變 |\n| A08 | 刪除被接合引用的角色 | 拒絕或在明確交易解除，不留孤兒 |\n| A09 | 矩形框的幾何鄰接環 | 不誤判為求值依賴循環 |\n| A10 | 非法定義依賴循環 | 契約可表達的真循環原子拒絕；不為測試擅增巢狀規則功能 |\n| A11 | 主副支同材／不同材 | 各角色來源明確且獨立 |\n| A12 | 材料或方向未選齊 | 可存合法未完成綁定，不宣稱已產生施工幾何 |\n| A13 | 不存在或錯型材料引用 | 拒絕，不補預設或當空欄 |\n| A14 | 拖卡片／縮放旋轉示意 | 定義／接合身份／材料對應不變 |\n| A15 | 複製規則 | 新身份，不覆寫同名來源 |\n| A16 | 修改發布規則 | 新版本，舊綁定仍指原版 |\n| A17 | 明選升版後取消 | 原綁定／World／history 不變 |\n| A18 | 完整專案保存重開 | 規則全部版本、綁定、草稿和位置保留 |\n| A19 | 建立／刪除／改綁的復原重做 | native 和專案資料協調，dirty 一致 |\n| A20 | 未知格式／移除必要能力 | 明確拒絕，原專案不變 |\n| A21 | 舊 geometry-canvas/1–6 | 舊能力與來源正常，不暗遷移組法 |\n| A22 | 自訂規則與舊 D15/I19 不相容 | authoring 不生成非法角材、不放寬底線 |\n| A23 | 桌面、390px 建立／編輯／返回／保存 | 真操作可用、無遮擋／失焦，離開守門一致 |\n| A24 | 實體手機鍵盤／OS 檔案對話框 | 人工記錄；窄版瀏覽器不得冒充實機 |\n\nA10 若因首版完全不提供某類定義引用而只能在 schema 層拒絕，須明確記錄實際可驗範圍及原因，不能寫成跑過不存在的求值器。A24 未驗可交付待實機驗收版本，但不得宣稱全平台已完成；未驗項保留 open 追蹤。\n\n## 不能漏掉的整合回歸\n\n- 實際編譯目前 core、bridge、model adapter，記錄編譯版本和 binary hash，避免拿舊 binary 測新程式。\n- 新核心規則／交易測試，完整專案與草稿測試，原生 `.scene` round-trip。\n- 既有 scene cases、引用契約、橋接完整性、參數、工程材料、網格／子格、空間建模／保存測試。\n- 完整 `geometry-web/cdp_test.js` 不帶 ONLY/filter；新 assembly workflow 已在完整入口內執行。局部測試可加速開發，但不能取代最後完整回歸。\n- 正典同步、`--check` 和 `tests/test_axiom_reader.py`，及規定的追溯／見證檢查。\n- 凍結預览→改動其他定義→舊 token 拒絕；切專案→延遲回覆不污染；保存當下有未提交草稿仍保存最新內容。\n- 對關鍵守門做至少幾項故障注入／mutation：略過衝突檢查、丟失來源、跳過預覽、把 UI 交換只改文字，測試必須變紅；完成後還原注入版本並重跑。\n\n## 環境與證據紀律\n\n依目前 package.json／tests 文件重現，不僅照抄歷史命令。使用隔離暫存輸出及 `GEOMETRY_FEEDBACK_DIR`，避免污染使用者 feedback。現有 CDP 可能覆寫已提交截圖，測試前後核對並只還原本次測試造成的產物，不動他人的修改。\n\nWindows Smart App Control／GDI、瀏覽器可用性等阻擋與產品失敗分開記；可用已授權 Linux／WSL 跑同原始碼路徑，但不得停用安全設定。沒有真正跑到的測試明列未驗／skip，不能記 pass。\n\n## PR 與操作交付\n\n- 提供開發分支、起始／最終 commit、PR 及變更清單；不直接合併 main、強推或部署。\n- PR 不以 `Closes #19` 在未完成驗收時自動關單；先使用 `Refs #19`。\n- 一個不含機密的可重開 `.gcanvas` 範例：規則草稿、兩個發布版本、角材組合；來源從正式模型生成，不能手刻假合法包。\n- 實際啟動／編譯命令、已核對的連接埠與 UI 點擊路徑，版本可見；不是只有 localhost 字串卻没有啟動說明。\n- 在既有文件体系記錄 `ASSEMBLY-RULES-USE` 與 `ASSEMBLY-RULES-VALIDATION`（或對應現有位置）、BACKLOG、DOM-CONTRACT，鏈接實際測試 artifact／CI log。不要把私人 `%TEMP%` 路徑當成唯一供審查證據。\n- 每項驗收具有 code/test/record 對應，列出未實作與未驗證。第一階段只涵蓋 authoring＋binding，不是角材生成器。\n\n## 關單條件\n\n- [ ] #20–#23 的結果在同一個可重現整合版本。\n- [ ] A01–A23 有逐項證據／經明確說明的能力边界；A24 狀態如實保留。\n- [ ] 完整回歸、截圖、console、正式保存重開及故障注入證据可核對。\n- [ ] 實際功能、範例、操作文件及審查 PR 交付給使用者；不能交一份未接入 app 的 patch 就說完成。\n- [ ] 最終是否合併與標記總工單完成，由專案擁有者核對；沒有被自動關掉的剩餘工作。\n\n## 2026-10-02 已合併證據與剩餘驗收\n\n第一階段 authoring/binding 已由 [PR #26](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/26) 及 [PR #41](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/41) 接入正式 app。以下為已合併 `fd8f38b42bc0eb9eb8ea16595dfc76e83e7bdea2` 的證據回填，不是本輪未提交修改的測試結果。原始需求與未勾選驗收仍保留；本次不自動關單。\n\n[合併後 CI run 36972304794](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/36972304794) 七個 job 全數通過：native 1267 pass/0 fail/1 明示 GDI skip；canvas 1660/0/0，74 golden；assembly 84；grid 138；space 183；timber 79；documents 47。本地同版原生 assembly+ParameterRefs 28/28、Node assembly 三檔 32/32、真 Chrome P77 84/84 的證據亦已保留。\n\n當時待補列（下列缺口已由 #51 完成，最新狀態見本文頂端）：A04 局部交換的 UI/保存 oracle；A13 assembly 專屬錯型與容量負例；A15 MAX 配號與草稿保留碰撞；A18 正式範例逐版本 binding；A23 390px 空白建立完整規則；新 ASan/UBSan；本輪最新 head 的 mutation 注入與還原重跑；驗收文件中舊 PR26 計數改為實際新結果。A10 僅驗首版 schema 拒絕不支援巢狀引用，不聲稱有不存在的求值器。A24 保持 open/人工未驗，不能用桌面窄版冒充實機。#25 有限生成器已有 draft #53；第一階段 authoring 證據不等同生成器驗收，尚未合併。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/24/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46","id":5681719915,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUqgqaw","number":46,"title":"[功能提案][F3] 保存 A/B 候選方案並比較來源、接合與幾何差異","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:35:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T04:01:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:start -->\n## 2026-10-04 八項採納／單writer進度\n\n已採納：完整独立A/B專案快照、原圖資產去重共用；B不改A，比較後整體採用且可回復；不做逐物件細部merge或搬舊undo。第二波在共用附件接口穩定後推進，閉包包含所有已支持附件；目前沒有宣稱此產品切片已驗。\n\n[接口／owner／分波隊列](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d/geometry-guide/IMPLEMENTATION-QUEUE-20261004.md)， [draft PR100](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/100)，exact head `0230e436870ec3ba06fcb0735ffabc3b7427979d`／base main1075058。共有 versioned `manifest.featureAttachments` envelope、有限kind/schema/validator、context token讀寫adapter；模型沿既有record。第一版候選新format統一為未占用/10（實作前再查main）；未知schema/kind/能力明確拒，不假輸出舊版。這是整合草案，無產品完成聲明。\n\n用戶八項批准與排程授權為本輪新依據；較早proposal「未採納」只表示當時狀態，其額外細節不整包採納。#85 PR98已合併，#24 PR97待root審查；A24實機仍未驗，不阻獨立cloud項。Refs不用Closes；root逐stage決定merge，無部署／付費／私人圖紙上傳。\n<!-- accepted-integration-20261004:end -->\n\n路線總工單：#43；可共用的來源／差異語意：#44；生成結果後續接 #25。基準 `4e90a1c89256a96ed28a7a1096c9ca627912fc91`。本單是待選定的產品／工程提案，沒有因建單啟動實作或核准新保存格式。\n\n## 使用情境與原因\n\n使用者要保留 A 方案，再試 B 的網格間距、角材來源或組構規則，並列查看差異後選擇。\n\n- 復原／重做：修正剛才的操作。\n- 規則版本：保留一份固定發布定義。\n- 候選方案：同時保留不同設計選擇。\n\n三者不能互相代替。尤其「相同外形，但誰通長／誰端接不同」是本專案的核心辨識案例，不能只比較外接盒、總體積或畫面像不像。\n\n## 第一版範圍與 UI 流程\n\n保存目前為 A → 從明確基準建立 B → 隔離編輯 B → 開啟差異表及可用的同步視角 → 點差異定位 → 整體採用 B 或保留 A → 保存重開。\n\n先做建立、命名、保存、比較、整體採用；不做多人即時協作、任意分支合併、逐物件挑選合併或自動最佳方案。\n\n第一版可以只比較現有正式定義及來源，不必等 #25；幾何／料長只在對應執行器有能力且成功求值時比較。未生成規則不能用示意圖冒充施工模型。\n\n## 建議資料模型與隔離方式\n\n1. 每個方案有独立身分、固定基準及可重建來源快照／依賴閉包；可先採明確容量限制的完整快照，之後再優化去重。不先做複雜增量合併。\n2. 快照至少定義哪些 scene、草稿、模型／投影附件與檔案資產屬於此方案。正式資料與編輯草稿分開，來源資產依內容身分引用；不要保存空有 URI 但永遠無法重建的假方案。\n3. B 修改自己的參數，預設不影響 A。跟進新主方案或升級固定材料／規則版本是另一次明選與預覽。\n4. 比較鍵區分專案／方案 namespace、kind/id/version 及可證明的來源沿革。同源複製可保留可追溯對應；無可靠對應標示未匹配，不依名稱、幾何相似或列表順序硬配。\n5. 求值使用隔離 World／服務上下文，不反覆覆寫正式 World，也不擠掉使用者唯一的未確認 token。服務與 UI 請求綁定 scenario/context/revision。\n6. 容量包含方案數、總快照及展開大小；不靠無限深複製取得功能。建立方案失敗保留原案與草稿。\n\n## 差異呈現\n\n至少分新增、移除、來源身分／版本變更、有效值變更、局部接合變更；顯示名稱變更可另外列，不讓它決定身分。\n\n例如 A/B 都是 27 mm，但由 literal 改成另一個 ParameterRef，仍列來源變更。同一外形改組法，列出受影響的接合與分件，即使外包絡相同。\n\nUI 在既有畫布／模型工作區按需開比較，同視角並列或疊合，另有文字／圖形差異標記，不只依顏色。點差異定位正確方案內的物件；缺執行能力則只有定義差異並明示原因。\n\n## 採用、保存與復原\n\n- 「採用 B」先驗當下 context/revision、來源閉包與草稿處置，再用明確的方案切換／載入交易原子提交。不能用逐條同版重宣告規避規則不可變性。\n- 原方案保留；整體採用可復原／重做。取消、過期回覆、網路遺失、另一專案載入不得部分替換 World 或附件。\n- 方案是新的持久化語意，須先定完整專案 schema／能力、舊檔相容、資產携帶及錯誤格式。不能偷偷塞到 /7，讓不支援的讀取器忽略。\n- 不把 UI 快取、候選 token 或舊執行結果當成唯一可保存定義。重開後能重新求值並核對，結果來源版本可見。\n\n## 程式落點与拆分\n\n- 原生／bridge：同一核心的隔離求值與場景載入，typed differences 可與 #44 共用。\n- `project-store.js`、`reference-workspace.js`：方案附件、基準身分、ContextHistory 與原子替換。\n- `app.js`、既有模型工作區：A/B 選擇、差異表、同步相機與定位。\n- 建議按「固定快照保存＋讀回」「隔離試改＋比較」「原子採用＋復原」分切片；每個切片都接正式 UI、資料與測試，不只交 schema。\n- 与 #24 的身分保留／草稿生命週期協調；不把所有後續功能視為前置。\n\n## 待執行驗收\n\n- [ ] 改 B 的參數、材料或接合，A 的正式資料與草稿完全不變。\n- [ ] 真正保存到完整專案，再以新上下文重開；A/B 與各自固定來源均可重建。\n- [ ] 同值換來源、同截面換版本、同外形不同接合均列出差異。\n- [ ] 同名／相同數字 ID 在不同方案不錯配；無可靠沿革明示未匹配。\n- [ ] 比較／求值不污染現行 World，也不使正在確認的無關候選失效。\n- [ ] 採用 B、取消、undo/redo、延遲與遺失回覆，World／附件／dirty 一致且沒有雙重提交。\n- [ ] 缺依賴、未知格式、超容量、未支援幾何能力，明确拒絕或降為有標示的定義比較，不能假綠。\n- [ ] 正式桌面及窄版能完成建立／比较／採用，使用文字／圖形確認差異，不以靜態 mock 或單純 JSON.parse 作驗收。\n\n本單的方案比較不自行引入施工安全、全域最佳化或任意巢狀。後續提交須附可重開範例、branch/PR、同版測試命令及未驗項，依 #43 共用交付準則。\n\n## 規格來源\n\n`geometry-guide/PRODUCT-VISION.md` 的同外形不同方案與可組合方向；`geometry-core/ASSEMBLY-RULES-CONTRACT.md` 的固定版本、來源與確認；`geometry-web/docs/SPACE-MODELING.md` 的現行快照與歷史邊界。均以建單基準查核，開工再讀最新 main。\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP46-A完整固定A/B快照freshcontext保存讀回，再隔離B修改與整體採用；Q33閉包/namespace/交易待採納，不持久化undo堆疊。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/46/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47","id":5681727592,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUqhIaA","number":47,"title":"[功能提案][F4] 模型連動構件料單：完成尺寸、來源與雙向定位，後續銜接裁切／餘料","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-02T18:35:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T03:17:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- model-snapshot-nav-status:start -->\n2026-10-04 #47 **本bounded slice已由root独立APPROVE並合併完成**：[PR96](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/96)，reviewed head `bb2c73914284eb503520710febc5d661e928e41a` → main `1c83b5e76cb0226bfd9c6c92289c8ab0760413e4`；whole tree `0bd7852a63ee9ef2aed6fbf88ade2e1b78d6804c` 完全相同，merge無產品delta。\n\n本次已完成：同一saved ordinary-plan record，native雙端proof／唯一typed timber root→完整mesh通過後的料單↔3D選取／定位；DPR2、390px真touch、root0及held pointer→wheel→release不誤選、後續click可用。普通plan native快照CSV已由PR70合併，現可與同record3D連動。來源／proof／owner／record／context失效清除兩端選取，無liveID／尺寸／名稱／array猜身分、無幾何／history回寫、公理／SSOT／schema／F1b未改。\n\n**postmerge在exact main1c83實際執行**：Node focused73／73、真native P83/P86 focused16+20=36／0、completed=true、zero browser errors；reader --check各項pass（patches0）、五支native依PR93來源＋binary SHA oracle全fresh；隔離runtime `378614d8ba5eddb5ac1985f6a25a967d8f37e5b7bb3d9504ff78ba266f5876d3`、root／fresh核對正確。合併前bb2完整nonbrowser54suites1645／0／1具名GDI、reader41／41；6f full CDP1970／0／0、82golden matched／fullspace183／0保留原執行head，產品Git object／runtime／native SHA相同，不宣稱1c83新跑full。\n\npostmerge證據 `/tmp/geometry-tests/geometry47-navigation-20261004/postmerge-1c83b5e/final-evidence.json`，SHA256 `af2dea7f9c18fe2285028ca611ade700990742d0d12fc67ce3ca1c0022b145e5`。無部署、私人圖紙上傳、付費／安全變更，原始checkout1805bb5未動。GitHub本輪已核對PR96 merged、main1c83、0 open PR。\n\n**整張#47保持open，以下未完成並非本slice能力**：跨表示實物計量／去重及durable incarnation契約；assembly-owned／faces+timbers的saved model producer能力；F4b加工補償、鋸縫／末刀／裁切與餘料保存；A24實體iOS鍵盤／OSchooser／download及Windows現場未驗，Linux具名GDI略過不冒充驗收。這些需相應新契約／公理決策或人工驗收，不把相同ID／尺寸／UUID／Worldhash當去重證據。\n\n軟體可獨立續做項另列隊列：#85 current-main read-only mutation check仍exit1（48項44stale＋M56invalid＋3retired），不需新公理；Q31–Q37仍未採納；#54由root保留原owner，不接管。repo較早「#47取消／未雙向定位」段落屬歷史，以此最新合併範圍為準。\n<!-- model-snapshot-nav-status:end -->\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 17:56 UTC 最新main與實際後驗\n\nPR70已由root合併，reviewed `adf5ed4a150f09e8b1e104e16cf5265cb0247d52` → main `d5ea5311c69657376dbfb567f28fe8f5551daebe`；tree d67e80eb完全相同。Root獨立quality actual own-compile full1530/0/1GDI、無filter1855/0/79golden，之後才合併。Worker同main postmerge P8316／料單37／來源29／native18／Node63均0fail/exit0；HTTP292public/205vendor前後bytes/headers與runtime6bd936b25127/fresh/root核對成功，自有服務已停止。沒有hostedCI rerun、部署或用戶本機操作。\n\nPR71 exactdad3e91e3e44c16baf13c24a12d28ddaf457a6e1仍draft，單檔測試器Promise保留修復；原space183/timber79/helper9/獨立10/真GC通過，main70＋71本地整合183＋16＋79也通過，現在由另一agent獨立檢驗最新基底，交root決定merge。PDF校準→房間偵測由另一hotfixthread01a102d4負責，避免競寫。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard/OSchooser/下載與Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗；完整#47雙向定位、實物去重、assembly-owned／faces+timbers保存模型、F1b durableidentity與F4b加工裁切餘料仍open。#45擴大入口／F2b與#57–62新增來源子規則仍須相應契約／公理採納；不因issue正文放寬。PR52已合併1805bb5，PR53有限D34/I42/R35已合併68c4ac13。較早狀態如下為歷史。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 16:56 UTC 已完成的雲端切片與精確剩餘\n\n目前main `8993b03b91d27030d210d6478e08764af51385d7`；PR69 reviewed175b308d已合併、同tree且postmain入口16／binding16／料單37／HTTP291+205全驗。PR52早已合併1805bb5；PR53有限D34/I42/R35生成早已合併68c4ac13，不能仍記作未合併／未實作。\n\n已交root審查的两個draft、未合併／未部署：\n\n- [PR70](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/70) exact `adf5ed4a150f09e8b1e104e16cf5265cb0247d52`／base899：單一保存模型明選角材原生快照與核對CSV，一對一既有入口。完整47suites1530pass/0fail/1具名GDI；**無filterChromium1855/0/0skip/completedtrue/79golden**；prod+ASan各121/121、獨立APPROVE。真space183／timber79／binding16／來源29與HTTP292public/205vendor、前後fresh/runtime全驗，最終桌面與390px截圖已看。歷史27/33不被live29/35或missing偷換，模型/context/close/late失效零Blob、連點一次。實際producer目前拒絕assembly-owned savedmodel及faces+timbers，不製造正例。\n- [PR71](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/71) exact `dad3e91e3e44c16baf13c24a12d28ddaf457a6e1`／base899：單檔空間testharness復用既有Promise保留工具，避免ChromeGC中途停止；空間183/0、timber79/0、helper9／獨立10、真GC及不重試mutation／cleanup證據通過、APPROVE。與PR70隔離。\n\n兩PR的Actions run37137739059／37138428595七jobs都未執行、steps/logs null，不稱greenCI或產品assertionfail；既有免費quota耗盡記錄，沒有rerun unchanged／付費／改policy。自有測試服務已依root/PID停止，不碰用戶服務。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard／OS chooser／下載及Windowsmanual/GDI仍未驗；整張#47的完整雙向定位、跨表示實物去重、F1b durableidentity、F4b加工裁切餘料、#45其餘grid-source＋boundary／附件／F2b仍open。#57–62的新來源子規則須先採納#58具體差異，現D19/I25/R23單父格及末節全格批次未定案限制保持，不因issue正文放寬。#54他人PR63/64交付保留，不競寫。這些缺口與已完成雲端切片分開。\n\n以下是較早需求／歷史，最新節為目前事實。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 16:30 UTC 正在落地：保存模型原生快照料單\n\nmain已是 `8993b03b91d27030d210d6478e08764af51385d7`（PR69已合併／同tree後驗37＋16＋16及HTTP291/205通過），不再是較早f52／approval-blocked狀態。本項 [draft PR70](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/70) 正在完成同main整合及最終驗證，未合併。遠端checkpoint ee2480c5，新的main整合與P83修正在隔離分支持續，最終exact會回填。\n\n目前實際：完整47suites1530pass/0fail/1具名WindowsGDI skip、production+ASan各121/121與獨立APPROVE；同版SI/app維持獨立63/63＋21原生/lifecycle proofs。真P83 browser已通過8項：真producer的同面不同原點ID0/4、排除另一承載面ID9、真正下載逐bytes/BOM/mm/model/context/sourceFP、cm只改呈現、正式gcanvas重開、390px44px無溢出、live29/35仍保留歷史27/33、liveID0 missing仍兩件歷史快照。遲到回覆負例正在逐項核對，無filter full／最終golden未完成，**不稱整張#47或最終全部驗收完成**。\n\nBounded one-model explicit input.timbers；不加live/另一model，不用UUID/範本/尺寸/Worldhash假造實物去重。既有來源disclosure一對一替換核對匯出，原生candidate/timberReferences同World、保存input與canonicalpackage nativeFP相等；hash領域分開，typed工程來源/支撐保留。Producer目前拒絕assembly-owned saved-model與faces+timbers，這些scope、模型內完整雙向定位、durable identity/F1b、F4b加工/裁切/餘料、A24實體手機/OS/Windows仍缺口。沒有新公理、schema、部署、付費或私人圖紙。\n\n較早需求與紀錄保留如下；最新節才是目前事實。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 15:16 UTC cloud 最新精確狀態（較早紀錄保留作歷史）\n\nmain 仍為 `f52ed1d5cab2486ee8e3ea620dfeeb123ca76c81`；PR68 已合併且 postmerge 新 World／binding／HTTP 核對通過。PR69 ready exact `175b308d2a2523aa1da81d679d536c7bc5de7905`，47 suites1499pass/0fail/1具名GDI skip、完整無filter Chromium1839/0/0skip/completedtrue/78golden、真binding16/0、space183/0、材質來源79/0、HTTP291public/205vendor；獨立review APPROVE與native35/35＋ASan35/35。這是 published-rule→材料配置的 bounded F2a existing-contract入口，不代表#45全部完成。兩次同exact guarded merge 均被 automatic approval review 拒絕：轉交root批准與逐字user授權仍被視為assistant-transmitted evidence，原委派限制worker不自行merge；已停止重試，請root主執行者合併此head。沒有換工具／直接push繞過，尚未合併或部署。\n\n#47 實際開發中：隔離 `feat/model-snapshot-schedule-20261003` 的 native commit `4982fd1e60bbe137a09932055d9b232d6274a63b` 讓同一次 saved World 的既有 `/sources/snapshot` 帶出 `timberReferences`，不借liveWorld，無新route/schema/幾何計算；production86/86與ASan/UBSan86/86、各89native sessions exit0，五個新tests在immutable f52 baseline皆assertion red，兩World九個live replies逐bytes不變。前端另worktree落地單一保存模型的明選 `input.timbers`、既有decorated原生料單adapter、版本／新鮮度標示及CSV；尚未完成整合/full browser，尚無此切片PR。禁止與live／其他model合併計量，不以UUID、同尺寸、範本或Worldhash dedup；durable incarnation仍unknown。\n\nA24實體手機keyboard/OS chooser/download與Windowsmanual/GDI未驗。Actions included quota耗盡，七jobs未執行不能稱greenCI；未付費/改policy。可繼續的單一snapshot導出與需先定案的跨表示實物計量鍵、F1b durable identity/rebuild、F4b鋸縫/末刀/保存、#58新語義分開，#46/#48/#49/#54 broader缺口保持open。Issue原正文只是需求背景，不放寬公理。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-10-03 cloud 最新精確事實（保留歷史與未驗項）\n\nPR52 已合併 `1805bb585a74f4a5759367aab7ef8de016d96d4d`；PR55 修正先整入 PR53，PR53 的有限 D34/I42/R35 生成已合併 `68c4ac13ec963dae4c9776fb67dac7eff003be06`。不是任意拓樸生成。\n\nPR56 reviewed head `c1bc56675a329d81210265ade69e148cf8825ea3` 已合併 main `693a1c875584a8556b491d3534525a4624ca53c6`；reviewed/merge tree 全等。實測同 head 完整非瀏覽器1393 pass/0 fail/1具名 Windows GDI skip；完整無filter Chromium1809/0/0skip/completed:true、76段 golden matched，raw1僅P38預期注入、未預期0；獨立 space183/0、材質／來源79/0，獨立審查無剩餘P0/P1/P2。postmerge新World P80 23/0/exit0且runtime fresh/root/version核對通過；其他owner已合併PR63/#54與PR64均保留。\n\nA24 **實體手機鍵盤、OS選檔／下载及Windows現場驗收仍未驗**，不能用Linux／390px／綠CI冒稱完成。GitHub Actions included minutes2000/2000已耗盡；run37118444759七jobs未執行（steps/logs null），不是七產品測試失敗或綠CI，未重跑相同CI、付費或改billing／policy。\n\n#47下一批 [PR65](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/65) 正式 native/index/registry/P81 已接線，最終 exact head `b35e3bb94b4f6c26e39632d76865c10e11a61ada`、base main693。獨立審查 P2（偽造 instanceFingerprint／支撐 member/version／不存在 timber仍CSV）已修正，actual-native20負例全部拒，Node20/20；完整native44suites1417/0/1具名GDI；完整無filter Chromium1823/0/0skip/completedtrue/exit0，77段golden全等（P80=23/P81=14），raw1僅預期P38/unexpected0；space183/0及另材質來源79/0均exit0。兩份獨立review無剩餘P0/P1/P2，直接production native69/69、ASan/UBSan69/69、0skip/無sanitizer診斷，正式binary拒絕所有測試故障命令。post-test runtime fresh/root/version正確，treeclean；只停止own synthetic services，未碰用戶服務。author af588的TEMP接線注入結果只保留歷史；不是最終正式全量證據。Parent後續明確授權65→66→67依序合併；PR65 reviewed head已合併main `de96174d3d3b3fc887868a2a2e68527e84185a9e`，reviewed/merge tree全等。PR66 runtime來源閉包修正也已合併main `9e252ae3b2177f92ecc2ae1d21f9513b62d86134`，fullnative1430/0/1具名GDI、fullChromium1823/0/77goldenmatched；postmerge新World P80/P81 37/0/0skip/completedtrue/raw0/exit0、284public/205vendor routes內容與version headers全等、runtimefresh/root/version通過。未部署。CI37120545221七jobssteps/logsnull未執行，不能稱CI綠。\n\nPR67/#44 已完整整合並依ordered授權合併 main `2af20c11203f43fb2ce51b8562958623c6942587`，reviewed exact `e3d3ffc8ffde45e35d273924dcfd41c0bb47e7f5`／merged tree全等。原生savedWorld source/support projection已原子适配，確實placed/surface/axis及all8 ownerfacts核對，不借liveWorld、無JS contact重算；samegeometry provenance變更反映來源新鮮度，不虛構遞迴求值。完整1462/0/1具名GDI、nofilterChromium1823/0/77golden、source29/0、space183/0、材質來源79/0；獨立production81/81及ASan/UBSan81/81。postmerge新World P80/P81 37/0/exit0、288public/205vendor bytes+headers/runtimefresh核對過，全部own services停止。PR68既有binding來源guard draft8dc8159，完整1478/0/1與Chromium1823/0、trueUI16/0，未合併。\n\n保持open：本輪完成來源檢查的saved-model支承適配，**模型快照料單的計量範圍／實例去重／來源新鮮度完整adapter仍未交付**；不能以F1a adapter冒稱F4a全完成。F4b加工毛料／裁切／原材缺採納契約；具體提案三待決差異為鋸縫精度（int mm或明確有理精度）、末刀／既有可用端面的計刀、首版保存範圍。無部署、私圖上傳、本機或新公理。\n\n\n以下原正文保留原始需求與當時紀錄；其中過去「未實作／待核准／draft未合併」不代表目前狀態，最新精確事實以本文頂端為準。\n\n---\n\n路線總工單：#43。共用來源檢查：#44；候選方案：#46；新生成結果未來沿 #25 接入。基準 `4e90a1c89256a96ed28a7a1096c9ca627912fc91`。目前是提案，首版和後續加工範圍分開，未因建單核准庫存或採購操作。\n\n## 情境與建議原因\n\n使用者完成角材模型後，需要知道「要準備哪些料、每件完成長度多少、這一列在模型哪裡、尺寸來自哪個版本」。只有 3D 外觀不能直接回答這些問題。\n\n**不必等待 #25。**先以現有已正式放置的 Timber 產生清單，就能得到實用的第一版；規則與材料綁定本身還沒有實體，不得列成有料長的構件。\n\n## F4a：第一版完成尺寸料單\n\n最小操作：選明確承載面／角材集合 → 看逐件料單 → 點一列高亮並定位模型 → 從模型反查清單與來源 → 匯出相同資料的 CSV。\n\n每件資料至少包括：型別與穩定構件身分、所屬範圍、材料來源／固定版本或直接尺寸、A/B 與朝向、完成長度、可追溯的兩端關係及來源 revision/fingerprint。不存在的材料名稱、加工端型或規則關係，標未知或未設定，不能自行補成已知。\n\n- 一件一筆，彙總可合併顯示，但底下保留全部 member IDs；同長不同材料、不同已知加工需求不能混成同一料號。\n- 選擇範圍是明確物件集合或承載面，不是當前相機看得到的所有幾何；過濾不應靜默改變工程總量。\n- 讀取正式原生构件的完成尺寸，或明確標示版本的可追溯模型快照；不能從圖像、網格抽樣、任意 mesh 外接盒估長度。\n- 現行構件與模型快照可能是同一來源的兩種表示，不得重複計量。引用同一範本的兩個實際放置又不能被錯誤去重；先明確計量對象與實例鍵。\n- 料單是衍生結果，不是第二份可編輯的幾何真相。要改長度，回到來源走現有預覽／確認，再更新料單。\n- 可切換 cm 顯示，但保留精確 mm 與明確單位，不暗取整。失效、未生成、無法求值的項目列診斷，不能填 0 混進總數。\n- 匯出使用同一份已確認範圍的資料，帶來源／版本及單位；CSV 正確處理引號、換行及公式樣式名稱，避免在試算表中被當成指令。首版不需要另造 Excel 編輯器或報價系統。\n\n## 實作脈絡\n\n1. 原生 read／既有橋接資料中建立有型別的構件導出視圖；ID、截面、跨距與端面由原生資料提供，前端只格式化。\n2. 前端建立 list-row ↔ typed object reference 對照，沿用畫布／空間模型的選取及定位；過濾／排序不改物件身分。\n3. 在既有檢查器或模型工作區按需開清單，手機可先用單欄點選定位，不做第二張互不相通的模型。\n4. 以正式定義 revision/fingerprint 決定是否需要刷新；編輯候選與正式料單分開，不能把未確認預覽當成已施工清單。\n5. 先唯讀，和 #44 共用來源／過期狀態；若保存料單範圍或匯出紀錄，先定專案附件契約。生成器完成後只新增相應資料適配，不重寫料單。\n\n## F4b：後續加工／裁切與餘料計畫\n\n保留這個方向與理由，但不納入 F4a 完成宣稱：先有可核對的完成尺寸，再加施工準備，避免用排料結果回改設計。\n\n必須分開：**模型完成尺寸 → 加工毛料／裁切尺寸 → 購入原材尺寸**。\n\n輸入鋸縫、兩端修整、加工餘量、原材長度、可用餘料及不可混用的材料條件；缺條件就明示。先做可行的一維排料、每刀順序與剩料核對，再改善耗損，未證明最優就稱「本次找到的方案」。不得縮短模型或任意放大原材以求可排入。\n\n逐支原材的長度核算要包含毛料、實際鋸縫、修整與剩料，明確最後一刀是否需要及如何計數。餘料只有在使用者確認實際加工後才改庫存，預覽不能消耗原材；模型 undo 也不能把已經鋸掉的實物假復原。這層需要獨立加工狀態及契約。\n\n## 相依與程式接點\n\n`geometry-core/`／`web_bridge.c` 的正式 Timber 資料；`app.js` 與既有空間模型檢視；#44 的來源定位可共用但不要求其所有後續重建功能完成；#46 尚未實作時先用現有專案／範圍標記，不捏造方案 ID。#24 的資料正確性收尾持續追蹤。\n\n## F4a 待執行驗收\n\n- [ ] 用真正合法已放置角材建立清單，逐件身分、A/B、朝向、完成長度與原生讀回一致。\n- [ ] 點料單正確定位模型，反向亦然；篩選、排序及同名物件不錯配。\n- [ ] 同一構件的多種表示不重複計量；兩個獨立實例不因同範本／同長度而消失。\n- [ ] 未生成 Binding 不假造料長，無法求值或失效來源不以 0 代替；未知加工資訊明示。\n- [ ] 原生正式變更後清單更新，取消候選不改正式清單；舊快照標示版本而非混成現行。\n- [ ] CSV 與畫面逐件一致、單位精確、特殊名稱安全；匯出不修改 World／dirty／history。\n- [ ] 保存專案並以新狀態重開後可重新導出一致清單；任何新增附件保留相容性。\n- [ ] 桌面／390px 真操作、既有角材和模型回歸有同 SHA 證據。\n\nF4b 將另外驗材料相容、假設完整性、每刀與長度守恆、超長拒絕、餘料重用及實際加工確認；未做不得以料單已完成掩蓋。\n\n後續交付遵守 #43：正式 UI＋真資料＋必要保存＋測試同時交付，不只有表格 demo。新 API／schema 以選定切片後的契約為準，不因本提案放寬公理、啟用採購或安全宣稱。","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/47/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62","id":5687956312,"node_id":"I_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABUwdTWA","number":62,"title":"[網格子規則][SGR-05] 24項整合驗收、完整回歸、見證文件與可重現PR交付","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-03T08:30:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T21:19:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"總工單：#57。前置／整合對象：#58 契約、#59 核心、#60 保存、#61 正式UI。\n\n本單負責把各層接成同一個可操作功能，逐項驗收；不是只審查文件或沿用舊GEO-204／GEO-215測試數字。建單時所有新驗收均未執行，產品碼未因此開始修改。\n\n## 必須走過的正式流程\n\n使用隔離服務與真bridge：空白專案 → 建無限來源 → 新增U3/V2子規則 → 確認 → 選實際邊界頂點與主cell對齊 → 配置並套第一承載面 → 選子線／建立guide或合法角材引用 → 相同來源套第二面 → 改來源pitch → 看兩面及有限下游差異 → 取消，再重做確認 → 保存檔案 → 新上下文重開 → 復原／重做。\n\n另走指定負cell、規則碰到既有手動子格、L形／孔洞、面外零可見與大索引／大量cell。初始化支撐夾具可用API，但新增功能的關鍵建立／修改／引用／保存步驟必須由真UI操作驗證，不先用API做好再截圖。\n\n## 24項验收矩陣\n\n每列回填：test file/name、命令、結果與exit code、整合SHA、可核對artifact，以及未驗／人工狀態。以下是預期，不是已取得結果。\n\n| ID | 情境 | 應觀察到的結果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| SR01 | 空世界來源＋規則 | 無房間／邊界／承載面也可保存合法規則，沒有隱式面或材料 |\n| SR02 | 全格與指定格 | all-cells每格適用；指定cell只作用於該真實signedcell，不按視窗序號 |\n| SR03 | 600×400 U3/V2 | 相對內線U200/400、V200，六個200×200小格；改900後U300/600 |\n| SR04 | 面材＋縫 | panel915+gap2以pitch917分7份，每份131，不錯用915 |\n| SR05 | 非整數／非法等分 | 600/7、0、66、1/1等因指定理由拒絕，不取整且完整dump不變 |\n| SR06 | 不支援的來源 | 缺一軸、legacy-finite、stagger、遞迴子規則拒絕，既有來源本身不被偷偷改寫 |\n| SR07 | 負索引與邊界 | 正負cell、整數除法及父格邊定位正確，子線不重複父邊 |\n| SR08 | 超2^53索引 | 使用可相對求值的binding夾具；JSON及保存全程字串，無Number精度損失 |\n| SR09 | L形、凹口、孔 | 可見段／標籤／命中／定位預示按C∩F裁切，不以外接框冒充實際面 |\n| SR10 | 指定cell在面外 | 規則與身分保留，零可見段明示；舊手動子格正面積守門不放寬 |\n| SR11 | 大量父cell | 超過4096個可涉父cell仍非逐格建立World物件，舊16組容量不被無限族耗盡 |\n| SR12 | exact／sample／選格 | 精確查詢過限明報、抽樣明示不完整；選格及單格聚焦使用真實格距／索引 |\n| SR13 | 規則及手動子格衝突 | all與single、同cell兩規則、手動子格雙向衝突皆拒絕並定位，不最後輸入者勝出 |\n| SR14 | 規則身分生命週期 | 改名／重排不改key；create不覆蓋、草稿不撞號、刪除重建不冒充舊rule |\n| SR15 | 兩配置／兩面共源 | 同一rule被兩處繼承；來源pitch／參數／錨點更新經預覽完整重算，不複製失聯數字 |\n| SR16 | 只一面下游非法 | 一處違規則整筆不提交，其他面不能先改；預覽指名真正失敗來源與構件 |\n| SR17 | 引用保護與換來源 | 被引用rule的divisions／selector／刪除受守門；不同system同號ruleKey不能接住舊引用 |\n| SR18 | guide與直接放材 | guide僅引用軸座標；直接at-line完整footprint留在父cell，仍需真支撐／正確角色；無自動生成材料 |\n| SR19 | 草稿與未失焦输入 | 未提交／未填／不合法輸入按草稿schema保存重開，不自動提交，也不假稱World已套用 |\n| SR20 | 真正保存與新上下文重開 | 完整來源閉包、穩定key／高水位、配置／套用、signed索引與複合線引用一致 |\n| SR21 | 格式／能力負例 | 假舊version、移除required capability、缺source、服務不支持，在替換World前拒絕 |\n| SR22 | 交易／歷史／跨案 | 確認、取消、過期token、undo/redo、遲到／遺失回覆及切專案無部分更新／重複提交／串資料 |\n| SR23 | 桌面與390px真操作 | 從空白完成規則、配置、引用、來源修改及保存；滑鼠／鍵盤等效，無遮擋或選取錯位 |\n| SR24 | 實體手機與OS流程 | 實機觸控、鍵盤、選檔與下載位置分別人工記錄；桌面窄版／選檔替身不能代替 |\n\nSR11／12要有工作量或資源有界的斷言與實測記錄，不只憑一次很快的截圖判定可擴展。SR18的角色負例要先有合法支撐，避免測試實際只抓到較早的缺支撐錯誤。SR24未驗可保留待實機驗收版本，但不得寫全平台完成或把剩餘項自動關掉。\n\n## 完整回歸與工具紀律\n\n接手先核對最新AGENTS／tests/README／package.json與所有進行中PR，記錄HEAD及二進位來源指紋。使用獨立服務埠／暫存輸出和GEOMETRY_FEEDBACK_DIR，不連使用者原服務執行reset，不修改原始feedback。\n\n必跑並記錄實際結果：\n- 新原生規則、typed refs、交易與容量測試，既有subgrid／infinite-grid／grid-system／reference／datum／parameter／engineering／bridge及場景往返。\n- 新Node草稿／完整專案／能力預驗／歷史測試，按repo登記進tests/run_all.py，完整非瀏覽器入口跑一次，不用--only或更新expected掩蓋缺測。\n- 真瀏覽器完整geometry-web/cdp_test.js不帶ONLY/filter，新工作流確實被載入。動到空間工作區再跑space_model_test.js；model-base／modeling相容路徑亦需核對。\n- 新原生路徑的ASan/UBSan；Windows編譯／GDI與實機限制分別記，不把環境blocked或skip寫成pass。\n- 公理正式採納後：sync_axiom_reader.py、其--check、tests/test_axiom_reader.py三道都跑，並更新必要白話、見證及導讀。不能只把模型AXIOM_SHA256改掉就宣称支援新語意。\n\n開發過程可先跑局部；最終所有重要證據對應同一個整合SHA，不能拿舊版核心、另一分支UI或歷史CI數字混搭。\n\n## 故障注入／mutation 必要反證\n\n在隔離測試build至少刻意破壞以下幾項，證明對應測試真的變紅，恢復正式版本後重跑：\n1. 略過整除檢查或暗中取整。\n2. 保存／重開時丟棄rules／來源身分。\n3. 省略systemId而把同號ruleKey錯配。\n4. 規則線不裁父cell／孔，或把抽樣序號當真索引。\n5. 漏驗第二面依賴或跳過過期token／能力預驗。\n\n記錄預期失敗原因；編譯失敗、服務沒開、測試未發現、環境受阻不算成功抓到該缺陷。\n\n## PR 與實際交付\n\n- 一份由正式流程生成的非機密.gcanvas：共用來源、兩配置／面、合法規則線引用、未套用來源及草稿；另附必要.scene與負例。\n- 使用者入口／操作步驟、真桌面／390px截圖、console結果、實際啟動與建置命令、已核對版本。\n- 更新既有GRID-SYSTEM.md、SUBGRID.md、DOM-CONTRACT、BACKLOG及必要驗收文件，不建立第二套閱讀器／保存系統。清楚列出SGR-04實際合併／移除的UI項目。\n- 工單→程式→測試→artifact對照，branch、commit、PR與實際CI連結；私人暫存路徑不能是唯一證據。\n- 列出未實作／未驗證／不在V1的項目。多層巢狀、錯縫子格、跨cell區域、override與 #25 實體生成不因本期通過而宣稱完成。\n\n## 關單條件\n\n- [ ] #58–#61 結果接到同一正式app與真核心，不只有分離模組或mock。\n- [ ] SR01–SR23逐項證據、完整回歸、負例／mutation及正式保存重開可重現。\n- [ ] SR24實機狀態如實记录並保留未驗追蹤。\n- [ ] 新能力／格式與模型相容有直接證據，來源及現有手動子格不被破壞。\n- [ ] 可操作版本、非機密範例、文件、測試和供審查PR交付；不直接合併main或部署。\n\n總工單 #57 不使用Closes自動關閉；先Refs，待範圍及證據由專案擁有者核對。建立工單不等於已指派agent，接手與完成回報需真實列出執行者／分支／結果。\n\n<!-- continuation-work-package:start -->\n## 2026-10-03 後續規格與20:54品質狀態\n[Draft PR88](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/88)，完整規格reviewhead `e01d0941fb7baf979cebdf73d8bf2c980d6b814e`；品質／實圖歷史follow-up最終文件head `0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee`，文件基底main `9ebf52a1b6519356e9ff677e55b9cf167c47b70d`。PR75 firstbatch已由外部合併，文件merge不等於Q31–Q37採納。\n\nWP62 SR01–24 finiteoracle/native/保存/lifecycle/正式真UI逐项接線，newtests全部未跑；samefinalhead/freshbinary/full CDP最後整合，SR24真實機分列。\n\n**最新優先缺陷狀態**：#78/P1、#79/P2匯入、#80/P2來源定位已由品質owner在9ebf52a真native/Chromium獨立reproduced；root已分派assembly-quality/import/navigation三位隔離產品owner修復中，不是僅排隊，勿另派重做。最新版a274cae尚未重跑這三反例；root另回報PR76合併fullCDP1900/native1551，不能替代缺陷修復驗收。調查exit0代表成功重現，require-contract gate exit1代表未修缺口；本文件worker沒有跑這些產品測試，也未改產品。\n\n[13項工作包](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-WORK-PACKAGES-20261003.md)／[Q31–Q37決策](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/CONTINUATION-DECISIONS-20261003.md)／[#58逐條proposal](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-core/GRID-SUBDIVISION-RULES-PROPOSAL.md)／[優先缺陷、owner與A→B→C](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/blob/0800d26d7061c7f602a887f42185b623d83881ee/geometry-guide/PROJECT-REVIEW-QUEUE-20261004.md)。\n\n本worker實際：6Markdown、87相對連結/錨點、13包/7未採納決策/9缺陷/2匿名實圖狀態校驗exit0，git diff --check exit0；公理/AGENTS/current_geometry.c/正典閱讀器bytes unchanged。完整規格e01由兩位read-only独立審查通過；follow-up增加品質狀態、已指定scope及CaseA舊版失敗歷史／新baseline待驗分界，產品不變。私人PDF留Library；REAL-PDF-01/CaseA本地0f3c1a6已匯入/323.5cm校準成功，預設vector/image edge-open及width0.1 tooManySegments失敗，geometry不變/0 exceptions，root核對原bytes一致；保留歷史。newhead snap/人工分區/整屋/新main重跑未驗，REAL-PDF-02/CaseB各階段未驗；#47雙向定位取消。本worker不自動關閉issue，Refs不用Closes；本worker無PR merge/部署。\n<!-- continuation-work-package:end -->\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/62/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}